@@ -311,3 +226,141 @@ msgid ""
 msgstr ""
 "仓库测试放置和注册规则记录在\n"
 "[测试指南](../contribution/testing.md) 中。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Model Runner V2 on Ascend uses the upstream vLLM Expert Parallelism Load\n"
+"Balancer (EPLB) control plane and adds a small Ascend-specific integration\n"
+"plane. Upstream code owns load windows, policy execution, placement state, and\n"
+"the rearrangement transaction. vLLM Ascend owns device routing, executed-load\n"
+"recording, quantized expert-weight views, and the asynchronous movement\n"
+"adapter (HIXL by default, Gloo CPU staging as fallback)."
+msgstr ""
+"昇腾上的 Model Runner V2 使用上游 vLLM "
+"专家并行负载均衡器（EPLB）控制面，并增加了一个小型的昇腾专用集成面。上游代码负责负载窗口、策略执行、放置状态以及重排事务。vLLM Ascend "
+"负责设备路由、已执行负载记录、量化专家权重视图以及异步搬运适配器（默认使用 HIXL，回退使用 Gloo CPU 暂存）。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- The **control plane** decides where each logical expert is placed and when\n"
+"  the placement changes. Its source of truth is the upstream `EplbState`.\n"
+"- The **data plane** maps each token's logical expert choice to the physical\n"
+"  expert installed on the local rank, runs fused MoE, and records the experts\n"
+"  that actually executed.\n"
+"- The **movement plane** exposes the real quantized expert storage and moves it\n"
+"  through the upstream rearrangement transaction with a background movement\n"
+"  worker; the model-runner thread commits completed layers between forwards."
+msgstr ""
+"- **控制面**决定每个逻辑专家的放置位置以及放置何时发生变化。其唯一事实来源是上游的 `EplbState`。\n"
+"- **数据面**将每个 token 的逻辑专家选择映射到本地 rank 上安装的物理专家，运行融合 MoE，并记录实际执行过的专家。\n"
+"- **搬运面**暴露真实的量化专家存储，并通过后台搬运 worker 借助上游重排事务对其进行搬运；model-runner 线程在前向计算之间提交已完成的层。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `AscendHixlEplbCommunicator` | Default upstream asynchronous communicator:"
+" receiver-initiated one-sided reads between NPU memory regions registered "
+"with the HIXL engine |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `AscendHixlEplbCommunicator` | 默认的上游异步通信器：在已注册到 HIXL 引擎的 NPU "
+"内存区域之间进行接收方发起的一方读取 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `AscendGlooEplbCommunicator` | Fallback communicator: upstream "
+"asynchronous contract implemented with CPU staging over Gloo |"
+msgstr "| `AscendGlooEplbCommunicator` | 回退通信器：通过 Gloo 上的 CPU 暂存实现的上游异步契约 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Platform patch | Capability adaptation, communicator selection consensus, "
+"and the narrow construction/commit hooks not exposed by upstream |"
+msgstr "| 平台补丁 | 能力适配、通信器选择共识，以及上游未暴露的少量构造/提交钩子 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"When an upstream load window closes, vLLM's default policy calculates a new\n"
+"placement and the upstream asynchronous worker moves the changed layers'\n"
+"expert weights through the selected transport. The model-runner thread\n"
+"installs each published layer, commits its placement, and refreshes the\n"
+"device lookup before acknowledging the receive workspace. Routing never\n"
+"observes a lookup for an uncommitted placement."
+msgstr ""
+"当上游负载窗口关闭时，vLLM 的默认策略会计算新的放置方案，上游异步 worker 通过所选传输方式搬运发生变化层的专家权重。model-runner"
+" 线程安装每个已发布的层，提交其放置方案，并在确认接收工作区之前刷新设备查找表。路由永远不会观察到未提交放置方案的查找。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The movement plane has two communicators implementing the upstream\n"
+"asynchronous communicator interface:"
+msgstr "搬运面有两个通信器实现上游异步通信器接口："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `AscendHixlEplbCommunicator` (default): receiver-initiated one-sided reads\n"
+"  between NPU memory regions registered with the HIXL engine. Participating\n"
+"  expert weights and receive buffers from all models are registered as aligned,\n"
+"  merged live tensor ranges. One state-owned HIXL session holds their underlying\n"
+"  storage until deregistration succeeds. Unrelated allocator growth does not\n"
+"  change these registrations. Each session supports up to 4000 merged regions\n"
+"  across all participating models; larger sets fail before backend registration.\n"
+"- `AscendGlooEplbCommunicator` (fallback): CPU-staged P2P over Gloo with\n"
+"  pinned staging buffers."
+msgstr ""
+"- `AscendHixlEplbCommunicator`（默认）：在已注册到 HIXL 引擎的 NPU 内存区域之间进行接收方发起的一方读取。所有模型中参与的专家权重和接收缓冲区都注册为对齐、合并的活跃张量范围。一个由状态持有的 HIXL 会话持有其底层存储，直到注销成功。无关的分配器增长不会改变这些注册。每个会话在所有参与模型中最多支持 4000 个合并区域；更大的集合会在后端注册之前失败。\n"
+"- `AscendGlooEplbCommunicator`（回退）：基于 Gloo 的 CPU 暂存 P2P，使用固定暂存缓冲区。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Communicator selection is a two-stage consensus. The config stage probes each\n"
+"rank locally and records a provisional choice; the EPLB controller then\n"
+"reduces the per-rank bindings (official `hixl` package, vllm_ascend ctypes\n"
+"binding, or none) across the EPLB group before the policy or state is built.\n"
+"The group uses HIXL only when every rank resolves the same binding class; a\n"
+"missing or differing binding degrades the whole group to Gloo and clamps the\n"
+"STAIR migration limits the user left unset (explicitly configured limits are\n"
+"preserved with a warning). An explicit `communicator` setting skips the\n"
+"consensus. HIXL initialization or runtime failures fail fast instead of\n"
+"falling back mid-flight: ranks may disagree on transfer progress and live\n"
+"slots may already be in transition (see\n"
+"[RFC #17572](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/17572))."
+msgstr ""
+"通信器选择是一个两阶段共识。配置阶段在本地探测每个 rank 并记录一个临时选择；随后 EPLB 控制器在构建策略或状态之前，在 EPLB 组内对各 rank 的绑定（官方 `hixl` 包、vllm_ascend ctypes 绑定或无绑定）进行归约。只有当每个 rank 解析出相同的绑定类别时，该组才使用 HIXL；绑定缺失或不一致会将整个组降级为 Gloo，并钳制用户未设置的 STAIR 迁移限制（显式配置的限制会保留并给出警告）。显式设置 `communicator` 会跳过共识。HIXL 初始化或运行时失败会快速失败，而不是在运行中途回退：各 rank 可能对传输进度产生分歧，且活跃槽位可能已处于转换中（参见\n"
+"[RFC #17572](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/17572)）。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Initialization confirms engine creation, registration, metadata exchange, "
+"and connection across ranks. Explicit shutdown drains every submitted "
+"request, disconnects peers, confirms that incoming connections are gone, "
+"deregisters memory, and finalizes the engine. Failed cleanup, including "
+"initialization rollback, retains the remaining handles and storage on a "
+"fatal exception chain and terminates the worker before registered memory is "
+"released."
+msgstr ""
+"初始化会确认引擎创建、注册、元数据交换以及各 rank "
+"之间的连接。显式关闭会排空每个已提交的请求、断开对端连接、确认传入连接已消失、注销内存并最终化引擎。清理失败（包括初始化回滚）会在致命异常链上保留剩余的句柄和存储，并在释放已注册内存之前终止"
+" worker。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Only asynchronous EPLB is supported. The upstream worker publishes one layer\n"
+"at a time and waits for the model-runner thread to acknowledge consumption\n"
+"before reusing the receive workspace. The Ascend commit adapter delays that\n"
+"acknowledgement until the layer's device lookup has been refreshed."
+msgstr ""
+"仅支持异步 EPLB。上游 worker 一次发布一个层，并等待 model-runner "
+"线程确认消费后才复用接收工作区。昇腾提交适配器会延迟该确认，直到该层的设备查找表已刷新。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Upstream placement state is the only source of truth for Model Runner V2.\n"
+"2. Expert selection runs once; quantized compute consumes physical expert IDs.\n"
+"3. The device lookup changes only after the corresponding placement commits.\n"
+"4. Load is recorded in the physical expert ID space by the graph-safe routing\n"
+"   operation and excludes padding.\n"
+"5. Weight movement updates the exact storage used by the active quantized\n"
+"   kernel.\n"
+"6. The worker does not reuse transfer workspace before the main thread\n"
+"   commits the layer and refreshes routing.\n"
+"7. Unsupported modes fail during initialization instead of silently degrading.\n"
+"8. EPLB-disabled execution and the Model Runner V1 EPLB path remain isolated.\n"
+"9. The routing hot path avoids host loops, device-to-host synchronization, and\n"
+"   mutable Python mapping work."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 上游放置状态是 Model Runner V2 的唯一事实来源。\n"
+"2. 专家选择只运行一次；量化计算消费物理专家 ID。\n"
+"3. 设备查找表仅在对应放置方案提交后才发生变化。\n"
+"4. 负载由图安全的路由操作记录在物理专家 ID 空间中，并排除填充。\n"
+"5. 权重搬运会更新活跃量化内核所使用的确切存储。\n"
+"6. 在主线程提交该层并刷新路由之前，worker 不会复用传输工作区。\n"
+"7. 不支持的模式会在初始化期间失败，而不是静默降级。\n"
+"8. 禁用 EPLB 的执行与 Model Runner V1 EPLB 路径保持隔离。\n"
+"9. 路由热路径避免主机循环、设备到主机的同步以及可变的 Python 映射操作。"
