+msgid "# Persistent Incremental Csrc Build Cache"
+msgstr "# 持久化增量 Csrc 构建缓存"
+
+msgid "## Overview"
+msgstr "## 概述"
+
+msgid ""
+"vLLM Ascend builds native third-party libraries and many AscendC custom\n"
+"operators. An exact final-artifact cache is fast when it matches, but any\n"
+"source change invalidates the complete artifact. The persistent incremental\n"
+"csrc cache adds a second level that reuses individual compiler actions across\n"
+"CI jobs, workspaces, and repeated local source builds."
+msgstr ""
+"vLLM Ascend 会构建原生第三方库以及众多 AscendC "
+"自定义算子。精确的最终产物缓存在命中时速度很快，但任何源码变更都会使整个产物失效。持久化增量 csrc 缓存增加了第二层，可在 CI "
+"任务、工作区以及重复的本地源码构建之间复用单个编译动作。"
+
+msgid "The two cache levels have different roles:"
+msgstr "这两级缓存具有不同的职责："
+
+msgid ""
+"The source build remains authoritative. L1 only replaces an equivalent action\n"
+"with previously verified artifacts."
+msgstr "源码构建仍然是权威来源。L1 仅使用先前已验证的产物替换等价的动作。"
+
+msgid "## Goals and non-goals"
+msgstr "## 目标与非目标"
+
+msgid "Goals:"
+msgstr "目标："
+
+msgid ""
+"- reuse native build work across CI jobs;\n"
+"- reuse native build work across repeated local source builds without remote\n"
+"  transport;\n"
+"- invalidate only actions whose semantic inputs changed;\n"
+"- reuse entries across equivalent checkout and build roots;\n"
+"- persist local entries through the repository's cache transport;\n"
+"- publish artifacts safely under concurrent builds; and\n"
+"- degrade to an ordinary build when an optional cache layer is unavailable."
+msgstr ""
+"- 在 CI 任务之间复用原生构建工作；\n"
+"- 在重复的本地源码构建之间复用原生构建工作，且无需远程传输；\n"
+"- 仅使语义输入发生变化的动作失效；\n"
+"- 在等价的检出根目录与构建根目录之间复用条目；\n"
+"- 通过仓库的缓存传输机制持久化本地条目；\n"
+"- 在并发构建下安全地发布产物；以及\n"
+"- 当可选缓存层不可用时降级为普通构建。"
+
+msgid "Non-goals:"
+msgstr "非目标："
+
+msgid ""
+"- replacing compiler dependency tracking;\n"
+"- replacing the L0 final-artifact cache;\n"
+"- sharing file locks across physical nodes;\n"
+"- requiring historical source snapshots to contain the cache engine; or\n"
+"- migrating older cache schemas in place."
+msgstr ""
+"- 替换编译器依赖跟踪；\n"
+"- 替换 L0 最终产物缓存；\n"
+"- 跨物理节点共享文件锁；\n"
+"- 要求历史源码快照包含缓存引擎；或\n"
+"- 就地迁移旧版缓存模式。"
+
+msgid "## Architecture"
+msgstr "## 架构"
+
+msgid ""
+"`build_cache.py` owns local action identity, entries, locking, restoration,\n"
+"and publication. CMake declares semantic inputs and invokes the engine.\n"
+"Composite actions own persistent snapshot keys and OBS transport. Workflows\n"
+"only decide where to restore and which trusted build roles may publish."
+msgstr ""
+"`build_cache.py` 负责本地动作标识、条目、加锁、恢复与发布。CMake 声明语义输入并调用该引擎。复合动作负责持久化快照键与 OBS "
+"传输。工作流仅决定从何处恢复以及哪些受信任的构建角色可以发布。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The two levels have separate correctness boundaries. L0 is the outer exact\n"
+"final-artifact snapshot: a hit can skip the native build only when its full\n"
+"artifact key matches. L1 is an outer persistent snapshot of the local action\n"
+"cache. Restoring an L1 snapshot only makes candidate entries available; the\n"
+"inner engine still validates each manifest, action key, schema, artifact model,\n"
+"and artifact contents before accepting an entry. An L1 hit therefore never\n"
+"overrides inner correctness, and an L1 miss never changes the correctness of a\n"
+"normal source build."
+msgstr ""
+"这两级缓存具有各自独立的正确性边界。L0 是外层的精确最终产物快照：只有当完整的产物键匹配时，命中才能跳过原生构建。L1 "
+"是本地动作缓存的外层持久化快照。恢复 L1 快照仅使候选条目可用；内部引擎在接受条目之前仍会校验每个清单、动作键、模式、产物模型以及产物内容。因此，L1"
+" 命中绝不会覆盖内部正确性，L1 未命中也不会改变普通源码构建的正确性。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The existing image-build L0 key uses architecture, base-image tag, and the\n"
+"tracked csrc hash. Because an L0 hit skips compilation and therefore skips L1\n"
+"entry validation, that key assumes a fixed compiler-image registry and\n"
+"immutable tags. Changing the registry or republishing a tag with different\n"
+"contents requires a new L0 key namespace or the full image identity in the\n"
+"key; an L1 identity check cannot make an already accepted L0 artifact safe.\n"
+"This PR does not change image-build L0 behavior or add L1 to Docker builds."
+msgstr ""
+"现有的镜像构建 L0 键使用架构、基础镜像标签以及受跟踪的 csrc 哈希。由于 L0 命中会跳过编译，从而跳过 L1 "
+"条目校验，因此该键假定编译器镜像仓库固定且标签不可变。更改仓库或重新发布内容不同的标签，需要新的 L0 键命名空间或在键中包含完整的镜像标识；L1 "
+"标识检查无法使已被接受的 L0 产物变得安全。本 PR 不改变镜像构建的 L0 行为，也不为 Docker 构建添加 L1。"
+
+msgid "## Build flow"
+msgstr "## 构建流程"
+
+msgid "### Cold build"
+msgstr "### 冷构建"
+
+msgid "### Warm build"
+msgstr "### 热构建"
+
+msgid ""
+"An all-HIT build does not recreate `.updated`, so it does not publish another\n"
+"unique remote snapshot."
+msgstr "全部命中的构建不会重新创建 `.updated`，因此不会发布另一个唯一的远程快照。"
+
+msgid "## Cache identity"
+msgstr "## 缓存标识"
+
+msgid "Each action key is the canonical hash of three independent identities:"
+msgstr "每个动作键是三个独立标识的规范哈希："
+
+msgid ""
+"For custom operators, `operator_text_hash` provides the operator namespace. It\n"
+"does not replace any of the three action-key components."
+msgstr "对于自定义算子，`operator_text_hash` 提供算子命名空间。它不会替换三个动作键组成部分中的任何一个。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The entry manifest stores the hashes and the exact artifact model used by the\n"
+"key. A HIT requires the expected schema, domain, action key, artifact model,\n"
+"and verified artifact content."
+msgstr "条目清单存储哈希以及该键所使用的确切产物模型。命中要求模式、域、动作键、产物模型以及已验证的产物内容均符合预期。"
+
+msgid "## Prepared-input contract"
+msgstr "## 预处理输入契约"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prepared inputs include all compiler-visible semantic content, including:"
+msgstr "预处理输入包含所有编译器可见的语义内容，包括："
+
+msgid ""
+"- generated operator sources;\n"
+"- dependent generated sources;\n"
+"- shared kernel sources;\n"
+"- compiler-visible recipe files; and\n"
+"- shared compatibility headers such as `cann_compat.h`."
+msgstr ""
+"- 生成的算子源码；\n"
+"- 依赖的生成源码；\n"
+"- 共享内核源码；\n"
+"- 编译器可见的配方文件；以及\n"
+"- 共享兼容性头文件，例如 `cann_compat.h`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Physical checkout and build roots are not semantic identity. UTF-8 text may\n"
+"therefore normalize explicitly declared roots. A root may be normalized only\n"
+"when every semantic object referenced through it is independently covered by\n"
+"the action identity."
+msgstr ""
+"物理检出根目录与构建根目录不属于语义标识。因此，UTF-8 "
+"文本可以规范化显式声明的根目录。仅当通过某个根目录引用的每个语义对象都被动作标识独立覆盖时，该根目录才可以被规范化。"
+
+msgid "For example, a generated adapter can contain:"
+msgstr "例如，生成的适配器可以包含："
+
+msgid ""
+"The temporary root is normalized, while `cann_compat.h` content is hashed as a\n"
+"prepared input. Moving the workspace remains a HIT; changing the header is a\n"
+"MISS."
+msgstr "临时根目录会被规范化，而 `cann_compat.h` 内容会作为预处理输入进行哈希。移动工作区仍为命中；更改该头文件则为未命中。"
+
+msgid "The normalization contract is deliberately narrow:"
+msgstr "规范化契约被刻意限定得很窄："
+
+msgid ""
+"- UTF-8 text replaces only explicit normalize roots at path-component\n"
+"  boundaries;\n"
+"- unrelated backslashes in source code, escapes, and regular expressions remain\n"
+"  byte-sensitive;\n"
+"- binary inputs remain raw-byte-sensitive;\n"
+"- paths outside explicit roots remain sensitive; and\n"
+"- symlink identity and resolved semantic content both participate in hashing."
+msgstr ""
+"- UTF-8 文本仅在路径组件边界处替换显式的规范化根目录；\n"
+"- 源码、转义以及正则表达式中无关的反斜杠仍保持字节敏感；\n"
+"- 二进制输入仍保持原始字节敏感；\n"
+"- 显式根目录之外的路径仍保持敏感；以及\n"
+"- 符号链接标识与解析后的语义内容均参与哈希。"
+
+msgid ""
+"An unreadable explicit semantic input is never silently omitted from "
+"identity."
+msgstr "不可读的显式语义输入绝不会被静默地从标识中省略。"
+
+msgid "## Recipe and compiler environment"
+msgstr "## 配方与编译器环境"
+
+msgid ""
+"The recipe identity covers compiler commands, recipe files, and explicit\n"
+"recipe values after the same root normalization contract. `--set-env` compiler\n"
+"overrides also participate, using their exact values: an override may point to\n"
+"an input not otherwise covered by the prepared-input identity."
+msgstr ""
+"配方标识在经过相同的根目录规范化契约后，涵盖编译器命令、配方文件以及显式配方值。`--set-env` "
+"编译器覆盖项也参与其中，并使用其确切值：某个覆盖项可能指向未被预处理输入标识覆盖的输入。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The compiler-environment identity covers the host platform, selected compiler\n"
+"profile, tool version output, CANN metadata, and explicit environment values.\n"
+"Absolute compiler installation paths are not semantic when the reported tool\n"
+"identity is equal."
+msgstr ""
+"编译器环境标识涵盖主机平台、所选的编译器配置、工具版本输出、CANN 元数据以及显式环境值。当所报告的工具标识相等时，编译器的绝对安装路径不具有语义。"
+
+msgid "### CMake integration contract"
+msgstr "### CMake 集成契约"
+
+msgid ""
+"`vllm_ascend_build_cache_command()` is a correctness-sensitive boundary, not\n"
+"only a command wrapper. A caller that changes a compiler-visible input must\n"
+"update the matching identity group in the same change:"
+msgstr ""
+"`vllm_ascend_build_cache_command()` "
+"是一个对正确性敏感的边界，而不仅仅是命令包装器。更改编译器可见输入的调用方必须在同一次变更中更新匹配的标识组："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `PREPARED_INPUT` describes source, generated, dependent, and shared content;\n"
+"- `RECIPE_FILE` and `RECIPE_VALUE` describe how that content is built;\n"
+"- `SET_ENV` changes the compiler process environment and must remain in recipe\n"
+"  identity whenever its value can affect the output;\n"
+"- `ENVIRONMENT_FILE`, `ENVIRONMENT_VALUE`, and `ENVIRONMENT_TOOL` describe the\n"
+"  compiler/toolkit environment; and\n"
+"- `NORMALIZE_PATH` removes only a physical location whose referenced semantic\n"
+"  content is already covered by one of those identity groups."
+msgstr ""
+"- `PREPARED_INPUT` 描述源内容、生成内容、依赖内容以及共享内容；\n"
+"- `RECIPE_FILE` 和 `RECIPE_VALUE` 描述这些内容是如何构建的；\n"
+"- `SET_ENV` 会改变编译器进程环境，只要其值可能影响输出，就必须保留在 recipe\n"
+"  标识中；\n"
+"- `ENVIRONMENT_FILE`、`ENVIRONMENT_VALUE` 和 `ENVIRONMENT_TOOL` 描述\n"
+"  编译器/工具链环境；以及\n"
+"- `NORMALIZE_PATH` 仅移除那些其引用的语义内容已被上述某个标识组覆盖的物理位置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Removing or omitting an identity argument can cause a false HIT. Adding a\n"
+"non-semantic physical path can cause avoidable cross-workspace misses. Changes\n"
+"to the custom-operator generation inputs or the protobuf\n"
+"`ExternalProject_Add()` command therefore require a cache-identity review."
+msgstr ""
+"移除或省略某个标识参数可能导致误命中（false HIT）。添加非语义的物理路径可能导致本可避免的跨工作区未命中。因此，对自定义算子生成输入或 protobuf\n"
+"`ExternalProject_Add()` 命令的更改都需要进行缓存标识审查。"
+
+msgid "## Schema and snapshot compatibility"
+msgstr "## Schema 与快照兼容性"
+
+msgid ""
+"Entry manifests use `SCHEMA_VERSION = 4`. Schema 4 introduced safe textual\n"
+"prepared-input normalization and complete semantic coverage for normalized\n"
+"paths. Older entries naturally miss because the persistent key contains the\n"
+"schema and entry validation rejects a different schema. There is no in-place\n"
+"migration: the first schema-4 build is cold and later builds are warm."
+msgstr ""
+"条目清单使用 `SCHEMA_VERSION = 4`。Schema 4 引入了安全的文本化\n"
+"预处理输入规范化，以及对规范化路径的完整语义覆盖。较旧的条目自然会未命中，因为持久化键中包含 schema，且条目校验会拒绝不同的 schema。不存在原地\n"
+"迁移：首次 schema-4 构建为冷构建，后续构建为热构建。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Schema 4 is the first production namespace for this cache. Pre-release local or\n"
+"validation snapshots written by earlier schema-4 candidates are not production\n"
+"compatible and must remain isolated from the production namespace. Any future\n"
+"change that can map an old semantic input to a different meaning requires a\n"
+"schema or identity revision rather than reusing those entries."
+msgstr ""
+"Schema 4 是该缓存的首个生产命名空间。由更早的 schema-4 候选版本写入的预发布本地或\n"
+"验证快照与生产环境不兼容，必须与生产命名空间保持隔离。任何未来可能将旧的语义输入映射为不同含义的\n"
+"更改，都需要进行 schema 或标识修订，而不能复用那些条目。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`PUBLISH_STATE_SCHEMA` is separate because build-tree artifact ownership is a\n"
+"different format from persistent entry identity."
+msgstr ""
+"`PUBLISH_STATE_SCHEMA` 是独立的，因为构建树产物所有权与持久化条目标识是\n"
+"不同的格式。"
+
+msgid "The snapshot key command has one compatibility model:"
+msgstr "快照键命令只有一种兼容性模型："
+
+msgid ""
+"The restore action adds the tracked csrc hash and a unique publication suffix.\n"
+"Both producer and consumer keys therefore come from the same implementation.\n"
+"An explicit compiler image takes precedence over the outer runner environment,\n"
+"so a Docker build is keyed by the environment that actually compiles csrc.\n"
+"Direct builds include the runtime OS/libc identity to keep host-built artifacts\n"
+"from crossing incompatible system-header or ABI boundaries."
+msgstr ""
+"恢复操作会添加被跟踪的 csrc 哈希以及唯一的发布后缀。\n"
+"因此，生产者键和消费者键都来自同一实现。\n"
+"显式的编译器镜像优先于外层 runner 环境，\n"
+"因此 Docker 构建以实际编译 csrc 的环境作为键。\n"
+"直接构建会包含运行时 OS/libc 标识，以防止主机构建的产物\n"
+"跨越不兼容的系统头文件或 ABI 边界。"
+
+msgid "### Prepare, restore, and save actions"
+msgstr "### 准备、恢复和保存操作"
+
+msgid ""
+"`prepare_csrc_l1_restore.py` is the shared key-preparation helper. It checks\n"
+"that the tested source root contains the cache engine, derives the tracked csrc\n"
+"hash when the caller did not provide one, computes the snapshot key, and exports\n"
+"the cache directory and event-log paths. Unsupported or unidentifiable source\n"
+"snapshots return `supported=false` so the caller can continue with a normal\n"
+"build."
+msgstr ""
+"`prepare_csrc_l1_restore.py` 是共享的键准备辅助脚本。它会检查\n"
+"被测源码根目录是否包含缓存引擎，在调用方未提供时推导被跟踪的 csrc\n"
+"哈希，计算快照键，并导出缓存目录和事件日志路径。不受支持或无法识别的源码\n"
+"快照会返回 `supported=false`，以便调用方继续执行正常的\n"
+"构建。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`.github/actions/csrc-l1-restore/action.yaml` invokes the helper, restores the\n"
+"keyed outer snapshot with compatibility prefixes, and removes `.updated` before\n"
+"the build. `.github/actions/csrc-l1-save/action.yaml` publishes only when the\n"
+"caller supplies a primary key, the local cache contains `.updated`, and trusted\n"
+"writer credentials are present. The local engine creates `.updated` only after\n"
+"an entry is newly saved or replaced; an all-hit build consequently does not\n"
+"republish an unchanged snapshot. Restore and save transport failures are\n"
+"availability failures and remain fail-open. A missing or unparsable manifest,\n"
+"or a manifest object that fails schema or artifact validation, is a MISS and is\n"
+"rebuilt. Conflicts that could corrupt shared artifact publication or\n"
+"synchronization fail the build. A JSON manifest with a non-object top level\n"
+"currently raises during validation; it is not covered by the MISS fallback."
+msgstr ""
+"`.github/actions/csrc-l1-restore/action.yaml` 会调用该辅助脚本，使用兼容性前缀恢复\n"
+"带键的外层快照，并在构建前移除 `.updated`。`.github/actions/csrc-l1-save/action.yaml` 仅在\n"
+"调用方提供主键、本地缓存包含 `.updated` 且存在受信任的\n"
+"写入者凭据时才会发布。本地引擎仅在条目被新保存或替换后才创建 `.updated`；因此全命中的构建不会\n"
+"重新发布未更改的快照。恢复和保存的传输失败属于\n"
+"可用性失败，保持 fail-open。清单缺失或无法解析，\n"
+"或清单对象未通过 schema 或产物校验，均视为 MISS 并\n"
+"重新构建。可能破坏共享产物发布或\n"
+"同步的冲突会导致构建失败。顶层为非对象的 JSON 清单\n"
+"目前在验证期间会抛出异常；它不在 MISS 回退的覆盖范围内。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Workflow code and tested source are intentionally separate. Persistent action\n"
+"references use `uses: $/.github/actions/csrc-l1-restore` and\n"
+"`uses: $/.github/actions/csrc-l1-save`, where `$/.github` resolves the action\n"
+"implementation from the workflow revision. The caller's repository and\n"
+"`source_ref` may therefore be a fork or historical snapshot without selecting\n"
+"an incompatible action implementation. Caller inputs still describe the\n"
+"tested checkout: `source-root`, cache directory, architecture, SOC, toolchain\n"
+"image, and optional csrc hash."
+msgstr ""
+"工作流代码与被测源码是有意分离的。持久化操作\n"
+"引用使用 `uses: $/.github/actions/csrc-l1-restore` 和\n"
+"`uses: $/.github/actions/csrc-l1-save`，其中 `$/.github` 会从工作流修订版本解析操作\n"
+"实现。因此，调用方的仓库和\n"
+"`source_ref` 可以是 fork 或历史快照，而不会选择\n"
+"不兼容的操作实现。调用方输入仍然描述\n"
+"被测检出：`source-root`、缓存目录、架构、SOC、工具链\n"
+"镜像以及可选的 csrc 哈希。"
+
+msgid "## Entry and artifact lifecycle"
+msgstr "## 条目与产物生命周期"
+
+msgid "For each action the engine:"
+msgstr "对于每个操作，引擎会："
+
+msgid ""
+"1. hashes prepared inputs, recipe, and compiler environment;\n"
+"2. derives the content-addressed entry path;\n"
+"3. acquires the entry and action locks;\n"
+"4. validates and restores a matching entry;\n"
+"5. otherwise runs the original build command;\n"
+"6. discovers and verifies produced artifacts;\n"
+"7. atomically saves the local entry;\n"
+"8. marks the local L1 snapshot as updated; and\n"
+"9. publishes custom-operator artifacts into the shared build output."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 对预处理输入、recipe 和编译器环境进行哈希；\n"
+"2. 推导内容寻址的条目路径；\n"
+"3. 获取条目锁和操作锁；\n"
+"4. 校验并恢复匹配的条目；\n"
+"5. 否则运行原始构建命令；\n"
+"6. 发现并验证生成的产物；\n"
+"7. 原子地保存本地条目；\n"
+"8. 将本地 L1 快照标记为已更新；以及\n"
+"9. 将自定义算子产物发布到共享构建输出中。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The entry manifest is the correctness record. No separate mutable index is\n"
+"required for lookup or invalidation."
+msgstr ""
+"条目清单是正确性记录。查找或失效不需要单独的\n"
+"可变索引。"
+
+msgid "## Concurrency model"
+msgstr "## 并发模型"
+
+msgid "Three lock scopes protect distinct invariants:"
+msgstr "三种锁作用域保护不同的不变量："
+
+msgid ""
+"- the entry lock permits one creator for a content-addressed entry;\n"
+"- the action lock protects one action's private staging directory; and\n"
+"- the publish lock serializes shared custom-operator output publication."
+msgstr ""
+"- 条目锁允许一个内容寻址条目只有一个创建者；\n"
+"- 操作锁保护单个操作的私有暂存目录；以及\n"
+"- 发布锁串行化共享自定义算子输出的发布。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Custom operators compile into private staging directories. Publication tracks\n"
+"artifact ownership and uses atomic replacement, preventing partial output from\n"
+"becoming visible. A conflicting owner for the same relative artifact is a hard\n"
+"error rather than an unsafe overwrite."
+msgstr ""
+"自定义算子会编译到私有暂存目录中。发布会跟踪\n"
+"产物所有权并使用原子替换，防止部分输出\n"
+"变得可见。同一相对产物存在冲突的所有者属于硬\n"
+"错误，而不是不安全的覆盖。"
+
+msgid "Multi-node jobs use a node-scoped cache directory:"
+msgstr "多节点任务使用节点作用域的缓存目录："
+
+msgid "The design does not depend on cross-node `flock` behavior."
+msgstr "该设计不依赖跨节点的 `flock` 行为。"
+
+msgid "## Persistent transport and trust"
+msgstr "## 持久化传输与信任"
+
+msgid ""
+"The restore and save composite actions own the fixed Huawei OBS transport\n"
+"configuration. The cache engine has no storage API or credential knowledge."
+msgstr "恢复和保存复合操作负责固定的 Huawei OBS 传输配置。缓存引擎不具备存储 API 或凭据信息。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Read access follows the runner's existing OBS authorization. Shared writes\n"
+"require both `HW_OBS_AK` and `HW_OBS_SK`; possession of those secrets is the\n"
+"only write-authorization boundary. The save action receives the credentials\n"
+"explicitly from trusted callers and skips publication when either is absent."
+msgstr ""
+"读取访问遵循运行器现有的 OBS 授权。共享写入需要同时提供 `HW_OBS_AK` 和 "
+"`HW_OBS_SK`；持有这些密钥是唯一的写入授权边界。保存操作从受信任的调用方显式接收凭据，当任一凭据缺失时跳过发布。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Only the central csrc producer publishes L1 in this integration. Image and\n"
+"release-wheel Docker builds retain their existing behavior and do not restore,\n"
+"export, or save persistent L1."
+msgstr ""
+"在此集成中，只有中央 csrc 生产者会发布 L1。镜像和发布 wheel 的 Docker 构建保持其现有行为，不会恢复、导出或保存持久化 L1。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Source-consuming jobs are read-only L1 consumers: they may restore a compatible\n"
+"snapshot before their existing source installation, but they do not publish.\n"
+"Exact-artifact consumers use the central L0 output; an L0 miss continues to the\n"
+"ordinary source build without making persistent L1 transport a prerequisite.\n"
+"Local compilation remains correct but does not create a shared snapshot."
+msgstr ""
+"消费源码的任务是只读的 L1 消费者：它们可以在现有源码安装之前恢复兼容的快照，但不会发布。精确产物消费者使用中央 L0 输出；L0 "
+"未命中时会继续执行普通源码构建，而不会将持久化 L1 传输作为前提条件。本地编译仍然正确，但不会创建共享快照。"
+
+msgid ""
+"A writer publishes only after a successful build creates or replaces a local\n"
+"entry. OBS restore and save failures remain performance degradations."
+msgstr "写入者仅在成功构建创建或替换本地条目后才会发布。OBS 恢复和保存失败仅属于性能退化。"
+
+msgid "## Failure behavior"
+msgstr "## 失败行为"
+
+msgid "| Condition | Behavior |"
+msgstr "| 条件 | 行为 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Historical source has no cache engine | Report unsupported and continue "
+"with the ordinary build. |"
+msgstr "| 历史源码没有缓存引擎 | 报告不支持并继续执行普通构建。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Snapshot environment cannot be fingerprinted | Skip L1 restore and "
+"continue with the ordinary build. |"
+msgstr "| 无法对快照环境进行指纹识别 | 跳过 L1 恢复并继续执行普通构建。 |"
+
+msgid "| Snapshot restore fails | Continue with an empty local L1. |"
+msgstr "| 快照恢复失败 | 使用空的本地 L1 继续。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Entry is absent, unparsable, or has an object manifest that fails "
+"validation | Compile and replace it. |"
+msgstr "| 条目缺失、无法解析，或对象清单验证失败 | 编译并替换它。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Manifest is valid JSON with a non-object top level | Currently raises "
+"during validation; this is an outstanding cache-engine defect. |"
+msgstr "| 清单是有效的 JSON 但顶层不是对象 | 目前在验证期间会抛出异常；这是缓存引擎的一个未修复缺陷。 |"
+
+msgid "| Entry lock is unavailable | Bypass the entry and compile. |"
+msgstr "| 条目锁不可用 | 绕过该条目并编译。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Local entry save fails | Warn and keep the successful build output. |"
+msgstr "| 本地条目保存失败 | 发出警告并保留成功的构建输出。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Snapshot save fails | Keep the successful build or verified L0 artifact. |"
+msgstr "| 快照保存失败 | 保留成功的构建或已验证的 L0 产物。 |"
+
+msgid "| Compiler command fails | Fail the build. |"
+msgstr "| 编译器命令失败 | 使构建失败。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Artifact ownership collides | Fail rather than overwrite another action's "
+"output. |"
+msgstr "| 产物所有权冲突 | 失败，而不是覆盖另一个操作的输出。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Action or publish synchronization fails | Fail when continuing could "
+"corrupt shared output. |"
+msgstr "| 操作或发布同步失败 | 当继续执行可能损坏共享输出时失败。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Operational JSONL events are limited to cache results, warnings, and lock\n"
+"contention. Observability is best effort and never serializes compilation."
+msgstr "运维 JSONL 事件仅限于缓存结果、警告和锁争用。可观测性为尽力而为，且绝不会串行化编译。"
+
+msgid "## Integration patterns"
+msgstr "## 集成模式"
+
+msgid "### Direct source consumers"
+msgstr "### 直接源码消费者"
+
+msgid ""
+"Source-consuming jobs restore L1 before their existing source installation and\n"
+"do not publish. Exact-artifact jobs use the canonical producer's L0 output; an\n"
+"L0 miss proceeds through their existing source build without a second direct\n"
+"L1 fallback, except where a caller explicitly enables the optional shared-L1\n"
+"fallback. Selected-test jobs use that optional fallback after an L0 miss;\n"
+"other L0 consumers, including scheduled upstream E2E, retain their caller-\n"
+"specific source-build policy."
+msgstr ""
+"消费源码的任务在现有源码安装之前恢复 L1，且不发布。精确产物任务使用规范生产者的 L0 输出；L0 "
+"未命中时会通过其现有源码构建继续，而不会进行第二次直接 L1 回退，除非调用方显式启用可选的共享 L1 回退。选定的测试任务在 L0 "
+"未命中后使用该可选回退；其他 L0 消费者（包括定时的上游 E2E）保留其调用方特定的源码构建策略。"
+
+msgid "### Local source builds"
+msgstr "### 本地源码构建"
+
+msgid ""
+"Ordinary local source builds use the same action cache in the repository's\n"
+"ignored `csrc/build_cache` directory. This is local-only acceleration: no OBS\n"
+"credentials or remote snapshot transport are involved. Set\n"
+"`VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR` to an absolute path to override this local\n"
+"default; CI supplies an explicit directory and is unaffected by the\n"
+"repository-local location. Deleting the local directory causes a cold build;\n"
+"it does not change the compiled source or CI's persistent snapshot."
+msgstr ""
+"普通本地源码构建使用仓库中被忽略的 `csrc/build_cache` 目录中的同一操作缓存。这是仅限本地的加速：不涉及 OBS "
+"凭据或远程快照传输。将 `VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR` 设置为绝对路径可覆盖此本地默认值；CI "
+"提供显式目录，不受仓库本地位置的影响。删除本地目录会导致冷构建；它不会改变编译的源码或 CI 的持久化快照。"
+
+msgid "### Central producer"
+msgstr "### 中央生产者"
+
+msgid ""
+"The reusable producer restores L1, performs the ordinary source build, verifies\n"
+"final native artifacts, publishes changed L1 state, and then publishes the\n"
+"exact L0 artifact."
+msgstr "可复用的生产者恢复 L1，执行普通源码构建，验证最终原生产物，发布已更改的 L1 状态，然后发布精确的 L0 产物。"
+
+msgid "### Historical sources"
+msgstr "### 历史源码"
+
+msgid ""
+"Main2Main and bisect-style builds keep current workflow helpers separate from\n"
+"the selected source tree. A historical tree without `build_cache.py` reports\n"
+"`supported=false` and builds normally."
+msgstr ""
+"Main2Main 和 bisect 风格的构建将当前工作流辅助工具与选定的源码树分开。没有 `build_cache.py` 的历史源码树会报告 "
+"`supported=false` 并正常构建。"
+
+msgid "### Docker builds"
+msgstr "### Docker 构建"
+
+msgid ""
+"Image and release-wheel workflows are not L1 consumers or writers in this PR.\n"
+"Their existing Docker build, source compilation, and image L0 behavior remain\n"
+"unchanged. A later integration must validate the Docker boundary without\n"
+"embedding persistent L1 in a published image."
+msgstr ""
+"镜像和发布 wheel 工作流在此 PR 中不是 L1 消费者或写入者。它们现有的 Docker 构建、源码编译和镜像 L0 "
+"行为保持不变。后续集成必须验证 Docker 边界，而不能将持久化 L1 嵌入已发布的镜像中。"
+
+msgid "## Validation summary"
+msgstr "## 验证摘要"
+
+msgid "| Capability | Evidence |"
+msgstr "| 能力 | 证据 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Action identity, entries, and failure behavior | cache-engine unit tests |"
+msgstr "| 操作标识、条目和失败行为 | 缓存引擎单元测试 |"
+
+msgid "| Concurrent ownership and lock behavior | concurrency unit tests |"
+msgstr "| 并发所有权和锁行为 | 并发单元测试 |"
+
+msgid "| Direct source reuse | A2, A3, and 310P cold/warm runs |"
+msgstr "| 直接源码复用 | A2、A3 和 310P 冷/热运行 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Selective invalidation | operator-local mutation with unrelated HITs |"
+msgstr "| 选择性失效 | 算子本地变更且存在无关 HIT |"
+
+msgid "| Root-independent semantic identity | schema-4 CASE-C regression |"
+msgstr "| 与根无关的语义标识 | schema-4 CASE-C 回归 |"
+
+msgid "| Persistent producer | cold/warm producer runs |"
+msgstr "| 持久化生产者 | 冷/热生产者运行 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Some exact production callers still require release credentials, caller\n"
+"registration, or multi-node allocation. Structural and component evidence does\n"
+"not replace those caller-specific runtime gates."
+msgstr "某些精确的生产调用方仍然需要发布凭据、调用方注册或多节点分配。结构和组件证据不能替代这些调用方特定的运行时门控。"
+
+msgid "## Operational debugging"
+msgstr "## 运维调试"
+
+msgid ""
+"For an unexpected full MISS, compare schema, snapshot compatibility,\n"
+"`prepared_input_hash`, `recipe_hash`, and `compiler_environment_hash` in entry\n"
+"manifests. For broad selective invalidation, inspect the prepared-input set and\n"
+"operator namespace. For historical source, check the restore action's\n"
+"`supported` output."
+msgstr ""
+"对于意外的完全 MISS，请比较条目清单中的 schema、快照兼容性、`prepared_input_hash`、`recipe_hash` 和 "
+"`compiler_environment_hash`。对于大范围的选择性失效，请检查准备好的输入集和算子命名空间。对于历史源码，请检查恢复操作的 "
+"`supported` 输出。"
+
+msgid "## Implementation map"
+msgstr "## 实现映射"
+
+msgid "| Responsibility | Source |"
+msgstr "| 职责 | 源码 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Cache identity, entries, locking, and publication | "
+"`csrc/scripts/build_cache.py` |"
+msgstr "| 缓存标识、条目、锁定和发布 | `csrc/scripts/build_cache.py` |"
+
+msgid "| CMake-to-engine adapter | `csrc/cmake/build_cache.cmake` |"
+msgstr "| CMake 到引擎适配器 | `csrc/cmake/build_cache.cmake` |"
+
+msgid "| Operator semantic inputs | `csrc/cmake/func.cmake` |"
+msgstr "| 算子语义输入 | `csrc/cmake/func.cmake` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Third-party semantic inputs | "
+"`csrc/cmake/third_party/ascend_protobuf.cmake` |"
+msgstr "| 第三方语义输入 | `csrc/cmake/third_party/ascend_protobuf.cmake` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Persistent restore and key orchestration | "
+"`.github/actions/csrc-l1-restore/action.yaml` |"
+msgstr "| 持久化恢复与密钥编排 | `.github/actions/csrc-l1-restore/action.yaml` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Persistent changed-snapshot publication | "
+"`.github/actions/csrc-l1-save/action.yaml` |"
+msgstr "| 持久化变更快照发布 | `.github/actions/csrc-l1-save/action.yaml` |"
+
+msgid "| Central producer | `.github/workflows/_build_csrc_cache.yaml` |"
+msgstr "| 中央生产者 | `.github/workflows/_build_csrc_cache.yaml` |"
