+msgid "### Local native build cache"
+msgstr "### 本地原生构建缓存"
+
+msgid ""
+"When a source build compiles native csrc actions, their reusable local entries are\n"
+"stored in the ignored `csrc/build_cache` directory. Set\n"
+"`VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR` to an absolute path to use a different directory.\n"
+"This is local build state, not a remote OBS snapshot; deleting it while no\n"
+"build is running only makes the next relevant source build cold. Builds that\n"
+"disable custom-kernel compilation do not exercise the custom-operator action\n"
+"cache."
+msgstr ""
+"当源码构建编译原生 csrc 动作时，其可复用的本地条目会存储在已被忽略的 `csrc/build_cache` 目录中。将 "
+"`VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR` 设置为绝对路径可使用其他目录。这是本地构建状态，而非远程 OBS "
+"快照；在没有构建运行时删除它，只会使下一次相关的源码构建变为冷构建。禁用自定义内核编译的构建不会使用自定义算子动作缓存。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If you change a generated operator input, compiler command, or toolchain\n"
+"dependency, review the [cache identity and CMake integration contract](../Design_Documents/persistent_csrc_build_cache.md#cmake-integration-contract)\n"
+"in the design document."
+msgstr ""
+"如果你更改了生成的算子输入、编译器命令或工具链依赖，请查阅设计文档中的[缓存标识与 CMake "
+"集成契约](../Design_Documents/persistent_csrc_build_cache.md#cmake-integration-"
+"contract)。"
