+msgid "### Maintenance window"
+msgstr "### 维护窗口"
+
+msgid ""
+"Maintainers can pause PR-triggered commands during a maintenance window by setting\n"
+"the repository variable `NIGHTLY_COMMAND_BLOCK_WINDOW`. The value is an optional\n"
+"switch followed by an `HH:MM-HH:MM` range in Beijing time (UTC+8):"
+msgstr ""
+"维护者可以通过设置仓库变量 `NIGHTLY_COMMAND_BLOCK_WINDOW` 在维护窗口期间暂停由 PR "
+"触发的命令。该值由一个可选的开关以及一个北京时间（UTC+8）的 `HH:MM-HH:MM` 时间范围组成："
+
+msgid "| Value | Behavior |"
+msgstr "| 值 | 行为 |"
+
+msgid "| `true 22:00-08:00` | Gate enabled; block inside the window |"
+msgstr "| `true 22:00-08:00` | 启用门控；在窗口内阻止 |"
+
+msgid "| `22:00-08:00` | Same as above (switch omitted) |"
+msgstr "| `22:00-08:00` | 与上述相同（省略开关） |"
+
+msgid "| `false 22:00-08:00` | Gate explicitly disabled |"
+msgstr "| `false 22:00-08:00` | 显式禁用门控 |"
+
+msgid "| unset / invalid | Gate disabled (fail-open) |"
+msgstr "| 未设置 / 无效 | 门控禁用（失效开放） |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Switch aliases are `true/1/yes/on` and `false/0/no/off` (case-insensitive); a space\n"
+"or comma may separate the switch from the range. Cross-midnight ranges are\n"
+"supported. While the gate is enabled and the current Beijing time falls inside the\n"
+"range, `/nightly` and `/weekly` comments do not dispatch tests; the bot replies with\n"
+"the active window instead."
+msgstr ""
+"开关的别名有 `true/1/yes/on` 和 "
+"`false/0/no/off`（不区分大小写）；开关与时间范围之间可以用空格或逗号分隔。支持跨午夜的时间范围。当门控启用且当前北京时间处于该范围内时，`/nightly`"
+" 和 `/weekly` 评论不会触发测试；机器人会改为回复当前生效的窗口。"
+
+msgid "**My `/nightly` comment was ignored during the maintenance window.**"
+msgstr "**我的 `/nightly` 评论在维护窗口期间被忽略了。**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- If the repository variable `NIGHTLY_COMMAND_BLOCK_WINDOW` is set and the current\n"
+"  Beijing time is inside the configured range, `/nightly` and `/weekly` are\n"
+"  intentionally blocked to protect the third-party scheduling tests. The bot replies\n"
+"  with the active window; retry after it ends."
+msgstr ""
+"- 如果仓库变量 `NIGHTLY_COMMAND_BLOCK_WINDOW` 已设置，且当前北京时间处于配置的范围内，则 `/nightly` 和 "
+"`/weekly` 会被有意阻止，以保护第三方调度测试。机器人会回复当前生效的窗口；请在窗口结束后重试。"
