+msgid "### Atlas 850/850E/950 SuperPod Communication Configuration"
+msgstr "### Atlas 850/850E/950 SuperPod 通信配置"
+
+msgid ""
+"For Atlas 850/850E/950 SuperPod (950PR/950DT), PD disaggregation uses the "
+"super plane (based on UB port and UBC protocol) by default. No additional "
+"network configuration is required for this default path. Set the following "
+"environment variable in both the prefiller and decoder serving environments "
+"to generate the communication configuration automatically:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于 Atlas 850/850E/950 SuperPod（950PR/950DT），PD 分离默认使用超平面（基于 UB 端口和 UBC "
+"协议）。此默认路径无需额外的网络配置。在 prefiller 和 decoder 服务环境中均设置以下环境变量，即可自动生成通信配置："
+
+msgid ""
+"The parameter plane supports UBG, UBoE, and RoCE network protocols. Each "
+"protocol requires compatible hardware and network configuration completed in"
+" advance. Consult your environment provider or administrator for the "
+"required environment and configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"参数面支持 UBG、UBoE 和 RoCE 网络协议。每种协议都需要提前完成兼容的硬件和网络配置。请咨询您的环境提供商或管理员，以获取所需的环境和配置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For UBG or UBoE network protocols, keep the automatic configuration setting "
+"above and select the corresponding protocol before starting the serving "
+"processes:"
+msgstr "对于 UBG 或 UBoE 网络协议，保留上述自动配置设置，并在启动服务进程前选择相应的协议："
+
+msgid "=== \"UBG\""
+msgstr "=== \"UBG\""
+
+msgid "=== \"UBoE\""
+msgstr "=== \"UBoE\""
+
+msgid "=== \"RoCE\""
+msgstr "=== \"RoCE\""
+
+msgid ""
+"For RoCE network protocol, current configuration is to prepare endpoint "
+"configuration files under `/etc/hixlep` and set `ascend_local_comm_res_path`"
+" in `kv_connector_extra_config` on both sides. For example, with `DP=4` and "
+"`TP=1` on each side:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于 RoCE 网络协议，当前配置方式是在 `/etc/hixlep` 下准备端点配置文件，并在两侧的 "
