+
+msgid "!!! note \"Timeout for long sequences or high concurrency\""
+msgstr "!!! note \"长序列或高并发时的超时\""
+
+msgid ""
+"For long sequences or high concurrency, the default KV-cache release timeout"
+" of 480 seconds may be insufficient. Increase it as needed in the prefiller "
+"startup script. For versions that use `VLLM_MOONCAKE_CONNECTOR_TIMEOUT` for "
+"this timeout, add:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于长序列或高并发场景，默认的 480 秒 KV 缓存释放超时可能不够。请在 prefiller 启动脚本中根据需要增大该值。对于使用 "
+"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_CONNECTOR_TIMEOUT` 作为该超时的版本，请添加："
+
+msgid ""
+"The value is in seconds: `1800` allows 30 minutes before timeout. In current"
+" versions, this setting is named `VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`; use "
+"`export VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=1800` instead. Check the "
+"variable name supported by your installed version."
+msgstr ""
+"该值以秒为单位：`1800` 表示允许 30 分钟后超时。在当前版本中，此设置名为 "
+"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`；请改用 `export "
+"VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=1800`。请检查您所安装版本支持的变量名。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Increasing this timeout generally does not affect inference accuracy or "
+"performance during normal operation. If a decoder (D) node fails while "
+"requests still have KV caches on the prefiller (P) node that the decoder has"
+" not received, a longer timeout delays releasing those caches. They continue"
+" to occupy HBM, reducing the memory available for other requests on the P "
+"node until they are released."
+msgstr ""
+"增大此超时通常不会影响正常运行期间的推理精度或性能。如果 decoder（D）节点发生故障，而请求的 KV 缓存仍留在 prefiller（P）节点上且"
+" decoder 尚未接收，则更长的超时会延迟释放这些缓存。在释放之前，它们会持续占用 HBM，从而减少 P 节点上可用于其他请求的内存。"
