index 178c2c231..b46937d80 100644
--- a/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.po
+++ b/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.po
@@ -587,3 +587,82 @@ msgstr "### 8.1 使用 AISBench"
 
 msgid "### 8.2 Using vLLM Benchmark"
 msgstr "### 8.2 使用 vLLM Benchmark"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w4a4c8` | 950PR&950DT Products | Quantize locally "
+"with "
+"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_flash_w4a4c8.yaml)"
+" |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w4a4c8` | Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 | 使用 "
+"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_flash_w4a4c8.yaml)"
+" 在本地量化 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w4a4c8` (W4A4 MXFP4 mixed-precision quantization):"
+" For how the ultra-low-bit quantization preserves accuracy, see the [W4A4C8 "
+"FAQ](#q-how-do-the-w4a4c8-ultra-low-bit-quantized-weights-preserve-"
+"accuracy)."
+msgstr ""
+"- `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w4a4c8`（W4A4 MXFP4 混合精度量化）：关于超低位宽量化如何保持精度，请参见 "
+"[W4A4C8 常见问题](#q-how-do-the-w4a4c8-ultra-low-bit-quantized-weights-preserve-"
+"accuracy)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"> **Note**: Dataset evaluation results fluctuate between runs due to "
+"sampling and runtime non-determinism. When a dataset is evaluated multiple "
+"times, the average score is reported."
+msgstr "> **注意**：由于采样和运行时非确定性，数据集评测结果在不同运行之间会有波动。当对某个数据集进行多次评测时，报告的是平均得分。"
+
+msgid ""
+"### Q: How do the W4A4C8 ultra-low-bit quantized weights preserve accuracy?"
+msgstr "### 问：W4A4C8 超低位宽量化权重如何保持精度？"
+
+msgid ""
+"A: For 950PR&950DT Products, the W4A4C8 weights of `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731` "
+"are quantized with "
+"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_flash_w4a4c8.yaml)."
+" To preserve accuracy at such a low bit-width, a mixed-precision strategy is"
+" used: only the modules that dominate the parameter count are quantized to 4"
+" bit, while precision-sensitive modules fall back to higher precision or are"
+" not quantized at all."
+msgstr ""
+"答：对于 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，`DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731` 的 W4A4C8 权重使用 "
+"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_flash_w4a4c8.yaml)"
+" 进行量化。为了在如此低的位宽下保持精度，采用了混合精度策略：仅将占参数数量主导地位的模块量化为 4 "
+"bit，而对精度敏感的模块则回退到更高精度或完全不量化。"
+
+msgid "| Module | Quantization configuration |"
+msgstr "| 模块 | 量化配置 |"
+
+msgid "| MoE FFN routed experts | W4A4 MXFP4 |"
+msgstr "| MoE FFN 路由专家 | W4A4 MXFP4 |"
+
+msgid "| Attention linear layers | W8A8 MXFP8 |"
+msgstr "| Attention 线性层 | W8A8 MXFP8 |"
+
+msgid "| FFN shared experts | W8A8 MXFP8 |"
+msgstr "| FFN 共享专家 | W8A8 MXFP8 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Router gates, compressor projections (`wgate`/`wkv`), indexer projections,"
+" and MTP layers | Not quantized (kept in high precision) |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Router gates、compressor 投影（`wgate`/`wkv`）、indexer 投影以及 MTP 层 | 不量化（保持高精度） "
+"|"
+
+msgid ""
+"- **Quantization algorithm**: The weights and activations use the MXFP4/MXFP8 microscaling formats. Each tensor is divided into blocks of 32 elements, and each block shares a single scaling factor obtained with symmetric min-max calibration on a mixed calibration dataset. Block-wise scaling adapts to the local dynamic range of each tensor, so the quantization error is far lower than that of uniform INT4 quantization.\n"
+"- **C8 (FP8 KV cache)**: C8 is a dynamic quantization applied to the KV cache during inference. On 950PR&950DT Products, the KV cache is quantized to FP8 (not INT8). It is unrelated to the parameters stored in the weight checkpoint and is controlled only by the serving configuration. DeepSeek-V4-Flash and DeepSeek-V4-Pro share exactly the same C8 scheme:\n"
+"    - **Attention KV cache** (FP8 by default on 950PR&950DT Products; switch back to BF16 with `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16`): the compressed KV latent, which serves as both K and V, is dynamically quantized per 64-element tile to FP8 (E4M3) with a shared E8M0 scale per tile; the RoPE part of the KV cache stays in BF16, and Q is not quantized.\n"
+"    - **Indexer cache** (enabled with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`): both indexer Q and K are first rotated by a Hadamard matrix to spread outliers, and then dynamically quantized per token to FP8 (E4M3) with per-token FP32 scales."
+msgstr ""
+"- **量化算法**：权重和激活使用 MXFP4/MXFP8 微缩放格式。每个张量被划分为 32 个元素的块，每个块共享一个缩放因子，该因子通过在混合校准数据集上进行对称 min-max 校准获得。分块缩放能够适应每个张量的局部动态范围，因此量化误差远低于均匀 INT4 量化。\n"
+"- **C8（FP8 KV cache）**：C8 是推理过程中应用于 KV cache 的动态量化。在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上，KV cache 被量化为 FP8（而非 INT8）。它与权重 checkpoint 中存储的参数无关，仅由服务配置控制。DeepSeek-V4-Flash 和 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 共享完全相同的 C8 方案：\n"
+"    - **Attention KV cache**（在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上默认为 FP8；可通过 `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16` 切换回 BF16）：作为 K 和 V 的压缩 KV latent，按 64 元素 tile 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），每个 tile 共享一个 E8M0 缩放因子；KV cache 的 RoPE 部分保持 BF16，Q 不量化。\n"
+"    - **Indexer cache**（通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 启用）：indexer 的 Q 和 K 首先通过 Hadamard 矩阵旋转以分散离群值，然后按 token 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），并使用每 token 的 FP32 缩放因子。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For W4A4C8 accuracy scores, see [Accuracy Evaluation](#7-accuracy-"
+"evaluation)."
+msgstr "关于 W4A4C8 精度得分，请参见 [精度评测](#7-accuracy-evaluation)。"
