+msgid ""
+"The Ascend W8A8 checkpoint used by this guide will be published as\n"
+"[Eco-Tech/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-w8a8](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-w8a8)\n"
+"on ModelScope. It includes the DSpark draft parameters and INT8 Engram tables.\n"
+"After the checkpoint is available, download it to the same absolute path on\n"
+"every server and replace the checkpoint-path placeholder in each serving\n"
+"command."
+msgstr ""
+"本指南使用的昇腾 W8A8 检查点将发布为 ModelScope 上的 [Eco-"
+"Tech/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-w8a8](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
+"Tech/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-w8a8)。它包含 DSpark 草稿参数和 INT8 Engram "
+"表。检查点可用后，将其下载到每台服务器上的相同绝对路径，并替换每个服务命令中的检查点路径占位符。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- **A3 single-node colocated**: one Atlas 800 A3 server with 8 NPUs and 128GB\n"
+"  memory per NPU. The server exposes 16 logical devices to the container.\n"
+"- **A3 1P1D**: two Atlas 800 A3 servers with the same device configuration.\n"
+"- **A2 series**: four Atlas 800 A2 servers. Each server has 8 NPUs with 64GB\n"
+"  memory per NPU and exposes 8 devices to the container. Its deployment\n"
+"  configuration is retained unchanged in this update."
+msgstr ""
+"- **A3 单节点共置**：一台 Atlas 800 A3 服务器，配备 8 个 NPU，每个 NPU 128GB 内存。该服务器向容器暴露 16 个逻辑设备。\n"
+"- **A3 1P1D**：两台 Atlas 800 A3 服务器，设备配置相同。\n"
+"- **A2 系列**：四台 Atlas 800 A2 服务器。每台服务器配备 8 个 NPU，每个 NPU 64GB 内存，并向容器暴露 8 个设备。其部署配置在本次更新中保持不变。"
+
+msgid ""
+"An A3 server exposes 16 logical devices. Run this command on every A3\n"
+"    server."
+msgstr "一台 A3 服务器暴露 16 个逻辑设备。在每台 A3 服务器上运行此命令。"
+
+msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node Colocated Deployment"
+msgstr "### 5.1 单节点共置部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This configuration runs Prefill and Decode on one Atlas 800 A3 server. It\n"
+"    uses DP4/TP4 across all 16 logical devices, expert parallelism, Engram host\n"
+"    offload, asynchronous scheduling, and `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph."
+msgstr ""
+"此配置在一台 Atlas 800 A3 服务器上运行 Prefill 和 Decode。它在全部 16 个逻辑设备上使用 "
+"DP4/TP4、专家并行、Engram 主机卸载、异步调度以及 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph。"
+
+msgid "Set `MODEL_PATH` to the local checkpoint path."
+msgstr "将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为本地检查点路径。"
+
+msgid "Key parameters:"
+msgstr "关键参数："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--max-model-len 150000` limits the total input and output length of one\n"
+"        request. `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` limits the tokens scheduled in one\n"
+"        iteration, while `--max-num-seqs 32` limits the sequences scheduled by each\n"
+"        DP engine. Increasing either scheduler limit can improve throughput but also\n"
+"        increases memory usage.\n"
+"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` allows up to 36,000 seconds for engine\n"
+"        processes to finish initialization, including weight loading and graph\n"
+"        preparation.\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1. Keep this\n"
+"        value at `0` because DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash currently does not support model\n"
+"        runner V2 on Ascend.\n"
+"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` keeps the\n"
+"        Engram table in host memory and lets local DP ranks share the host-memory\n"
+"        allocation. This is required on A3 because the model's 24 Engram heads\n"
+"        cannot be evenly divided across 16 logical devices. It also reduces\n"
+"        duplicate host-memory copies. The A3 container example uses `--ipc=host` so\n"
+"        all four local DP ranks share the host IPC namespace.\n"
+"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` captures the\n"
+"        Decode path while Prefill remains outside the captured graph.\n"
+"    - `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` avoids eagerly materializing the whole\n"
+"        checkpoint during loading.\n"
+"    - `enable_fused_mc2`, `enable_dsa_cp`, `enable_flashcomm1`, and\n"
+"        `enable_shared_expert_dp` enable the A3 MoE and communication optimizations\n"
+"        used by this configuration. `enable_cpu_binding` pins worker processes to\n"
+"        CPUs, while `enable_npugraph_ex` enables the enhanced ACL Graph path."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--max-model-len 150000` 限制单个请求的总输入和输出长度。`--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 限制单次迭代中调度的 token 数，而 `--max-num-seqs 32` 限制每个 DP 引擎调度的序列数。提高任一调度器限制可以提高吞吐量，但也会增加内存使用量。\n"
+"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` 允许引擎进程最多 36,000 秒完成初始化，包括权重加载和图准备。\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 显式选择模型运行器 V1。请将此值保持为 `0`，因为 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 目前在昇腾上不支持模型运行器 V2。\n"
+"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` 将 Engram 表保留在主机内存中，并让本地 DP rank 共享主机内存分配。这在 A3 上是必需的，因为模型的 24 个 Engram 头无法在 16 个逻辑设备上均匀分配。它还能减少重复的主机内存副本。A3 容器示例使用 `--ipc=host`，以便所有四个本地 DP rank 共享主机 IPC 命名空间。\n"
+"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 捕获 Decode 路径，而 Prefill 保持在捕获图之外。\n"
+"    - `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` 避免在加载期间急切地物化整个检查点。\n"
+"    - `enable_fused_mc2`、`enable_dsa_cp`、`enable_flashcomm1` 和 `enable_shared_expert_dp` 启用此配置使用的 A3 MoE 和通信优化。`enable_cpu_binding` 将工作进程绑定到 CPU，而 `enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL Graph 路径。"
+
+msgid "### 5.2 1P1D PD Disaggregated Deployment"
+msgstr "### 5.2 1P1D PD 分离部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This example uses two Atlas 800 A3 servers. The Prefill node runs four DP\n"
+"    ranks with TP4 (DP4/TP4), and the Decode node runs eight DP ranks with TP2\n"
+"    (DP8/TP2). Both layouts consume all 16 logical devices on their respective\n"
+"    servers. Mooncake transfers KV cache from the Prefill engines to the Decode\n"
+"    engines."
+msgstr ""
+"此示例使用两台 Atlas 800 A3 服务器。Prefill 节点运行四个 DP rank，使用 TP4（DP4/TP4），Decode "
+"节点运行八个 DP rank，使用 TP2（DP8/TP2）。两种布局都消耗各自服务器上的全部 16 个逻辑设备。Mooncake 将 KV 缓存从 "
+"Prefill 引擎传输到 Decode 引擎。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.1 Prepare the DP Launcher"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.1 准备 DP 启动器"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following script as `launch_online_dp.py` on both nodes. It divides\n"
+"    the node's visible devices among local DP ranks and starts one vLLM process per\n"
+"    rank."
+msgstr ""
+"将以下脚本保存为两个节点上的 `launch_online_dp.py`。它将节点的可见设备分配给本地 DP rank，并为每个 rank 启动一个 "
+"vLLM 进程。"
+
+msgid "The launcher arguments are:"
+msgstr "启动器参数如下："
+
+msgid "| Parameter | Description |"
+msgstr "| 参数 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-size` | Global DP size within the Prefill or Decode node group. "
+"|"
+msgstr "    | `--dp-size` | Prefill 或 Decode 节点组内的全局 DP 大小。 |"
+
+msgid "    | `--tp-size` | Number of logical devices used by each DP rank. |"
+msgstr "    | `--tp-size` | 每个 DP rank 使用的逻辑设备数量。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-size-local` | Number of DP ranks started on the current node. |"
+msgstr "    | `--dp-size-local` | 在当前节点上启动的 DP rank 数量。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-rank-start` | First DP rank assigned to this node. It is `0` for"
+" both single-node groups in this 1P1D example. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--dp-rank-start` | 分配给此节点的第一个 DP rank。在此 1P1D 示例中，两个单节点组均为 `0`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-address` | IP address of the node that coordinates the "
+"corresponding DP group. Use the Prefill IP on the Prefill node and the "
+"Decode IP on the Decode node. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--dp-address` | 协调相应 DP 组的节点 IP 地址。在 Prefill 节点上使用 Prefill IP，在 "
+"Decode 节点上使用 Decode IP。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-rpc-port` | DP coordination port. It must be unused and "
+"reachable within the node group. |"
+msgstr "    | `--dp-rpc-port` | DP 协调端口。它必须未被使用且在节点组内可访问。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--vllm-start-port` | First API port; the launcher increments it for "
+"each local DP rank. |"
+msgstr "    | `--vllm-start-port` | 第一个 API 端口；启动器会为每个本地 DP rank 递增该端口。 |"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.2 Start the Prefill Node"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.2 启动 Prefill 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
+"    `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` to the Prefill node's service IP,\n"
+"    network interface, and local checkpoint path."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。将 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 "
+"`MODEL_PATH` 设置为 Prefill 节点的服务 IP、网络接口和本地检查点路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines. `--dp-address` uses the Prefill node IP."
+msgstr "启动四个 DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。`--dp-address` 使用 Prefill 节点 IP。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.3 Start the Decode Node"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.3 启动 Decode 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
+"    `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` to the Decode node's service IP,\n"
+"    network interface, and the same local checkpoint path used on the Prefill\n"
+"    node."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。将\n"
+"    `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为 Decode 节点的服务 IP、\n"
+"    网络接口，以及与 Prefill 节点相同的本地权重路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines. `--dp-address` uses the Decode node IP."
+msgstr "启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。`--dp-address` 使用 Decode 节点 IP。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.4 Deploy the PD Proxy"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.4 部署 PD Proxy"
+
+msgid ""
+"After all Prefill and Decode engines are ready, deploy the proxy as described\n"
+"    in [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (DeepSeek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md).\n"
+"    Configure the proxy with Prefill endpoints `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:7100` through\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:7103` and Decode endpoints `<DECODE_NODE_IP>:7100` through\n"
+"    `<DECODE_NODE_IP>:7107`."
+msgstr ""
+"在所有 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎就绪后，按照\n"
+"    [Prefill-Decode 分离部署（DeepSeek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) 中的说明部署 proxy。\n"
+"    为 proxy 配置 Prefill 端点 `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:7100` 至\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:7103`，以及 Decode 端点 `<DECODE_NODE_IP>:7100` 至\n"
+"    `<DECODE_NODE_IP>:7107`。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.5 Key Parameter Descriptions"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.5 关键参数说明"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` gives every Prefill and Decode engine up\n"
+"      to 36,000 seconds to finish startup. This includes weight loading and Decode\n"
+"      graph preparation.\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1 on both\n"
+"      Prefill and Decode. Keep this value at `0` because DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\n"
+"      currently does not support model runner V2 on Ascend.\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-size` and `--tensor-parallel-size` define DP4/TP4 on\n"
+"      Prefill and DP8/TP2 on Decode. Their product must be 16 on each A3 node.\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` coordinate DP ranks\n"
+"      within one role. Prefill and Decode use their respective node IPs; port\n"
+"      `12321` can be reused because the roles run on different hosts.\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 7100` assigns API ports `7100-7103` on Prefill and\n"
+"      `7100-7107` on Decode. These endpoints must be reachable by the PD proxy.\n"
+"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 1048576`. Prefill uses\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` and `--max-num-seqs 16` to favor prompt\n"
+"      throughput, while Decode uses `400` and `32` respectively to favor decode\n"
+"      concurrency. Tune these role-specific scheduler limits independently.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector` transfers KV cache between the two roles.\n"
+"      `kv_role` must be `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer` on Decode;\n"
+"      `kv_port` must be reachable and must not conflict with another service.\n"
+"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` must match the actual global layouts on both\n"
+"      sides: Prefill DP4/TP4 and Decode DP8/TP2. Keep the values identical in the\n"
+"      Prefill and Decode commands.\n"
+"    - Both roles use DSpark with five speculative tokens. Prefill runs the target\n"
+"      model in eager mode. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` for the target model,\n"
+"      while `enforce_eager` inside `--speculative-config` applies to the Decode\n"
+"      draft model.\n"
+"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` keeps the\n"
+"      Engram table in host memory and lets local DP ranks share the host-memory\n"
+"      allocation. `dp_shared_memory` is required on A3 because the model's 24\n"
+"      Engram heads cannot be evenly divided across 16 logical devices. Both A3\n"
+"      containers use `--ipc=host` so the local DP ranks can share the allocation.\n"
+"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` captures the\n"
+"      Decode path while Prefill remains outside the captured graph.\n"
+"    - Prefix caching is enabled only on Prefill. Decode disables it and enables\n"
+"      `recompute_scheduler_enable` so Prefill can recompute unavailable KV cache.\n"
+"    - Prefill uses the following `--additional-config` options:"
+msgstr ""
+"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` 为每个 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎提供最长\n"
+"      36,000 秒的启动时间。这包括权重加载和 Decode 图准备。\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 在 Prefill 和 Decode 上显式选择 model runner V1。\n"
+"      请将该值保持为 `0`，因为 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\n"
+"      目前在昇腾上不支持 model runner V2。\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-size` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size` 在\n"
+"      Prefill 上定义 DP4/TP4，在 Decode 上定义 DP8/TP2。它们的乘积在每个 A3 节点上必须为 16。\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 用于协调同一角色内的\n"
+"      DP rank。Prefill 和 Decode 使用各自的节点 IP；端口\n"
+"      `12321` 可以复用，因为两个角色运行在不同的主机上。\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 7100` 在 Prefill 上分配 API 端口 `7100-7103`，\n"
+"      在 Decode 上分配 `7100-7107`。这些端点必须能被 PD proxy 访问。\n"
+"    - 两个角色都使用 `--max-model-len 1048576`。Prefill 使用\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 和 `--max-num-seqs 16` 以提升 prompt\n"
+"      吞吐量，而 Decode 分别使用 `400` 和 `32` 以提升 decode\n"
+"      并发能力。请独立调整这些角色特定的调度器限制。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector` 在两个角色之间传输 KV cache。\n"
+"      `kv_role` 在 Prefill 上必须为 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 上必须为 `kv_consumer`；\n"
+"      `kv_port` 必须可访问，且不能与其他服务冲突。\n"
+"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` 必须与两侧实际的全局布局匹配：\n"
+"      Prefill DP4/TP4 和 Decode DP8/TP2。请确保 Prefill 和 Decode 命令中的\n"
+"      值保持一致。\n"
+"    - 两个角色都使用 DSpark，并配置五个投机 token。Prefill 以 eager 模式运行目标\n"
+"      模型。Decode 对目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，\n"
+"      而 `--speculative-config` 中的 `enforce_eager` 适用于 Decode\n"
+"      的 draft 模型。\n"
+"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` 将\n"
+"      Engram 表保留在主机内存中，并让本地 DP rank 共享主机内存\n"
+"      分配。在 A3 上必须使用 `dp_shared_memory`，因为模型的 24 个\n"
+"      Engram head 无法在 16 个逻辑设备之间均匀划分。两个 A3\n"
+"      容器都使用 `--ipc=host`，以便本地 DP rank 可以共享该分配。\n"
+"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 捕获\n"
+"      Decode 路径，而 Prefill 保持在捕获图之外。\n"
+"    - Prefix caching 仅在 Prefill 上启用。Decode 禁用它并启用\n"
+"      `recompute_scheduler_enable`，以便 Prefill 可以重新计算不可用的 KV cache。\n"
+"    - Prefill 使用以下 `--additional-config` 选项："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `enable_cpu_binding: true` enables Ascend-native CPU affinity for worker\n"
+"        processes and runtime threads.\n"
+"        - `enable_fused_mc2: 1` enables the fused MoE communication and computation\n"
+"        path to reduce expert dispatch, FFN, and combine overhead.\n"
+"        - `enable_dsa_cp: true` enables context parallelism for DeepSeek Sparse\n"
+"        Attention. This option applies to models with an indexer and requires the\n"
+"        sequence-parallel MoE path used by this topology.\n"
+"        - `enable_flashcomm1: true` enables the FlashComm communication backend used\n"
+"        by the sequence-parallel MoE and DSA context-parallel paths.\n"
+"        - `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` uses data parallelism for shared experts.\n"
+"        It takes effect only when expert parallelism is enabled and TP is greater\n"
+"        than one; both conditions are met by Prefill DP4/TP4."
+msgstr ""
+"- `enable_cpu_binding: true` 为 worker\n"
+"        进程和运行时线程启用昇腾原生 CPU 亲和性。\n"
+"        - `enable_fused_mc2: 1` 启用融合的 MoE 通信与计算\n"
+"        路径，以减少 expert dispatch、FFN 和 combine 开销。\n"
+"        - `enable_dsa_cp: true` 为 DeepSeek Sparse\n"
+"        Attention 启用上下文并行。此选项适用于带 indexer 的模型，并要求使用\n"
+"        此拓扑所用的序列并行 MoE 路径。\n"
+"        - `enable_flashcomm1: true` 启用序列并行 MoE 和 DSA 上下文并行路径所使用的\n"
+"        FlashComm 通信后端。\n"
+"        - `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` 对共享 expert 使用数据并行。\n"
+"        仅在启用 expert 并行且 TP 大于\n"
+"        一时生效；Prefill DP4/TP4 同时满足这两个条件。"
+
+msgid "- Decode uses the following `--additional-config` options:"
+msgstr "- Decode 使用以下 `--additional-config` 选项："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` enables the enhanced\n"
+"        ACL Graph compilation and execution path used by `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`.\n"
+"        - `ascend_compilation_config.enable_static_kernel: false` disables static\n"
+"        kernel generation while retaining the enhanced ACL Graph path.\n"
+"        - `enable_cpu_binding: true` enables Ascend-native CPU affinity for worker\n"
+"        processes and runtime threads.\n"
+"        - `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` overlaps shared-expert execution\n"
+"        with routed-expert computation on separate streams to improve Decode MoE\n"
+"        throughput.\n"
+"        - `recompute_scheduler_enable: true` enables the PD Decode recomputation\n"
+"        scheduler. When the Decode-side KV cache is unavailable, the request can be\n"
+"        sent back to Prefill to recompute it. Enable this option only on Decode."
+msgstr ""
+"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` 启用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 所使用的增强\n"
+"        ACL Graph 编译与执行路径。\n"
+"        - `ascend_compilation_config.enable_static_kernel: false` 禁用静态\n"
+"        kernel 生成，同时保留增强的 ACL Graph 路径。\n"
+"        - `enable_cpu_binding: true` 为 worker\n"
+"        进程和运行时线程启用昇腾原生 CPU 亲和性。\n"
+"        - `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` 在独立流上将共享 expert 执行\n"
+"        与 routed expert 计算重叠，以提升 Decode MoE\n"
+"        吞吐量。\n"
+"        - `recompute_scheduler_enable: true` 启用 PD Decode 重计算\n"
+"        调度器。当 Decode 侧 KV cache 不可用时，请求可以\n"
+"        被发送回 Prefill 重新计算。仅在 Decode 上启用此选项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The Prefill and Decode configurations are role-specific. Do not copy the\n"
+"      Prefill fused-MC2 and DSA options to Decode, or the Decode graph, multistream,\n"
+"      and recomputation options to Prefill, without validating the resulting\n"
+"      topology and performance."
+msgstr ""
+"Prefill 和 Decode 的配置是角色特定的。在未验证最终\n"
+"      拓扑和性能之前，请勿将 Prefill 的 fused-MC2 和 DSA 选项复制到 Decode，\n"
+"      也不要将 Decode 的图、multistream\n"
+"      和重计算选项复制到 Prefill。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`HCCL_IF_IP` and the socket interface variables must select the same high-speed\n"
+"      service network used by the configured node IPs. `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` is `1024` on\n"
+"      Prefill and `1800` on Decode; retain these role-specific values unless another\n"
+"      setting has been validated. The DP RPC, engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must\n"
+"      be allowed by the host firewall."
+msgstr ""
+"`HCCL_IF_IP` 与套接字接口变量必须选择与所配置节点 IP 相同的高速服务网络。`HCCL_BUFFSIZE` 在 Prefill 上为 "
+"`1024`，在 Decode 上为 `1800`；除非已验证其他设置，否则请保留这些角色特定的值。DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake "
+"和代理端口必须被主机防火墙放行。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait until every engine finishes loading weights and Decode finishes graph\n"
+"      capture. A successful startup includes output similar to:"
+msgstr "等待每个引擎完成权重加载且 Decode 完成图捕获。成功启动会包含类似以下的输出："
+
+msgid "### 5.3 Multi-Node Colocated Deployment"
+msgstr "### 5.3 多节点混布部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"The existing A2 configuration is retained unchanged in this update. It uses\n"
+"    four Atlas 800 A2 servers with one local DP rank per server and a global\n"
+"    DP4/TP8/EP32 topology."
+msgstr ""
+"本次更新保留现有 A2 配置不变。它使用四台 Atlas 800 A2 服务器，每台服务器一个本地 DP rank，全局拓扑为 "
+"DP4/TP8/EP32。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Run this script on all four A2 servers. Set `NODE_RANK` to `0`, `1`, `2`, or\n"
+"    `3` on the corresponding node. Set `NODE0_IP` to the IP address of Node 0 and\n"
+"    set `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` for each node."
+msgstr ""
+"在全部四台 A2 服务器上运行此脚本。在对应节点上将 `NODE_RANK` 设置为 `0`、`1`、`2` 或 `3`。将 `NODE0_IP` "
+"设置为 Node 0 的 IP 地址，并为每个节点设置 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Omit `--data-parallel-start-rank` on Node 0. Start Node 0 first, followed by\n"
+"    Nodes 1 through 3. Only Node 0 exposes the API endpoint. Each server contributes\n"
+"    one TP8 rank to the global DP4 topology."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Node 0 上省略 `--data-parallel-start-rank`。先启动 Node 0，然后依次启动 Node 1 到 Node "
+"3。只有 Node 0 暴露 API 端点。每台服务器为全局 DP4 拓扑贡献一个 TP8 rank。"
+
+msgid "### 5.4 Service Verification"
+msgstr "### 5.4 服务验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set the endpoint for the selected deployment, then verify the health endpoint.\n"
+"Use `<A3_IP>` with port `8900` for A3 single-node colocated deployment,\n"
+"`<PROXY_IP>` with `<PROXY_PORT>` for A3 PD deployment, or `<A2_NODE0_IP>` with\n"
+"port `8000` for the retained A2 deployment."
+msgstr ""
+"为所选部署设置端点，然后验证健康检查端点。A3 单节点混布部署使用 `<A3_IP>` 和端口 `8900`，A3 PD 部署使用 "
+"`<PROXY_IP>` 和 `<PROXY_PORT>`，保留的 A2 部署使用 `<A2_NODE0_IP>` 和端口 `8000`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The response must contain a model entry whose `id` matches the configured\n"
+"`--served-model-name`: `dsv41` for the A3 examples and `deepseek-v41` for the\n"
+"retained A2 example."
+msgstr ""
+"响应必须包含一个模型条目，其 `id` 与配置的 `--served-model-name` 匹配：A3 示例为 `dsv41`，保留的 A2 示例为 "
+"`deepseek-v41`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set `IMAGE_URL` to an HTTP(S) image URL reachable from the node that executes\n"
+"Prefill, and send a multimodal request:"
+msgstr "将 `IMAGE_URL` 设置为执行 Prefill 的节点可访问的 HTTP(S) 图像 URL，并发送多模态请求："
+
+msgid ""
+"The values in Sections 5.1 and 5.2 are starting points rather than globally\n"
+"optimal settings. Tune `--max-num-seqs`, `--max-num-batched-tokens`, and\n"
+"`--gpu-memory-utilization` together for the target input length, image sizes,\n"
+"output length, and concurrency. Keep DP4/TP4 for A3 single-node deployment,\n"
+"or Prefill DP4/TP4 and Decode DP8/TP2 for A3 PD deployment, until an\n"
+"alternative configuration has been validated."
+msgstr ""
+"5.1 和 5.2 节中的值是起点，而非全局最优设置。请针对目标输入长度、图像尺寸、输出长度和并发量，协同调优 `--max-num-"
+"seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens` 和 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。在验证替代配置之前，A3 "
+"单节点部署请保持 DP4/TP4，A3 PD 部署请保持 Prefill DP4/TP4 和 Decode DP8/TP2。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- The documented A3 deployments use either one server in colocated mode or two\n"
+"  servers in 1P1D mode, with an Ascend W8A8 checkpoint and INT8 Engram storage.\n"
+"- The A2 configuration is retained unchanged and is not revalidated by this\n"
+"  update. Its revised configuration will be documented separately.\n"
+"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash currently supports only model runner V1 on Ascend. Keep\n"
+"  `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` in every A3 serving script. Pipeline parallelism\n"
+"  is not covered by this guide.\n"
+"- In the A3 PD example, Prefill runs in eager mode. Decode uses\n"
+"  `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph for the target model and eager execution for the\n"
+"  DSpark draft model.\n"
 "- Production performance qualification and task-level accuracy evaluation are\n"
 "  not complete."
 msgstr ""
-"- 文档中所述的部署使用两台 Atlas 800 A3 服务器或四台\n"
-"  Atlas 800 A2 服务器，以及采用 INT8 Engram 存储的昇腾 W8A8 checkpoint。\n"
-"- 本指南不支持 Prefill-Decode 分离、流水线并行和 model runner V2。\n"
-"- DSpark draft 执行以 eager 模式运行，而目标模型使用\n"
-"  `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph。\n"
-"- 生产性能认证和任务级精度评估\n"
-"  尚未完成。"
+"- 文档中描述的 A3 部署使用单台服务器混布模式或两台服务器 1P1D 模式，采用昇腾 W8A8 权重和 INT8 Engram 存储。\n"
+"- A2 配置保持不变，本次更新未重新验证。其修订后的配置将单独记录。\n"
+"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 目前在昇腾上仅支持 model runner V1。请在每个 A3 服务脚本中保持 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`。本指南不涵盖流水线并行。\n"
+"- 在 A3 PD 示例中，Prefill 以 eager 模式运行。Decode 对目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph，对 DSpark 草稿模型使用 eager 执行。\n"
+"- 生产性能认证和任务级精度评估尚未完成。"
+
+msgid "## 12 Bounded Replay Compatibility for vLLM 0.30.0"
+msgstr "## 12 vLLM 0.30.0 的有界重放兼容性"
+
+msgid ""
+"For vLLM 0.30.0 images without the upstream replay protocol, the Ascend plugin\n"
+"backports configuration, request payloads, and local prefix-hit admission logic.\n"
+"Installed vLLM files and compiled operators remain unchanged. The compatibility\n"
+"path is disabled by default. Enable it explicitly with:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于不含上游重放协议的 vLLM 0.30.0 镜像，昇腾插件回移了配置、请求负载和本地前缀命中准入逻辑。已安装的 vLLM "
+"文件和已编译算子保持不变。该兼容路径默认禁用。可通过以下方式显式启用："
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `--no-swa-bounded-replay` to disable replay explicitly. vLLM builds with\n"
+"native replay use the upstream implementation. Compatibility is detected from\n"
+"the replay interfaces rather than a version string. Configuration and wire\n"
+"fields are registered before use; scheduler and cache behavior is patched only\n"
+"when replay is enabled. Unsupported scheduler source bodies fail explicitly.\n"
+"The backport supports local prefix caching only; enabling replay with a KV\n"
+"connector raises an error. Existing replay restrictions still apply to PCP and\n"
+"Ascend modes that use independent scheduler copies."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `--no-swa-bounded-replay` 可显式禁用重放。具有原生重放的 vLLM "
+"构建使用上游实现。兼容性通过重放接口而非版本字符串来检测。配置和传输字段在使用前注册；仅当启用重放时才修补调度器和缓存行为。不支持的调度器源码体会显式失败。该回移仅支持本地前缀缓存；在启用"
+" KV connector 的情况下启用重放会引发错误。现有的重放限制仍适用于使用独立调度器副本的 PCP 和昇腾模式。"
+
+msgid ""
+"SWA caches do not participate in prefix reuse. After a hit in another cache\n"
+"group, the scheduler recomputes the final SWA window of the cached prefix.\n"
+"The worker masks writes to shared cache groups during replay and clamps the\n"
+"visible SWA range. Hits no longer than the window are recomputed in full.\n"
+"After preemption, readmission recalculates and forwards the replay boundary."
+msgstr ""
+"SWA 缓存不参与前缀复用。在另一个缓存组中命中后，调度器会重新计算已缓存前缀的最后一个 SWA 窗口。worker "
+"在重放期间屏蔽对共享缓存组的写入，并钳制可见的 SWA 范围。不超过窗口的命中会被完整重新计算。抢占后，重新准入会重新计算并转发重放边界。"
+
+msgid "### 12.1 Real-Weight Validation"
+msgstr "### 12.1 真实权重验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following A5 regression configuration uses TP1/DP4/EP4. Use the existing\n"
+"CANN environment and compiled Ascend operators before running it:"
+msgstr "以下 A5 回归配置使用 TP1/DP4/EP4。运行前请使用现有的 CANN 环境和已编译的昇腾算子："
+
+msgid ""
+"First save a baseline from a replay-disabled service, then send the same\n"
+"requests to a replay-enabled service:"
+msgstr "首先从禁用重放的服务保存基线，然后将相同的请求发送到启用重放的服务："
+
+msgid ""
+"Validation requires successful HTTP requests, outputs matching the baseline,\n"
+"and an actual `SWA bounded replay is active` message in the service log.\n"
+"Startup success or a true configuration field alone does not prove replay was\n"
+"exercised. Cross-chunk regression should also use a token budget smaller than\n"
+"the SWA window."
+msgstr ""
+"验证要求 HTTP 请求成功、输出与基线匹配，并且服务日志中出现实际的 `SWA bounded replay is active` "
+"消息。仅启动成功或配置字段为 true 并不能证明重放已被执行。跨 chunk 回归还应使用小于 SWA 窗口的 token 预算。"
