-"16）上。"
-
-msgid ""
-"`Kimi-K2.5-w4a8` can be deployed across multiple nodes using data "
-"parallelism. This deployment mode requires at least 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × "
-"8) nodes."
-msgstr "`Kimi-K2.5-w4a8`可以使用数据并行跨多个节点部署。此部署模式至少需要2个Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）节点。"
-
-msgid ""
-"- **Prefill nodes** focus on high-throughput prompt processing, optimized for compute and communication (e.g., enabling sequence parallelism for Allreduce acceleration).\n"
-"- **Decode nodes** focus on low-latency token generation, optimized for memory bandwidth (e.g., enabling MLAPO fusion operators)."
-msgstr ""
-"- **Prefill节点**专注于高吞吐量的提示处理，针对计算和通信进行了优化（例如，启用序列并行以加速Allreduce）。\n"
-"- **Decode节点**专注于低延迟的令牌生成，针对内存带宽进行了优化（例如，启用MLAPO融合算子）。"
-
-msgid ""
-"Take Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) for example, we recommend to deploy 2P1D (4 "
-"nodes) rather than 1P1D (2 nodes), because there is not enough NPU memory to"
-" serve high concurrency in 1P1D case."
-msgstr ""
-"以Atlas 800 A3（64GB × "
-"16）为例，我们建议部署2P1D（4个节点）而不是1P1D（2个节点），因为在1P1D情况下没有足够的NPU内存来服务高并发。"
-
-msgid "- `Kimi-K2.5-w4a8 2P1D`: requires 4 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) nodes."
-msgstr "- `Kimi-K2.5-w4a8 2P1D`：需要4个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）节点。"
-
-msgid ""
-"> `*Total NPUs` indicates the total number of NPUs used across all nodes. 1 "
-"node = 1 Atlas 800 A3 server (64GB × 16 NPUs)."
-msgstr ""
-"> `*Total NPUs`表示所有节点上使用的NPU总数。1个节点 = 1台Atlas 800 A3服务器（64GB × 16个NPU）。"
