-msgid "### 9.2 Tuning Guidelines"
-msgstr "### 9.2 调优指南"
-
-msgid "#### 9.2.1 General Tuning Reference"
-msgstr "#### 9.2.1 通用调优参考"
-
-msgid ""
-"Please refer to the [Public Performance Tuning "
-"Documentation](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)"
-" for tuning methods."
-msgstr ""
-"调优方法请参考[公共性能调优文档](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。"
-
-msgid "#### 9.2.2 Recommended tuning order"
-msgstr "#### 9.2.2 推荐调优顺序"
-
-msgid ""
-"1. Set the deployment topology first. Use single-node deployment for validation, MP deployment for simple multi-node serving, and PD disaggregation when prefill and decode need different resource ratios.\n"
-"2. Choose the maximum context length with `--max-model-len`. Multimodal requests consume KV cache for both text tokens and visual tokens, so reduce image resolution, image count, `--max-num-seqs`, or context length if OOM occurs.\n"
-"3. Tune multimodal limits. Use `--limit-mm-per-prompt.image` and `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video` to match your request shape. Disable video with `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` for image-only services.\n"
-"4. Tune `--max-num-batched-tokens`. Larger values usually improve prefill throughput but increase activation memory. Decode-heavy workloads usually need smaller values.\n"
-"5. Tune `--max-num-seqs` according to service concurrency. Requests above this value wait in the queue and the waiting time is counted in TTFT and TPOT.\n"
-"6. Tune `--gpu-memory-utilization`. Increase it to provide more KV cache, but leave headroom for runtime memory fluctuation, image preprocessing, and expert imbalance.\n"
-"7. Tune ACLGraph capture. `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` is recommended for decode. If you set `cudagraph_capture_sizes` manually, include common decode batch sizes."
-msgstr ""
-"1. 首先设置部署拓扑。使用单节点部署进行验证，使用 MP 部署进行简单的多节点服务，当预填充和解码需要不同资源比例时使用 PD 分离。\n"
-"2. 使用 `--max-model-len` 选择最大上下文长度。多模态请求会消耗文本令牌和视觉令牌的 KV 缓存，因此如果发生 OOM，请降低图像分辨率、图像数量、`--max-num-seqs` 或上下文长度。\n"
-"3. 调整多模态限制。使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt.image` 和 `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video` 匹配您的请求形状。对于纯图像服务，使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` 禁用视频。\n"
-"4. 调整 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。较大的值通常能提高预填充吞吐量，但会增加激活内存。解码密集型工作负载通常需要较小的值。\n"
-"5. 根据服务并发数调整 `--max-num-seqs`。超过此值的请求将在队列中等待，等待时间会计入 TTFT 和 TPOT。\n"
-"6. 调整 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。增加该值以提供更多 KV 缓存，但需为运行时内存波动、图像预处理和专家不平衡预留空间。\n"
-"7. 调整 ACLGraph 捕获。解码推荐使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。如果手动设置 `cudagraph_capture_sizes`，请包含常见的解码批次大小。"
-
-msgid "### 9.3 Model-Specific Optimizations"
-msgstr "### 9.3 模型特定优化"
-
-msgid "| Optimization | Enablement | Benefit | Notes |"
-msgstr "| 优化项 | 启用方式 | 收益 | 备注 |"
-
-msgid ""
-"| Multimodal prompt limits | `--limit-mm-per-prompt.image`, `--limit-mm-per-"
-"prompt.video` | Avoids reserving memory for unused media types. | Disable "
-"video for image-only serving. |"
-msgstr ""
-"| 多模态提示限制 | `--limit-mm-per-prompt.image`, `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video` | "
-"避免为未使用的媒体类型预留内存。 | 纯图像服务时禁用视频。 |"
-
-msgid ""
-"| Multimodal processor cache | `--mm-processor-cache-gb` | Caches processed "
-"media features when repeated media appears. | Set to 0 for memory-"
-"constrained validation. |"
-msgstr ""
-"| 多模态处理器缓存 | `--mm-processor-cache-gb` | 当重复媒体出现时缓存已处理的媒体特征。 | 内存受限的验证场景设置为 "
-"0。 |"
-
-msgid ""
-"| Full decode ACLGraph | `--compilation-config "
-"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` | Reduces operator dispatch "
-"overhead and stabilizes decode performance. | Recommended for decode-heavy "
-"serving. |"
-msgstr ""
-"| 全解码 ACLGraph | `--compilation-config "
-"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` | 减少算子分发开销，稳定解码性能。 | "
-"推荐用于解码密集型服务。 |"
-
-msgid ""
-"| Prefix caching | `--enable-prefix-caching` | Improves repeated-prefix "
-"workloads. | Validate HBM usage first. For PD, start with prefix caching "
-"disabled. |"
-msgstr ""
-"| 前缀缓存 | `--enable-prefix-caching` | 改善重复前缀的工作负载。 | 首先验证 HBM 使用情况。对于 "
-"PD，建议从禁用前缀缓存开始。 |"
-
-msgid ""
-"| PD disaggregation | `--kv-transfer-config` | Separates prefill and decode "
-"resources. | Ensure producer/consumer DP and TP sizes match the actual "
-"topology. |"
-msgstr ""
-"| PD 分离 | `--kv-transfer-config` | 分离预填充和解码资源。 | 确保生产者/消费者的 DP 和 TP "
-"大小与实际拓扑匹配。 |"
-
-msgid "## 10 FAQ"
-msgstr "## 10 常见问题解答"
-
-msgid ""
-"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, refer to"
-" [Public FAQs](../../faqs.md). This section only covers model-specific "
-"issues for Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct."
-msgstr ""
-"常见环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参考[公共常见问题解答](../../faqs.md)。本节仅涵盖 "
-"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 的模型特定问题。"
-
-msgid ""
-"### Q1: Why does the service report OOM during startup or soon after "
-"accepting requests?"
-msgstr "### Q1：为什么服务在启动时或刚接受请求后就报告 OOM？"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Phenomenon:** The service fails during profile run, or it starts "
-"successfully but reports OOM when real traffic arrives."
-msgstr "**现象：** 服务在性能分析阶段失败，或启动成功但在真实流量到来时报告 OOM。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Cause:** Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct has high weight, KV cache, and "
-"multimodal preprocessing memory requirements. Large `--max-model-len`, large"
-" `--max-num-seqs`, large `--max-num-batched-tokens`, high image resolution, "
-"too many images per prompt, or high `--gpu-memory-utilization` can leave "
-"insufficient HBM headroom."
-msgstr ""
-"**原因：** Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 对权重、KV 缓存和多模态预处理内存有较高需求。较大的 `--max-"
-"model-len`、`--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens`、高图像分辨率、每个提示中图像过多或较高的 "
-"`--gpu-memory-utilization` 可能导致 HBM 余量不足。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Solution:** Use the W8A8 model with `--quantization ascend` when possible,"
-" lower `--max-model-len`, lower `--max-num-seqs`, lower `--max-num-batched-"
-"tokens`, lower image/video limits, or reduce `--gpu-memory-utilization`. "
-"Keep `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`."
-msgstr ""
-"**解决方案：** 尽可能使用带有 `--quantization ascend` 的 W8A8 模型，降低 `--max-model-"
-"len`、`--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens`，降低图像/视频限制，或减少 `--gpu-"
-"memory-utilization`。保持 `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`。"
-
-msgid "### Q2: Why does multi-node MP deployment hang during initialization?"
-msgstr "### Q2：为什么多节点 MP 部署在初始化期间会挂起？"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Phenomenon:** One node waits for other ranks, HCCL initialization times "
-"out, or the headless node exits."
-msgstr "**现象：** 一个节点等待其他 rank，HCCL 初始化超时，或 headless 节点退出。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Cause:** Network interface names, IP addresses, DP ranks, or RPC ports are"
-" inconsistent across nodes."
-msgstr "**原因：** 各节点间的网络接口名称、IP 地址、DP rank 或 RPC 端口不一致。"
-
-msgid "### Q3: Why is video disabled in the image-only examples?"
-msgstr "### Q3：为什么在纯图像示例中禁用了视频？"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Phenomenon:** The service reserves more memory than expected, or startup "
-"OOM occurs even when requests only contain images."
-msgstr "**现象：** 服务预留的内存超出预期，或者即使请求仅包含图像，启动时也会发生 OOM。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Cause:** Allowing video inputs can reserve memory for long visual "
-"embeddings and preprocessing paths that are not needed by image-only "
-"workloads."
-msgstr "**原因：** 允许视频输入可能会为长的视觉嵌入和预处理路径预留内存，而这些对于纯图像工作负载是不需要的。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Solution:** Use `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` for image-only serving. "
-"Enable video only when your workload needs it, and lower `--max-model-len` "
-"or request concurrency if needed."
-msgstr ""
-"**解决方案：** 对于纯图像服务，使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0`。仅在工作负载需要时启用视频，并在必要时降低 "
-"`--max-model-len` 或请求并发数。"
-
-msgid "### Q4: Why does enabling prefix caching not improve performance?"
-msgstr "### Q4：为什么启用前缀缓存不能提升性能？"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Phenomenon:** Prefix caching is enabled, but throughput or latency does "
-"not improve."
-msgstr "**现象：** 已启用前缀缓存，但吞吐量或延迟没有改善。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Cause:** Prefix caching only helps when requests share reusable prefixes. "
-"Random prompts, unique images, or low cache hit rates may add memory "
-"pressure without visible gains."
-msgstr "**原因：** 前缀缓存仅在请求共享可重用前缀时才有帮助。随机提示、唯一图像或低缓存命中率可能会增加内存压力而看不到明显收益。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Solution:** Enable prefix caching for repeated-prefix workloads. For "
-"random benchmark datasets, memory-constrained long-context workloads, or PD "
-"validation, compare with `--no-enable-prefix-caching`."
-msgstr ""
-"**解决方案：** 对重复前缀的工作负载启用前缀缓存。对于随机基准数据集、内存受限的长上下文工作负载或 PD 验证，与 `--no-enable-"
-"prefix-caching` 进行比较。"
-
-msgid "### Q5: Why does PD disaggregation fail to transfer KV cache?"
-msgstr "### Q5：为什么 PD 分离无法传输 KV 缓存？"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Phenomenon:** Requests reach the proxy or prefill service, but decode "
-"nodes do not produce output or report KV transfer errors."
-msgstr "**现象：** 请求到达代理或预填充服务，但解码节点不产生输出或报告 KV 传输错误。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Cause:** The Mooncake connector ports, producer/consumer roles, or "
-"`kv_connector_extra_config` DP/TP sizes do not match the actual topology."
-msgstr ""
-"**原因：** Mooncake 连接器端口、生产者/消费者角色或 `kv_connector_extra_config` 的 DP/TP "
-"大小与实际拓扑不匹配。"
-
-msgid ""
-"**Solution:** Check `kv_role`, `kv_port`, and the prefill/decode DP/TP sizes"
-" on all nodes. Start from the validated topology in Section 5.4, then change"
-" one dimension at a time."
-msgstr ""
-"**解决方案：** 检查所有节点上的 `kv_role`、`kv_port` 以及预填充/解码的 DP/TP 大小。从第 5.4 "
-"节中已验证的拓扑开始，然后一次更改一个维度。"
-
