+
+msgid ""
+"| `mlp_tensor_parallel_size`       | int  | `0` | The custom tensor parallel"
+" size of `mlp`.       |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `mlp_tensor_parallel_size`       | int  | `0` | `mlp` 的自定义张量并行大小。       |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `lmhead_tensor_parallel_size`    | int  | `0` | The custom tensor parallel"
+" size of `lm_head`.    |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `lmhead_tensor_parallel_size`    | int  | `0` | `lm_head` 的自定义张量并行大小。    |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `embedding_tensor_parallel_size` | int  | `0` | The custom tensor parallel"
+" size of `embedding`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `embedding_tensor_parallel_size` | int  | `0` | `embedding` 的自定义张量并行大小。 |"
+
+msgid "**ascend_warmup_config**"
+msgstr "**ascend_warmup_config**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both warmups run on a background thread during weight loading. The worker "
+"waits for them at the end of model loading, before memory profiling and KV "
+"cache allocation."
+msgstr "两个预热都在权重加载期间于后台线程中运行。worker 会在模型加载结束时、内存分析和 KV 缓存分配之前等待它们完成。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_early_kernel_warmup` | bool | `False` | Compile the rejection "
+"sampler, penalty, and RMS norm Triton warmup kernels while weights load, so "
+"the regular kernel warmup hits the Triton cache. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_early_kernel_warmup` | bool | `False` | 在权重加载期间编译拒绝采样器、惩罚和 RMS "
+"norm 的 Triton 预热内核，以便常规内核预热能够命中 Triton 缓存。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_early_nz_warmup` | bool | `False` | Pay the one-time lazy "
+"initialization of the first NZ format cast while weights load. Independent "
+"of the quantization scheme. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_early_nz_warmup` | bool | `False` | 在权重加载期间完成首次 NZ "
+"格式转换的一次性惰性初始化。与量化方案无关。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"- **Model Runner V2** accepts `load_collection_phase` and `stair_config` here.\n"
+"  Configure upstream EPLB through `--enable-eplb` and `--eplb-config`. Ascend\n"
+"  uses the STAIR policy by default and asynchronous Gloo movement. Select\n"
+"  `default` or `stair` only through the upstream `--eplb-config.policy`\n"
+"  option. See the\n"
+"  [EPLB user guide](../feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md#advanced-stair-tuning)\n"
+"  for the advanced STAIR fields and their defaults.\n"
+"- **Model Runner V1** accepts the legacy fields below except\n"
+"  `load_collection_phase`.\n"
+"  MRv1 does not accept upstream `--enable-eplb` on Ascend."
+msgstr ""
+"- **Model Runner V2** 在此接受 `load_collection_phase` 和 `stair_config`。\n"
+"  通过 `--enable-eplb` 和 `--eplb-config` 配置上游 EPLB。昇腾\n"
+"  默认使用 STAIR 策略以及异步 Gloo 迁移。仅通过上游 `--eplb-config.policy`\n"
+"  选项选择 `default` 或 `stair`。有关高级 STAIR 字段及其默认值，请参阅\n"
+"  [EPLB 用户指南](../feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md#advanced-stair-tuning)。\n"
+"- **Model Runner V1** 接受以下旧版字段，但\n"
+"  `load_collection_phase` 除外。\n"
+"  MRv1 在昇腾上不接受上游 `--enable-eplb`。"
