+msgid "#### Models"
+msgstr "#### 模型"
+
+msgid ""
+"Fine-grained TP currently supports **MoE models only**. The constraint is "
+"enforced at configuration load: a non-MoE model fails at startup with `The "
+"finegrained tp sizes can be enabled only for MOE models.`"
+msgstr ""
+"细粒度 TP 目前**仅支持 MoE 模型**。该约束在配置加载时强制执行：非 MoE 模型会在启动时失败，并报错 `The finegrained "
+"tp sizes can be enabled only for MOE models.`"
+
+msgid ""
+"To check whether a checkpoint qualifies, look at its `config.json`: the "
+"model counts as a MoE model when the config exposes routed experts through "
+"any of the fields `n_routed_experts` (DeepSeek-style), `num_local_experts` "
+"(Mixtral-style), `num_experts`, `moe_num_experts`, or MoE blocks under "
+"`block_configs`. Checkpoints such as DeepSeek-V3/R1, the Qwen3 MoE series, "
+"GLM MoE variants, Kimi-K2, and MiniMax-M3 qualify; dense checkpoints such as"
+" Llama or the dense Qwen series do not."
+msgstr ""
+"要检查某个 checkpoint 是否符合条件，请查看其 `config.json`：当配置通过以下任一字段暴露路由专家时，该模型即被视为 MoE "
+"模型——`n_routed_experts`（DeepSeek 风格）、`num_local_experts`（Mixtral "
+"风格）、`num_experts`、`moe_num_experts`，或 `block_configs` 下的 MoE 块。符合条件的 "
+"checkpoint 包括 DeepSeek-V3/R1、Qwen3 MoE 系列、GLM MoE 变体、Kimi-K2 和 MiniMax-M3；而 "
+"Llama 或稠密 Qwen 系列等稠密 checkpoint 则不符合条件。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The restriction comes from the sharding axis: fine-grained TP shards weights"
+" across the data-parallel (DP) dimension, and only MoE deployments keep a "
+"cross-rank DP group — for a dense model, every DP rank runs as an "
+"independent DP=1 engine, leaving no group to shard across."
+msgstr ""
+"该限制源于切分轴：细粒度 TP 在数据并行（DP）维度上切分权重，而只有 MoE 部署会保留跨 rank 的 DP 组——对于稠密模型，每个 DP "
+"rank 都作为独立的 DP=1 引擎运行，没有可供切分的组。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Within a qualifying MoE model, `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` shards the dense "
+"MLP layers — for example, the first three dense layers of DeepSeek-R1; the "
+"routed experts of the MoE layers are sharded by expert parallel instead, and"
+" shared experts stay replicated."
+msgstr ""
+"在符合条件的 MoE 模型中，`mlp_tensor_parallel_size` 会切分稠密 MLP 层——例如 DeepSeek-R1 "
