+msgid ""
+"Fine-grained TP shards the configured layer **across the data-parallel (DP) "
+"dimension**, not the standard tensor-parallel (TP) dimension. Whether a knob"
+" can be combined with standard TP therefore differs per component:"
+msgstr ""
+"细粒度 TP 将所配置的层**在数据并行（DP）维度上**切分，而非标准张量并行（TP）维度。因此，某个开关能否与标准 TP 组合使用因组件而异："
