+msgid ""
+"| `o_proj` / `mlp` | **Cannot be combined — rejected at config load.** For "
+"`o_proj`, the DSA attention output is reshaped with `n_local_groups = "
+"n_groups // tp_size` (standard TP), while the wo_a/wo_b weights are sharded "
+"by the OTP group (DP dimension); the two axes no longer align (for MLP, the "
+"combination is simply untested). Both knobs require `tensor_parallel_size =="
+" 1`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `o_proj` / `mlp` | **不能组合——在配置加载时被拒绝。** 对于 `o_proj`，DSA attention 输出使用 "
