+"组（DP 维度）切分；这两个轴不再对齐（对于 MLP，该组合只是未经测试）。这两个开关都要求 `tensor_parallel_size == 1`。 "
+"|"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `embedding` / LM head | **Can be combined.** With a knob enabled, these "
+"modules always resolve to the fine-grained plan: their weights are sharded "
