 "- 输入序列长度短于 `1024` 个 token 的 P 节点工作负载。\n"
 "- 每个 die 的专家数量 `> 8`（在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上为 `> 16`），或每个 die 的负载低于 `128` 个 token 的 D 节点工作负载。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- **Model Runner V2 (MRv2)** uses the upstream vLLM EPLB controller,\n"
+"  configuration, default policy, load window, asynchronous worker, and\n"
+"  rearrangement lifecycle. Ascend adds the HIXL and Gloo movement adapters\n"
+"  and the `load_collection_phase` extension.\n"
+"- **Model Runner V1 (MRv1)** retains the legacy vLLM Ascend dynamic, recording,\n"
+"  and static EPLB modes."
+msgstr ""
+"- **Model Runner V2 (MRv2)** 使用上游 vLLM EPLB 控制器、配置、默认策略、负载窗口、异步 worker 以及重排生命周期。昇腾新增了 HIXL 和 Gloo 迁移适配器以及 `load_collection_phase` 扩展。\n"
+"- **Model Runner V1 (MRv1)** 保留原有的 vLLM Ascend 动态、记录和静态 EPLB 模式。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Select MRv2 explicitly when the model or environment does not select it by\n"
+"default. Enable expert parallelism and upstream EPLB. Ascend selects STAIR\n"
+"as the upstream policy default and automatically uses HIXL when available,\n"
+"falling back to Gloo otherwise. Movement is asynchronous only. The STAIR\n"
+"defaults do not require tuning."
+msgstr ""
+"当模型或环境未默认选择 MRv2 时，请显式选择 MRv2。启用专家并行和上游 EPLB。昇腾将 STAIR 选为上游策略的默认值，并在可用时自动使用 "
+"HIXL，否则回退到 Gloo。迁移仅支持异步方式。STAIR 的默认值无需调优。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `policy` | `stair` on Ascend | Select `stair` for the Ascend policy or "
+"`default` for upstream-policy comparison experiments. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `policy` | 昇腾上为 `stair` | 选择 `stair` 使用昇腾策略，或选择 `default` 进行上游策略对比实验。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `communicator` | Auto (`None`) on Ascend | Leave unset to use HIXL when "
+"available and Gloo otherwise; set `hixl` or `torch_gloo` to select a backend"
+" explicitly. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `communicator` | 昇腾上为自动（`None`） | 保持未设置以在可用时使用 HIXL，否则使用 Gloo；设置 `hixl` 或 "
+"`torch_gloo` 可显式选择后端。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"These fields may also be passed together as JSON through `--eplb-config`.\n"
+"They must not be placed in `--additional-config` for MRv2.\n"
+"Automatic selection requires the same HIXL binding class on every EPLB\n"
+"rank: each rank resolves either the official `hixl` Python package\n"
+"distributed with CANN HIXL or vllm_ascend's ctypes binding, which drives\n"
+"the local toolkit libraries directly (`libcann_hixl.so`, for CANN\n"
+"distributions that ship the library without the package). The ranks reach\n"
+"a group-wide consensus at startup; if any rank has no usable HIXL binding,\n"
+"or the binding classes differ between ranks, the whole group falls back to\n"
+"`torch_gloo` CPU staging and the decision is logged."
+msgstr ""
+"这些字段也可以通过 `--eplb-config` 以 JSON 形式一起传入。\n"
+"在 MRv2 中，它们不得放在 `--additional-config` 中。\n"
+"自动选择要求每个 EPLB rank 上具有相同的 HIXL 绑定类：每个 rank 解析为随 CANN HIXL 分发的官方 `hixl` Python 包，或 vllm_ascend 的 ctypes 绑定，后者直接驱动本地工具库（`libcann_hixl.so`，适用于随库分发但不带该包的 CANN 发行版）。各 rank 在启动时达成组内共识；如果任一 rank 没有可用的 HIXL 绑定，或各 rank 之间的绑定类不同，则整个组回退到 `torch_gloo` CPU 暂存，并记录该决策。"
+
+msgid ""
+"STAIR leaves both per-rank and cross-node migration limits unrestricted by\n"
+"default (`-1`) so that HIXL can use the available bandwidth. When the\n"
+"communicator falls back to Gloo automatically, Ascend clamps only the\n"
+"limits you have not set explicitly to `1` to avoid excessive CPU-staged\n"
+"transfers; explicitly configured values are kept (for example\n"
+"`cross_node_transfer_limit: 0` still forbids cross-node migrations) and a\n"
+"warning is logged. Explicitly setting `torch_gloo` or `hixl` also keeps\n"
+"your configured limits untouched."
+msgstr ""
+"STAIR 默认不限制单 rank 和跨节点迁移限制（`-1`），以便 HIXL 能够使用可用带宽。当通信器自动回退到 Gloo "
+"时，昇腾仅将你未显式设置的限值钳制为 `1`，以避免过多的 CPU 暂存传输；显式配置的值保持不变（例如 "
+"`cross_node_transfer_limit: 0` 仍然禁止跨节点迁移），并记录一条警告。显式设置 `torch_gloo` 或 `hixl`"
+" 也会保持你配置的限值不变。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Weight offload and prefetch are incompatible with upstream EPLB on Ascend. "
+"Enabling EPLB with `cpu_offload_gb > 0` or `offload_group_size > 0` raises a"
+" configuration error."
+msgstr ""
+"权重卸载和预取与昇腾上的上游 EPLB 不兼容。在 `cpu_offload_gb > 0` 或 `offload_group_size > 0` "
+"的情况下启用 EPLB 会引发配置错误。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Ascend extends the upstream `policy` field without adding a second selector.\n"
+"For example, use `--eplb-config.policy default` to run the upstream policy;\n"
+"omit it or set it to `stair` to run STAIR."
+msgstr ""
+"昇腾扩展了上游的 `policy` 字段，而没有新增第二个选择器。例如，使用 `--eplb-config.policy default` "
+"运行上游策略；省略该字段或将其设置为 `stair` 以运行 STAIR。"
+
+msgid ""
+"MRv2 supports asynchronous EPLB only and normalizes `use_async=false` to\n"
+"    asynchronous movement. It rejects elastic EP, legacy `dynamic_eplb`,\n"
+"    recording/static-map fields, `DYNAMIC_EPLB`, and `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD`, as\n"
+"    well as communicators other than Gloo and HIXL. HIXL requires the CANN HIXL\n"
+"    runtime and working device connectivity on every EPLB rank. Validate the\n"
+"    target model, topology, graph mode, and traffic independently before\n"
+"    production use."
+msgstr ""
+"MRv2 仅支持异步 EPLB，并将 `use_async=false` 规范化为异步迁移。它拒绝弹性 EP、旧版 "
+"`dynamic_eplb`、记录/静态映射字段、`DYNAMIC_EPLB` 和 `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD`，以及除 Gloo 和 "
+"HIXL 之外的通信器。HIXL 要求每个 EPLB rank 上具备 CANN HIXL "
+"运行时和正常工作的设备连接。在生产使用前，请独立验证目标模型、拓扑、图模式和流量。"
