+msgid "# KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store)"
+msgstr "# KV Cache 池（Ascend Store）"
+
+msgid "## Feature Introduction"
+msgstr "## 特性介绍"
+
+msgid ""
+"KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) is a cross-node KV Cache pooling storage "
+"feature provided by vLLM-Ascend. It writes KV Cache to external storage "
+"backends (Mooncake / Memcache / Yuanrong) via `AscendStoreConnector`, and "
+"works with the PD (Prefill/Decode) disaggregation architecture to share and "
+"reuse KV Cache across multiple vLLM instances, avoiding redundant "
+"recomputation of identical prefixes."
+msgstr ""
+"KV Cache Pool（Ascend Store）是 vLLM-Ascend 提供的跨节点 KV Cache 池化存储特性。它通过 "
+"`AscendStoreConnector` 将 KV Cache 写入外部存储后端（Mooncake / Memcache / "
+"Yuanrong），并与 PD（Prefill/Decode）分离架构配合，在多个 vLLM 实例之间共享和复用 KV "
+"Cache，避免相同前缀的重复计算。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Key benefits include: memory decoupling between Prefill and Decode nodes in "
+"PD disaggregation deployments with independent scaling; cross-request/cross-"
+"node KV reuse reducing redundant Prefill computation; SSD Offload support "
+"for extended KV capacity; and transfer QoS priority control."
+msgstr ""
+"主要优势包括：在 PD 分离部署中实现 Prefill 与 Decode 节点的内存解耦并支持独立扩缩容；跨请求/跨节点的 KV 复用减少冗余的 "
+"Prefill 计算；支持 SSD Offload 以扩展 KV 容量；以及传输 QoS 优先级控制。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Supported since vLLM-Ascend v0.23.0 (using the latest version is "
+"recommended)."
+msgstr "自 vLLM-Ascend v0.23.0 起支持（推荐使用最新版本）。"
+
+msgid "### Usage Scenarios"
+msgstr "### 使用场景"
+
+msgid ""
+"KV Cache supports the following three external storage backends, choose the "
+"storage backend according to your workload requirements:"
+msgstr "KV Cache 支持以下三种外部存储后端，请根据业务需求选择合适的存储后端："
+
+msgid "| Scenario | Selection Guidance |"
+msgstr "| 场景 | 选择建议 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Mooncake backend | Default backend. Mooncake is Moonshot AI's open-source "
+"distributed KVCache system for LLM inference; choose it when SSD Offload for"
+" extended KV capacity or multi-tenant quota management is needed. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Mooncake 后端 | 默认后端。Mooncake 是 Moonshot AI 开源的面向 LLM 推理的分布式 KVCache 系统；当需要 "
+"SSD Offload 扩展 KV 容量或多租户配额管理时选择它。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Memcache backend | Based on MemFabric; choose it when A3 HCCS high-speed "
+"interconnect for lower transfer latency, or layer-by-layer KV transfer "
+"(`use_layerwise`), is needed. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Memcache 后端 | 基于 MemFabric；当需要 A3 HCCS 高速互联以降低传输时延，或需要逐层 KV "
+"传输（`use_layerwise`）时选择它。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Yuanrong backend | Based on openyuanrong-datasystem (an openEuler open-"
+"source distributed foundation for integrated training and inference); choose"
+" it when multi-node deployment, Remote H2D transfer, or openEuler ecosystem "
+"integration is needed. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Yuanrong 后端 | 基于 openyuanrong-datasystem（openEuler "
+"开源的训推一体的分布式基础软件）；当需要多节点部署、Remote H2D 传输或与 openEuler 生态集成时选择它。 |"
+
+msgid "### Constraints and Limitations"
+msgstr "### 约束与限制"
+
+msgid "**Common**"
+msgstr "**通用**"
+
+msgid "| Category | Constraints |"
+msgstr "| 类别 | 约束 |"
+
+msgid "| Hardware | Supported hardware A2/A3/950PR&950DT Products. |"
+msgstr "| 硬件 | 支持的硬件为 A2/A3/Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Software Dependencies | For HDK/CANN requirements of each series, see the "
+"[HDK and CANN Version Compatibility Reference](#hdk-and-cann-version-"
+"compatibility-reference). |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 软件依赖 | 各系列的 HDK/CANN 要求请参见 [HDK 与 CANN 版本配套关系参考](#hdk-and-cann-version-"
+"compatibility-reference)。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Model | `kv_load_failure_policy=recompute` does not yet support hybrid "
+"attention models (e.g., DeepSeekV4, Qwen 3.5). |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 模型 | `kv_load_failure_policy=recompute` 尚不支持混合注意力模型（例如 DeepSeekV4、Qwen "
+"3.5）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Feature Mutex | `use_layerwise` only supported on the Prefill node of the "
+"Mooncake/Memcache backends. |"
+msgstr "| 特性互斥 | `use_layerwise` 仅在 Mooncake/Memcache 后端的 Prefill 节点上支持。 |"
+
+msgid "**Backend-specific**"
+msgstr "**后端特定**"
+
+msgid "=== \"Mooncake backend\""
+msgstr "=== \"Mooncake 后端\""
+
+msgid "| Category | Constraints |"
+msgstr "| 类别 | 约束 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | Software Dependencies | • Mooncake >= 0.3.11.post1 (non-default tenant"
+" requires >= 0.3.12).<br>• Mooncake wheel requires glibc >= 2.35. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | 软件依赖 | • Mooncake >= 0.3.11.post1（非默认租户要求 >= 0.3.12）。<br>• Mooncake "
+"wheel 要求 glibc >= 2.35。 |"
+
+msgid ""
