+msgid "## Scenario 1: Mooncake Backend"
+msgstr "## 场景 1：Mooncake 后端"
+
+msgid "### Configuration Examples"
+msgstr "### 配置示例"
+
+msgid "#### Environment Preparation"
+msgstr "#### 环境准备"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Verify that `hccn.conf` exists in the environment. When using Docker, "
+"mount it into the container:"
+msgstr "1. 确认环境中存在 `hccn.conf`。使用 Docker 时，请将其挂载到容器中："
+
+msgid ""
+"950PR&950DT Products requires extra device and config mounts: `/dev/ummu`, "
+"`/dev/uburma`, `/usr/bin/urma_admin`, `/lib/route.conf`, "
