+msgstr ""
+"Ascend "
+"950PR&950DT系列产品需要额外挂载设备和配置：`/dev/ummu`、`/dev/uburma`、`/usr/bin/urma_admin`、`/lib/route.conf`、`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`。"
+
+msgid "2. Synchronize `PYTHONHASHSEED` across all nodes:"
+msgstr "2. 在所有节点间同步 `PYTHONHASHSEED`："
+
+msgid "#### Step 1: Software Installation"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 1：软件安装"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Check the Mooncake wheel dependency (for the glibc version requirement, "
+"see Software Dependencies in Constraints and Limitations):"
+msgstr "1. 检查 Mooncake wheel 依赖（glibc 版本要求请参见约束与限制中的软件依赖）："
+
+msgid "2. Install Mooncake:"
+msgstr "2. 安装 Mooncake："
+
+msgid "#### Step 2: Configure mooncake.json and Start mooncake_master"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 2：配置 mooncake.json 并启动 mooncake_master"
+
+msgid ""
+"> The following Mooncake guides are optional in-depth references; you can complete the deployment in this document without reading them:\n"
+">\n"
+"> - [Mooncake Store Deployment Guide](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/deployment/mooncake-store-deployment-guide.md): in-depth reference on Mooncake Store deployment architecture and operations, useful when customizing the deployment topology or troubleshooting the Store layer\n"
+"> - [SSD Offload](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/deployment/ssd/ssd-offload.md): advanced configuration reference for SSD Offload capacity planning and eviction policies"
+msgstr ""
+"> 以下 Mooncake 指南为可选的深入参考资料；不阅读它们也可以完成本文档中的部署：\n"
+">\n"
+"> - [Mooncake Store 部署指南](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/deployment/mooncake-store-deployment-guide.md)：关于 Mooncake Store 部署架构与运维的深入参考，在自定义部署拓扑或排查 Store 层问题时很有用\n"
+"> - [SSD Offload](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/main/docs/source/deployment/ssd/ssd-offload.md)：SSD Offload 容量规划与淘汰策略的高级配置参考"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Configure `mooncake.json` and point `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` to its full "
+"path:"
+msgstr "1. 配置 `mooncake.json`，并将 `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` 指向其完整路径："
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"    <summary>mooncake.json Parameters</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"    <summary>mooncake.json 参数</summary>"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `Parameter` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `参数` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `metadata_server` | str | No default | Yes | P2PHANDSHAKE | Configured"
+" as P2PHANDSHAKE. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `metadata_server` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | P2PHANDSHAKE | 配置为 P2PHANDSHAKE。 "
+"|"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `protocol` | str | No default | Yes | ascend | Must be set to `ascend`"
+" on NPU. |"
+msgstr "    | `protocol` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | ascend | 在 NPU 上必须设置为 `ascend`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `device_name` | str | \"\" (empty string) | No | Empty string | The "
+"ascend protocol does not use device names; leave empty. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `device_name` | str | \"\"（空字符串） | 否 | 空字符串 | Ascend 协议不使用设备名称；留空即可。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `master_server_address` | str | No default | Yes | <ip>:<port> | "
+"Master service IP and port. Can be overridden by the `MOONCAKE_MASTER` "
+"environment variable (takes precedence, useful for injecting the master "
+"address through Kubernetes). |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `master_server_address` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | <ip>:<port> | Master 服务 IP "
+"和端口。可通过 `MOONCAKE_MASTER` 环境变量覆盖（优先级更高，适用于通过 Kubernetes 注入 master 地址）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `global_segment_size` | str | No default | Yes | Must align to 1 GB "
+"(1024 MB / 1048576 KB / 1073741824 B) | Registered memory size per card to "
+"the KV Pool. Can be overridden by the `MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE` "
+"environment variable (takes precedence). |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `global_segment_size` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | 必须按 1 GB 对齐（1024 MB / 1048576"
+" KB / 1073741824 B） | 每张卡注册到 KV Pool 的内存大小。可通过 "
+"`MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE` 环境变量覆盖（优先级更高）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `preferred_segment` | bool | false | No | true / false | Whether to "
+"prefer storing KV on the local segment. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `preferred_segment` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 是否优先将 KV 存储在本地"
+" segment。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `prefer_alloc_in_same_node` | bool | true | No | true / false | "
+"Whether to prefer allocating KV on the same node. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `prefer_alloc_in_same_node` | bool | true | 否 | true / false | "
+"是否优先在同一节点上分配 KV。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `enable_ssd_offload` | bool | false | No | true / false | Whether to "
+"enable SSD offload. Environment variables are not supported. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `enable_ssd_offload` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 是否启用 SSD "
+"offload。不支持通过环境变量配置。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `ssd_offload_path` | str | No default | Required when SSD offload "
+"enabled | Absolute path | Absolute path for SSD offload data storage (for "
+"example, /nvme/mooncake_offload). The directory must exist and be writable "
+"by the vLLM process; create it before startup (`mkdir -p <path>`). Relative "
+"paths, symlinks, and paths containing `..` are rejected. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `ssd_offload_path` | str | 无默认值 | 启用 SSD offload 时必填 | 绝对路径 | SSD "
+"offload 数据存储的绝对路径（例如 /nvme/mooncake_offload）。该目录必须存在且 vLLM "
+"进程可写；请在启动前创建（`mkdir -p <path>`）。相对路径、符号链接以及包含 `..` 的路径将被拒绝。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `tenant_id` | str | default | No | String | Mooncake tenant namespace."
+" Missing, `null`, empty, or whitespace-only values use `default`; "
+"surrounding whitespace is removed. All Prefill, Decode, scheduler, and "
+"replica instances that share KV entries must use the same tenant ID. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `tenant_id` | str | default | 否 | 字符串 | Mooncake "
+"租户命名空间。缺失、`null`、空值或仅含空白字符的值将使用 `default`；首尾空白字符会被移除。所有共享 KV 条目的 "
+"Prefill、Decode、调度器和副本实例必须使用相同的租户 ID。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
+msgid "2. Start `mooncake_master` (only needs to run on one node):"
+msgstr "2. 启动 `mooncake_master`（只需在一个节点上运行）："
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"    <summary>mooncake_master Parameters</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"    <summary>mooncake_master 参数</summary>"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `Parameter` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `参数` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `port` | int | No default | Yes | Port number, must match the port in "
+"`master_server_address` in mooncake.json | Master service listening port. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `port` | int | 无默认值 | 是 | 端口号，必须与 mooncake.json 中 "
+"`master_server_address` 的端口一致 | Master 服务监听端口。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `eviction_high_watermark_ratio` | float | No default | No | Ratio, [0,"
+" 1] | Watermark where Mooncake Store performs eviction. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `eviction_high_watermark_ratio` | float | 无默认值 | 否 | 比例，[0, 1] | "
+"Mooncake Store 执行驱逐的水位线。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `eviction_ratio` | float | No default | No | Ratio, [0, 1] | Portion "
+"of stored objects to evict. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `eviction_ratio` | float | 无默认值 | 否 | 比例，[0, 1] | 要驱逐的已存储对象比例。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `default_kv_lease_ttl` | int | No default | No | Milliseconds; must be"
+" larger than `ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT` and `ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT` | "
+"Default lease TTL for KV objects (milliseconds). |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `default_kv_lease_ttl` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 毫秒；必须大于 "
+"`ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT` 和 `ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT` | KV 对象的默认租约 TTL（毫秒）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `enable_offload` | bool | false | Required when SSD offload enabled | "
+"true / false | Set to true to enable SSD offload in master. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `enable_offload` | bool | false | 启用 SSD offload 时必填 | true / false | "
+"设置为 true 以在 master 中启用 SSD offload。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `client_ttl` | int | 10 | No | Integer (seconds) | Seconds a client "
+"stays alive after the last Ping. See \"FAQ - Issue 2: SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND (SSD"
+" Offload)\". |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `client_ttl` | int | 10 | 否 | 整数（秒） | 客户端在最后一次 Ping 后保持存活的秒数。参见“FAQ - "
+"问题 2：SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND（SSD Offload）”。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `enable_multi_tenants` | bool | false | No | true / false | Enable "
+"strict multi-tenant mode. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `enable_multi_tenants` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 启用严格多租户模式。 "
+"|"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `tenant_quota_connector_type` | str | No default | Required when "
+"multi-tenant enabled | file / etcd | Tenant quota connector type. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `tenant_quota_connector_type` | str | 无默认值 | 启用多租户时必填 | file / etcd | "
+"租户配额连接器类型。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `tenant_quota_connector_uri` | str | No default | Required when multi-"
+"tenant enabled | Quota file path or etcd endpoints | Tenant quota file path "
+"or etcd endpoints. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `tenant_quota_connector_uri` | str | 无默认值 | 启用多租户时必填 | 配额文件路径或 etcd 端点"
+" | 租户配额文件路径或 etcd 端点。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
+msgid "#### Step 3: (Optional) Multi-Tenant Configuration"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 3：（可选）多租户配置"
+
+msgid "1. To enable strict multi-tenant isolation, start with:"
+msgstr "1. 要启用严格多租户隔离，请使用以下方式启动："
+
+msgid "Example tenant quota file (`/etc/mooncake/tenant_quotas.yaml`):"
+msgstr "租户配额文件示例（`/etc/mooncake/tenant_quotas.yaml`）："
+
+msgid "Notes on multi-tenant mode:"
+msgstr "多租户模式说明："
+
+msgid ""
+"- While strict multi-tenant mode is disabled, tenant IDs are ignored for object placement and objects remain in the `default` namespace.\n"
+"    - Strict mode rejects writes for unregistered tenants, including `default`, so every tenant used by vLLM-Ascend must appear in the policy.\n"
+"    - The file connector can be replaced with `etcd` when Mooncake is built with `STORE_USE_ETCD=ON`; in that case, set `tenant_quota_connector_uri` to the etcd endpoints.\n"
+"    - `tenant_id` is an instance-level namespace and quota identity, not an authentication mechanism. A client that can access Mooncake can still declare a tenant ID. Keep incompatible models, model versions, quantization formats, and KV layouts in separate model or release namespaces even when tenant isolation is enabled."
+msgstr ""
+"- 当严格多租户模式未启用时，租户 ID 在对象放置时会被忽略，对象仍保留在 `default` 命名空间中。\n"
+"    - 严格模式会拒绝未注册租户（包括 `default`）的写入，因此 vLLM-Ascend 使用的每个租户都必须出现在策略中。\n"
+"    - 当 Mooncake 使用 `STORE_USE_ETCD=ON` 构建时，文件连接器可以替换为 `etcd`；此时需将 `tenant_quota_connector_uri` 设置为 etcd 端点。\n"
+"    - `tenant_id` 是实例级命名空间和配额标识，而非认证机制。能够访问 Mooncake 的客户端仍可声明租户 ID。即使启用了租户隔离，也应将不兼容的模型、模型版本、量化格式和 KV 布局放在不同的模型或发布命名空间中。"
+
+msgid ""
+"2. Mooncake exposes tenant quota snapshots through the master metrics HTTP "
+"port (default `9003`):"
+msgstr "2. Mooncake 通过 master 指标 HTTP 端口（默认 `9003`）暴露租户配额快照："
+
+msgid "#### Step 4: Start vLLM inference service"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 4：启动 vLLM 推理服务"
+
+msgid "=== \"PD Disaggregation Scenario\""
+msgstr "=== \"PD 分离场景\""
+
+msgid ""
+"Using `MultiConnector` to simultaneously utilize both `MooncakeConnectorV1` "
+"and `AscendStoreConnector`: `MooncakeConnectorV1` performs kv_transfer, "
+"while `AscendStoreConnector` serves as the prefix-cache node."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `MultiConnector` 同时利用 `MooncakeConnectorV1` 和 "
+"`AscendStoreConnector`：`MooncakeConnectorV1` 执行 kv_transfer，而 "
+"`AscendStoreConnector` 作为前缀缓存节点。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. For A3 and 950PR&950DT Products Store/PD traffic separation, set "
+"`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` on both the prefill and decode nodes. The "
+"top-level resource configuration controls `MooncakeConnectorV1` PD traffic, "
+"and the `store` section controls `AscendStoreConnector` Mooncake Store "
+"traffic, so the two traffic classes do not compete on the same physical "
+"link."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 对于 Atlas A3系列产品和 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品的 Store/PD 流量分离，请在 prefill 和 "
+"decode 节点上都设置 `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG`。顶层资源配置控制 `MooncakeConnectorV1`"
+" 的 PD 流量，`store` 部分控制 `AscendStoreConnector` 的 Mooncake Store "
+"流量，从而使这两类流量不会在同一物理链路上竞争。"
+
+msgid "##### run_prefill.sh / run_decode.sh"
+msgstr "##### run_prefill.sh / run_decode.sh"
+
+msgid ""
+"2. Start the proxy_server (connecting Prefill and Decode nodes), replace "
+"localhost with the actual IP address:"
+msgstr "2. 启动 proxy_server（连接 Prefill 和 Decode 节点），将 localhost 替换为实际 IP 地址："
+
+msgid ""
+"3. To enable Decode node KV Cache storage for Prefill use with MLA models, "
+"add `consumer_is_to_put: true` to `AscendStoreConnector`; if Prefill enables"
+" PP, also set `prefill_pp_size` or `prefill_pp_layer_partition`:"
+msgstr ""
+"3. 要使 Decode 节点的 KV Cache 存储可供 MLA 模型的 Prefill 使用，请在 `AscendStoreConnector` "
+"中添加 `consumer_is_to_put: true`；如果 Prefill 启用了 PP，还需设置 `prefill_pp_size` 或 "
+"`prefill_pp_layer_partition`："
+
+msgid ""
+"4. To publish complete Decode blocks while keeping Prefill writes disabled, "
+"set `save_decode_cache: true` on the consumer. The first Decode save checks "
+"the aligned, reachable Prefill prefix and fills missing ancestor blocks. "
+"Later saves resume from the worker's last successful offset; failed ranges "
+"are checked again at the next completed-block boundary. This mode requires "
+"non-layerwise transfer. It writes KV to the Store for reuse and does not "
+"free the active request's NPU KV."
+msgstr ""
+"4. 要在保持 Prefill 写入禁用的同时发布完整的 Decode 块，请在消费者端设置 `save_decode_cache: true`。首次 "
+"Decode 保存会检查对齐的、可达的 Prefill 前缀，并填充缺失的祖先块。后续保存会从 worker "
+"上次成功的偏移量继续；失败的范围会在下一个完成块边界处重新检查。此模式要求非逐层传输。它会将 KV 写入 Store 以供复用，并且不会释放活动请求的 "
+"NPU KV。"
+
+msgid ""
+"When Prefill uses PP, configure `prefill_pp_size` or "
+"`prefill_pp_layer_partition` as in the preceding example so Decode writes "
+"compatible partition keys."
+msgstr ""
+"当 Prefill 使用 PP 时，请按照前面的示例配置 `prefill_pp_size` 或 "
+"`prefill_pp_layer_partition`，以便 Decode 写入兼容的分区键。"
+
+msgid "=== \"PD-Mixed Scenario\""
+msgstr "=== \"PD 混合场景\""
+
+msgid "##### pd_mix.sh"
+msgstr "##### pd_mix.sh"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Note:** For MooncakeStore with `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL` enabled, it is "
+"recommended to perform a warm-up phase before running actual performance "
+"benchmarks. Because HCCS one-sided communication connections are created "
+"lazily after instance launch, full-mesh connections require a one-time "
+"overhead (4 MB device memory per connection). Warm-up recommendation: input "
+"sequence length 8k, output sequence length 1, total requests 2-3x the number"
+" of devices."
+msgstr ""
+"**注意：** 对于启用了 `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL` 的 MooncakeStore，建议在运行实际性能基准测试之前先执行预热阶段。由于"
+" HCCS 单边通信连接是在实例启动后惰性创建的，全互联连接需要一次性开销（每个连接 4 MB 设备内存）。预热建议：输入序列长度 8k，输出序列长度 "
+"1，总请求数为设备数量的 2-3 倍。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The `kv_connector_extra_config` fields used in the scripts above are "
+"documented in [kv-transfer-config Common Parameters](#kv-transfer-config-"
+"common-parameters)."
+msgstr ""
+"上述脚本中使用的 `kv_connector_extra_config` 字段记录在 [kv-transfer-config 通用参数](#kv-"
+"transfer-config-common-parameters)中。"
+
+msgid "#### Step 5: MooncakeStore SSD Offload (Embedded Real Client Mode)"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 5：MooncakeStore SSD 卸载（嵌入式真实客户端模式）"
+
+msgid ""
+"In Mode A (Embedded Real Client), Mooncake is embedded in vLLM. When vLLM "
+"starts, `AscendStoreConnector`/`MooncakeBackend` automatically calls "
+"`MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()` using the settings in `mooncake.json`, "
+"with no separate `mooncake_client` process required."
+msgstr ""
+"在模式 A（嵌入式真实客户端）中，Mooncake 嵌入在 vLLM 中。当 vLLM "
+"启动时，`AscendStoreConnector`/`MooncakeBackend` 会使用 `mooncake.json` 中的设置自动调用 "
+"`MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()`，无需单独的 `mooncake_client` 进程。"
+
+msgid "SSD disk usage control environment variables:"
+msgstr "SSD 磁盘使用控制环境变量："
+
+msgid ""
+"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` risk: If not aligned to 1 GB (A3 "
+"+ FabricMem scenario), it may cause `adxl MallocMem` failures or "
+"`FileStorage init` segfaults. Always set to a multiple of 1 GB."
+msgstr ""
+"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 风险：如果未对齐到 1 GB（A3 + FabricMem "
+"场景），可能会导致 `adxl MallocMem` 失败或 `FileStorage init` 段错误。请始终设置为 1 GB 的倍数。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Note: `--max-num-batched-tokens` only chunks prefill compute; it does not "
+"reduce the memory required by `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`."
+msgstr ""
+"注意：`--max-num-batched-tokens` 仅对 prefill 计算进行分块；它不会减少 "
+"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 所需的内存。"
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>Mooncake SSD Environment Variables</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>Mooncake SSD 环境变量</summary>"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `Parameter` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `参数` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` | int (bytes) | 1342177280 "
+"(1280 MB) | No | Must align to 1 GB when A3 + "
+"`ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` | Per-rank SSD read/write buffer size "
+"(bytes). Not configurable in mooncake.json. Increase when `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` "
+"occurs. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` | int（字节） | 1342177280 (1280 "
+"MB) | 否 | 当 A3 + `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` 时必须对齐到 1 GB | 每个 rank 的 "
+"SSD 读/写缓冲区大小（字节）。无法在 mooncake.json 中配置。当出现 `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` 时增大该值。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_MAX_TOTAL_SIZE` | int (bytes) | 0 | No | Bytes; 0"
+" means 90% of physical disk capacity | Eviction threshold (bytes). Set an "
+"explicit value to control disk usage precisely. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_MAX_TOTAL_SIZE` | int（字节） | 0 | 否 | 字节；0 "
+"表示物理磁盘容量的 90% | 驱逐阈值（字节）。设置显式值以精确控制磁盘使用量。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_EVICTION_POLICY` | str | none | No | none / fifo "
+"/ lru | SSD eviction policy: `none` (writes fail when full), `fifo`, or "
+"`lru`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_EVICTION_POLICY` | str | none | 否 | none / fifo /"
+" lru | SSD 驱逐策略：`none`（写满时写入失败）、`fifo` 或 `lru`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` | int (bytes) | 2199023255552 (2"
+" TB) | Strongly recommended to set explicitly | Must match actual disk "
+"capacity | Per-rank maximum disk usage reported to Mooncake master, "
+"aggregated by master across clients (roughly 2 TB x rank count). Default far"
+" exceeds real disk capacity; must be overridden. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` | int（字节） | 2199023255552 (2 TB)"
+" | 强烈建议显式设置 | 必须与实际磁盘容量匹配 | 报告给 Mooncake master 的每个 rank 最大磁盘使用量，由 master "
+"跨客户端聚合（约为 2 TB × rank 数量）。默认值远超实际磁盘容量；必须覆盖。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
