+msgid "### Tuning"
+msgstr "### 调优"
+
+msgid "#### Huge Page Cleanup and Setup"
+msgstr "#### 大页清理与设置"
+
+msgid ""
+"On 950PR&950DT Products, residual huge pages can degrade both Mooncake and "
+"Memcache performance. Before starting the service, clean up 1GB and 2MB huge"
+" pages:"
+msgstr ""
+"在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上，残留的大页会降低 Mooncake 和 Memcache 的性能。启动服务前，请清理 1GB 和 "
+"2MB 大页："
+
+msgid "Verify after cleanup:"
+msgstr "清理后验证："
+
+msgid "#### Mooncake SSD Offload Parameter Tuning"
+msgstr "#### Mooncake SSD 卸载参数调优"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Increase `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` when `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` occurs, but do not exceed the `Available KV cache memory` value in vLLM Worker logs. Use byte literals only (e.g., `10737418240`); `10G`/`10GB` is not supported.\n"
+"- On A3 with `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`, `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` must be aligned to 1 GB (multiple of 1073741824); avoid unaligned values such as `1280MB`, `512MB`, or `1.5GB`. `local_buffer_size` in `mooncake.json` is not used under fabric mem mode.\n"
+"- Fabric mem budget formula (per rank):"
+msgstr ""
+"- 当出现 `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` 时增大 `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`，但不要超过 vLLM Worker 日志中的 `Available KV cache memory` 值。仅使用字节字面量（例如 `10737418240`）；不支持 `10G`/`10GB`。\n"
+"- 在 A3 上使用 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` 时，`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 必须对齐到 1 GB（1073741824 的倍数）；避免使用 `1280MB`、`512MB` 或 `1.5GB` 等未对齐的值。在 fabric mem 模式下不使用 `mooncake.json` 中的 `local_buffer_size`。\n"
+"- Fabric mem 预算公式（每个 rank）："
+
+msgid ""
+"If quota is insufficient, some ranks may fail with `Memory_Allocation_Failure(EL0004)` after `global_segment_size` succeeds but `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` allocation fails.\n"
+"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` defaults to 2 TB which far exceeds real disk capacity. Always set it to the actual per-rank budget. For example, with 800 GB disk and 8 TP ranks:"
+msgstr ""
+"如果配额不足，某些 rank 可能会在 `global_segment_size` 成功后因 `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 分配失败而报错 `Memory_Allocation_Failure(EL0004)`。\n"
+"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` 默认为 2 TB，远超实际磁盘容量。请始终将其设置为实际的每个 rank 预算。例如，对于 800 GB 磁盘和 8 个 TP rank："
+
+msgid "- Host memory budget:"
+msgstr "- 主机内存预算："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Verify after tuning: each rank prints `AlignedClientBufferAllocator: "
+"allocated <N> bytes` at startup; no `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` / `Failed to get ... "
+"keys out of ... error_codes=[-10]` under load. If failures persist with a "
+"large buffer, check overlapping loads (`load_async`)."
+msgstr ""
+"- 调优后验证：每个 rank 在启动时打印 `AlignedClientBufferAllocator: allocated <N> "
+"bytes`；在负载下没有 `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` / `Failed to get ... keys out of ... "
+"error_codes=[-10]`。如果使用大缓冲区仍持续失败，请检查重叠加载（`load_async`）。"
+
+msgid "#### MooncakeStore Warm-up"
+msgstr "#### MooncakeStore 预热"
+
+msgid ""
+"For MooncakeStore with `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL` enabled, perform a warm-up phase"
+" before running actual performance benchmarks. Since HCCS one-sided "
+"communication connections are created lazily after instance launch, full-"
+"mesh connections incur a one-time overhead (4 MB device memory per "
+"connection). Warm-up recommendation: input sequence length 8k, output "
+"sequence length 1, total requests 2-3x number of devices."
+msgstr ""
+"对于启用了 `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL` 的 MooncakeStore，在运行实际性能基准测试之前，请先执行预热阶段。由于 HCCS "
+"单边通信连接是在实例启动后延迟创建的，全互联连接会产生一次性开销（每个连接占用 4 MB 设备内存）。预热建议：输入序列长度 8k，输出序列长度 "
+"1，总请求数为设备数量的 2-3 倍。"
+
+msgid "## Scenario 2: Memcache Backend"
+msgstr "## 场景 2：Memcache 后端"
+
+msgid "### Configuration Examples"
+msgstr "### 配置示例"
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>MemCache DP Initialization Synchronization</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>MemCache DP 初始化同步</summary>"
+
+msgid ""
+"For the `memcache` backend, `memcache_dp_init_barrier` defaults to `true`. "
+"After successful store initialization, workers in a DP group synchronize "
+"through the CPU process group before continuing to NPU work such as graph "
+"capture. This keeps earlier workers from proceeding while peers are still "
+"initializing MemCache channels. DP size 1, metadata-only scheduler clients, "
+"and stores using lazy initialization skip this synchronization."
+msgstr ""
+"对于 `memcache` 后端，`memcache_dp_init_barrier` 默认为 `true`。在存储初始化成功后，DP 组中的 "
+"worker 会通过 CPU 进程组进行同步，然后再继续执行图捕获等 NPU 工作。这样可以防止较早的 worker 在同伴仍在初始化 MemCache"
+" 通道时继续推进。DP 大小为 1、仅元数据的调度器客户端以及使用延迟初始化的存储会跳过此同步。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set the same value on every rank in the DP group. With `MultiConnector`, "
+"place this boolean in the `AscendStoreConnector` child's "
+"`kv_connector_extra_config`. To disable it, add "
+"`\"memcache_dp_init_barrier\": false` alongside `\"backend\": \"memcache\"`."
+" No environment variable is needed. Lazy initialization can be triggered "
+"independently by requests on each DP rank, so it never enters the DP "
+"barrier. If a backend cannot honor a lazy initialization request and "
+"initializes eagerly instead, the startup barrier still applies."
+msgstr ""
+"在 DP 组中的每个 rank 上设置相同的值。使用 `MultiConnector` 时，将此布尔值放在 `AscendStoreConnector`"
+" 子项的 `kv_connector_extra_config` 中。要禁用它，请在 `\"backend\": \"memcache\"` 旁边添加 "
+"`\"memcache_dp_init_barrier\": false`。无需环境变量。延迟初始化可以由每个 DP rank "
+"上的请求独立触发，因此它永远不会进入 DP 屏障。如果后端无法满足延迟初始化请求而改为立即初始化，则启动屏障仍然适用。"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
