+msgid "##### mmc-meta.conf"
+msgstr "##### mmc-meta.conf"
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>mmc-meta.conf Parameters</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>mmc-meta.conf 参数</summary>"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `Parameter` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `参数` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ock.mmc.meta_service_url` | str | tcp://127.0.0.1:5000 | No | "
+"tcp://<host>:<port>, port [1025, 65535] | MetaService address. P and D nodes"
