+"`ock.mmc.meta_service.config_store_url` 匹配。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.world_size` | int | 256 | No | [1, 1024] | Maximum "
+"number of LocalServices supported (including future additions). Once ranks "
+"are connected, no further modifications are allowed — a meta restart is "
+"required. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.world_size` | int | 256 | 否 | [1, 1024] | 支持的最大 "
+"LocalService 数量（包括未来新增的）。一旦 rank 连接完成，就不允许再修改——需要重启 meta。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.protocol` | str | host_rdma | Yes | host_rdma / "
+"host_urma / host_tcp / host_shm / device_sdma / device_rdma / device_urma / "
+"device_uboe | Communication protocol. A2 recommended: `device_rdma` (RoCE); "
+"A3 HCCS recommended: `device_sdma` (requires LingQu Computing Network >= "
+"1.5); 950PR&950DT Products UB: `device_urma`; UBOE: `device_uboe`. "
+"`host_shm` requires DRAM > 0 and HBM = 0. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.protocol` | str | host_rdma | 是 | host_rdma / "
+"host_urma / host_tcp / host_shm / device_sdma / device_rdma / device_urma / "
+"device_uboe | 通信协议。A2 推荐：`device_rdma`（RoCE）；A3 HCCS "
+"推荐：`device_sdma`（需要灵衢计算网络 >= 1.5）；Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 "
+"UB：`device_urma`；UBOE：`device_uboe`。`host_shm` 要求 DRAM > 0 且 HBM = 0。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` | int | 1GB | Yes | [0, 1TB], auto-"
+"aligned to 2MB (`host_*` protocols) or 1GB (`device_*` protocols) | DRAM "
+"size allocated per die; supports formats such as 134217728, 2048KB, 200MB, "
+"2.5GB, or 1TB. For example, on A3, to allocate 640GB as KV pool, set this "
+"parameter to 640/16=40GB. Set 0GB for A3 when HCCS is available. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` | int | 1GB | 是 | [0, 1TB]，自动对齐到 "
+"2MB（`host_*` 协议）或 1GB（`device_*` 协议） | 每个 die 分配的 DRAM 大小；支持 "
+"134217728、2048KB、200MB、2.5GB 或 1TB 等格式。例如，在 A3 上，要将 640GB 分配为 KV 池，请将此参数设置为 "
+"640/16=40GB。当 HCCS 可用时，A3 设置为 0GB。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` | int | 1TB | No | [0, 1TB] | "
+"Maximum DRAM size. Needed when ranks contribute different sizes of DRAM. The"
+" default 1TB is binary 1024^4 bytes. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` | int | 1TB | 否 | [0, 1TB] | 最大 DRAM"
+" 大小。当各 rank 贡献不同大小的 DRAM 时需要设置。默认值 1TB 为二进制 1024^4 字节。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.storage.enabled` | bool | false | No | true / false"
+" | Enable SSD caching. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ock.mmc.local_service.storage.enabled` | bool | false | 否 | true / false "
+"| 启用 SSD 缓存。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ubsio.disk.path` | str | No default | Required when SSD enabled | "
+"Absolute paths, multiple paths separated by `:` | SSD block device, "
+"partition, or loop device paths. Devices must be dedicated with no mount "
+"points or filesystem signatures. `/dev/sd*` not recommended. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ubsio.disk.path` | str | 无默认值 | 启用 SSD 时必填 | 绝对路径，多个路径以 `:` 分隔 | SSD "
+"块设备、分区或 loop 设备路径。设备必须专用，不能有挂载点或文件系统签名。不建议使用 `/dev/sd*`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` | int | 10 | No | Integer [0, 3072]; SSD cache "
+"requires >= 5 | DRAM size requested by UBS IO per die (i.e., per "
+"LocalService/process), in GB. Data storage flow: HBM → second-level pooled "
+"DRAM → third-level pooled DRAM → SSD. The total allocation must not exceed "
+"the node memory available after reserving memory for the operating system, "
+"vLLM, and the Memcache DRAM pool. Typically 10; 50 recommended for separated"
+" deployment. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` | int | 10 | 否 | 整数 [0, 3072]；SSD 缓存要求 >= 5 | UBS "
+"IO 每个 die（即每个 LocalService/进程）请求的 DRAM 大小，单位为 GB。数据存储流程：HBM → 二级池化 DRAM → "
+"三级池化 DRAM → SSD。总分配量不得超过为操作系统、vLLM 和 Memcache DRAM 池预留内存后节点可用的内存。通常为 "
+"10；分离部署时建议为 50。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ubsio.standalone.device_count` | int | No default | Yes | Positive "
+"integer | Number of DRAM-enabled LocalServices, i.e., the number of vLLM "
+"processes on the environment (8 on A2, 16 on A3; if fewer cards are actually"
+" used, configure the actual process count, e.g., 4 when only 4 cards are "
+"occupied). |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ubsio.standalone.device_count` | int | 无默认值 | 是 | 正整数 | 启用 DRAM 的 "
+"LocalService 数量，即环境中 vLLM 进程的数量（A2 上为 8，A3 上为 16；如果实际使用的卡数较少，请配置实际进程数，例如仅占用 "
+"4 张卡时配置为 4）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `ubsio.standalone.force_new_disk` | bool | true | No | true / false | "
+"Clears the mounted disks each time the service is started. The current "
+"version does not support fault recovery; keeping true is recommended. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `ubsio.standalone.force_new_disk` | bool | true | 否 | true / false | "
+"每次启动服务时清除已挂载的磁盘。当前版本不支持故障恢复；建议保持为 true。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
+msgid "#### Step 4: Run MetaService"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 4：运行 MetaService"
+
+msgid "Expected output: MetaService starts successfully with no errors."
+msgstr "预期输出：MetaService 成功启动，无错误。"
+
+msgid "#### Step 5: Start vLLM inference service"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 5：启动 vLLM 推理服务"
+
+msgid "=== \"PD Disaggregation Scenario\""
+msgstr "=== \"PD 分离场景\""
+
+msgid "##### run_prefill.sh / run_decode.sh"
+msgstr "##### run_prefill.sh / run_decode.sh"
+
+msgid ""
+"`use_layerwise` can be set to `true` to enable per-layer KV access, "
+"supported by both the Mooncake and Memcache backends; it is only supported "
+"on the Prefill node. `consumer_is_to_put` and `consumer_is_to_load` can also"
+" be configured via `kv_connector_extra_config`."
+msgstr ""
+"`use_layerwise` 可设置为 `true` 以启用逐层 KV 访问，Mooncake 和 Memcache 后端均支持；仅在 Prefill"
+" 节点上支持。`consumer_is_to_put` 和 `consumer_is_to_load` 也可以通过 "
+"`kv_connector_extra_config` 进行配置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"To start proxy_server and run inference, refer to the corresponding sub-"
+"steps in \"PD Disaggregation Scenario\" of [Scenario 1: Mooncake "
+"Backend](#scenario-1-mooncake-backend)."
+msgstr ""
+"要启动 proxy_server 并运行推理，请参考[场景 1：Mooncake 后端](#scenario-1-mooncake-"
+"backend)中\"PD 分离场景\"的相应子步骤。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Expected output: Same as Mooncake scenario, returns OpenAI Completions API "
+"JSON response."
+msgstr "预期输出：与 Mooncake 场景相同，返回 OpenAI Completions API JSON 响应。"
+
+msgid "=== \"PD-Mixed Scenario\""
+msgstr "=== \"PD 混合场景\""
+
+msgid "##### pd_mix.sh"
+msgstr "##### pd_mix.sh"
+
+msgid ""
+"For inference commands, refer to \"PD-Mixed Scenario\" of [Scenario 1: "
+"Mooncake Backend](#scenario-1-mooncake-backend)."
+msgstr "推理命令请参考[场景 1：Mooncake 后端](#scenario-1-mooncake-backend)中的\"PD 混合场景\"。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The `kv_connector_extra_config` fields used in the scripts above are "
+"documented in [kv-transfer-config Common Parameters](#kv-transfer-config-"
+"common-parameters)."
+msgstr ""
+"上述脚本中使用的 `kv_connector_extra_config` 字段记录在 [kv-transfer-config 通用参数](#kv-"
+"transfer-config-common-parameters)中。"
+
+msgid ""
+"#### Step 6: Memcache and vLLM Separated Deployment {: #Memcache-and-vLLM-"
+"Separated-Deployment }"
+msgstr ""
+"#### 步骤 6：Memcache 与 vLLM 分离部署 {: #Memcache-and-vLLM-Separated-Deployment }"
+
+msgid ""
+"This deployment mode runs MemCache and vLLM in different processes (distinct"
+" from vLLM PD disaggregation). In the default co-located mode, vLLM loads "
+"the model weights before the KV connector initializes MemCache, so MemCache "
+"may not be able to reserve sufficient memory from the remaining available "
+"space. Starting a standalone MemCache process before vLLM allows MemCache to"
+" reserve a larger memory pool."
+msgstr ""
+"此部署模式将 MemCache 和 vLLM 运行在不同的进程中（与 vLLM PD 分离不同）。在默认的同机部署模式下，vLLM 在 KV "
+"连接器初始化 MemCache 之前加载模型权重，因此 MemCache 可能无法从剩余可用空间中预留足够的内存。在 vLLM 之前启动独立的 "
+"MemCache 进程可以让 MemCache 预留更大的内存池。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prepare two LocalService configuration files with the same connection and "
+"protocol settings: the configuration used by the vLLM process does not "
+"contribute DRAM (`dram.size = 0GB`), and the configuration used by the "
+"standalone MemCache process specifies the amount of DRAM to contribute. Set "
+"`ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` to accommodate the maximum `dram.size`"
+" used by the LocalService processes."
+msgstr ""
+"准备两个具有相同连接和协议设置的 LocalService 配置文件：vLLM 进程使用的配置不贡献 DRAM（`dram.size = "
+"0GB`），独立 MemCache 进程使用的配置指定要贡献的 DRAM 大小。将 "
+"`ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` 设置为能够容纳 LocalService 进程使用的最大 "
+"`dram.size`。"
+
+msgid "Steps:"
+msgstr "步骤："
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Start MetaService (same as above).\n"
+"2. Use the following `mmc-local-standalone.conf` configuration to start an independent Memcache process on each node:"
+msgstr ""
+"1. 启动 MetaService（同上）。\n"
+"2. 使用以下 `mmc-local-standalone.conf` 配置在每个节点上启动独立的 Memcache 进程："
+
+msgid ""
+"3. Wait for all nodes to report successful initialization.\n"
+"4. Use the following `mmc-local.conf` configuration (`dram.size = 0GB`) to start vLLM:"
+msgstr ""
+"3. 等待所有节点报告初始化成功。\n"
+"4. 使用以下 `mmc-local.conf` 配置（`dram.size = 0GB`）启动 vLLM："
+
+msgid ""
+"Startup script reference: [Memcache + vLLM + A3 Separated Deployment "
+"Case](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/MemCache+vLLM+A3%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B.md)"
+msgstr ""
+"启动脚本参考：[Memcache + vLLM + A3 "
+"分离部署案例](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/MemCache+vLLM+A3%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B.md)"
+
+msgid "#### Step 7: Enable Memcache SSD Cache"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 7：启用 Memcache SSD 缓存"
+
+msgid ""
+"When enabling SSD Cache in the separated deployment scenario, refer to the "
+"following configurations:"
+msgstr "在分离部署场景中启用 SSD 缓存时，请参考以下配置："
+
+msgid "##### mmc-local.conf (used by the vLLM process, contributing no DRAM)"
+msgstr "##### mmc-local.conf（由 vLLM 进程使用，不贡献 DRAM）"
+
+msgid ""
+"##### mmc-local-standalone.conf (used by the standalone MemCache process)"
+msgstr "##### mmc-local-standalone.conf（由独立 MemCache 进程使用）"
+
+msgid ""
+"When adjusting `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`, calculate the maximum permitted per-"
+"process value by dividing the node memory available to UBS IO by the number "
+"of DRAM-enabled local services, rounding down, and capping the result at "
+"`3072`:"
+msgstr ""
+"调整 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` 时，将 UBS IO 可用的节点内存除以启用 DRAM 的本地服务数量，向下取整，并将结果上限设为 "
+"`3072`，以计算每个进程允许的最大值："
+
+msgid ""
+"For example, if `200` GB is available to UBS IO and four local services have"
+" DRAM enabled, the upper limit is `50` GB per process. If the calculated "
+"upper limit is less than `5`, free more node memory or reduce the number of "
+"DRAM-enabled local services."
+msgstr ""
+"例如，如果 UBS IO 可用 `200` GB，且有四个本地服务启用了 DRAM，则每个进程的上限为 `50` GB。如果计算出的上限小于 "
+"`5`，请释放更多节点内存或减少启用 DRAM 的本地服务数量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For the scenario of separate deployment of MemCache, it is recommended to "
+"configure a single process with `50` GB. In other scenarios, the recommended"
+" value is `10` GB. If you want to use the L2.5 memory caching capability, "
+"increase `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` within the limits above and adjust "
+"[ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)"
+" accordingly."
+msgstr ""
+"对于 MemCache 独立部署场景，建议为单个进程配置 `50` GB。其他场景建议配置 `10` GB。如需使用 L2.5 "
+"内存缓存能力，可在上述限制范围内增大 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`，并相应调整 "
+"[ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For disk config, eviction watermarks, and other UBS IO parameters, see the "
+"[DRAM + SSD Multi-level Pooling Configuration "
+"Guide](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"关于磁盘配置、淘汰水位线及其他 UBS IO 参数，请参见 [DRAM + SSD "
+"多级池化配置指南](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)。"
+
