+msgid "### Tuning"
+msgstr "### 调优"
+
+msgid "#### Huge Page Cleanup and Setup"
+msgstr "#### 大页清理与设置"
+
+msgid ""
+"On 950PR&950DT Products, residual huge pages can degrade both Mooncake and "
+"Memcache performance. Before starting the service, clean up 1GB and 2MB huge"
+" pages:"
+msgstr ""
+"在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上，残留的大页会降低 Mooncake 和 Memcache 的性能。启动服务前，请清理 1GB 和 "
+"2MB 大页："
+
+msgid "Verify after cleanup:"
+msgstr "清理后验证："
+
+msgid "#### Memcache UBS IO Memory Pool Tuning"
+msgstr "#### Memcache UBS IO 内存池调优"
+
+msgid "- `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` upper limit formula:"
+msgstr "- `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` 上限计算公式："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Separated deployment recommended: 50 GB per process; other scenarios: 10 GB.\n"
+"- To use L2.5 memory caching, increase `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` within the limit and adjust [ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)."
+msgstr ""
+"- 独立部署建议：每进程 50 GB；其他场景：10 GB。\n"
+"- 如需使用 L2.5 内存缓存，请在限制范围内增大 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`，并调整 [ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)。"
+
+msgid "## Scenario 3: Yuanrong Backend"
+msgstr "## 场景 3：Yuanrong 后端"
+
+msgid "### Configuration Examples"
+msgstr "### 配置示例"
+
+msgid "#### Environment Preparation"
+msgstr "#### 环境准备"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Verify that `hccn.conf` exists in the environment. When using Docker, "
+"mount it into the container:"
+msgstr "1. 确认环境中存在 `hccn.conf`。使用 Docker 时，请将其挂载到容器中："
+
+msgid ""
+"950PR&950DT Products requires extra device and config mounts: `/dev/ummu`, "
+"`/dev/uburma`, `/usr/bin/urma_admin`, `/lib/route.conf`, "
+"`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`."
+msgstr ""
+"Ascend "
+"950PR&950DT系列产品需要额外挂载设备和配置：`/dev/ummu`、`/dev/uburma`、`/usr/bin/urma_admin`、`/lib/route.conf`、`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`。"
+
+msgid "2. Synchronize `PYTHONHASHSEED` across all nodes:"
+msgstr "2. 在所有节点间同步 `PYTHONHASHSEED`："
+
+msgid "#### Step 1: Install Yuanrong Datasystem"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 1：安装 Yuanrong Datasystem"
+
+msgid "Expected output:"
+msgstr "预期输出："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `Yuanrong Datasystem is ready`\n"
+"- Version number displayed by `dscli`."
+msgstr ""
+"- `Yuanrong Datasystem is ready`\n"
+"- `dscli` 显示的版本号。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If the prebuilt package does not match the CANN or driver version, build "
+"Yuanrong Datasystem from source: [Yuanrong "
+"Datasystem](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-datasystem)."
+msgstr ""
+"如果预编译包与 CANN 或驱动版本不匹配，请从源码构建 Yuanrong Datasystem：[Yuanrong "
+"Datasystem](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-datasystem)。"
+
+msgid "#### Step 2: Choose a Service Discovery Backend"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 2：选择服务发现后端"
+
+msgid "=== \"Option 1: Start Coordinator\""
+msgstr "=== \"选项 1：启动 Coordinator\""
+
+msgid "Expected output: `Start coordinator service ... success`."
+msgstr "预期输出：`Start coordinator service ... success`。"
+
+msgid "Single-node quick start (Coordinator + Worker in one step):"
+msgstr "单节点快速启动（一步启动 Coordinator + Worker）："
+
+msgid "=== \"Option 2: Start etcd\""
+msgstr "=== \"选项 2：启动 etcd\""
+
+msgid ""
+"Expected output: `etcdctl put key \"value\"` returns `OK`; `etcdctl get key`"
+" returns `key`->`value`."
+msgstr ""
+"预期输出：`etcdctl put key \"value\"` 返回 `OK`；`etcdctl get key` 返回 "
+"`key`->`value`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For production environments, refer to the official etcd clustering "
+"documentation: [etcd clustering guide](https://etcd.io/docs/v3.7/op-"
+"guide/clustering/)."
+msgstr ""
+"生产环境请参考 etcd 官方集群文档：[etcd 集群指南](https://etcd.io/docs/v3.7/op-"
+"guide/clustering/)。"
+
+msgid "##### Multi-node deployment"
+msgstr "##### 多节点部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"Install Yuanrong Datasystem on every node. Each node runs one Datasystem "
+"Worker with a unique, reachable `worker_address`. All Workers must use the "
+"same service discovery backend and backend address."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个节点上安装 Yuanrong Datasystem。每个节点运行一个 Datasystem Worker，并使用唯一且可达的 "
+"`worker_address`。所有 Worker 必须使用相同的服务发现后端和后端地址。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Multi-node deployment with Coordinator (example with Coordinator node "
+"address `192.168.1.10`):"
+msgstr "使用 Coordinator 的多节点部署（以 Coordinator 节点地址 `192.168.1.10` 为例）："
+
+msgid ""
+"Multi-node deployment with etcd: start an etcd service or cluster that every"
+" Worker can reach, then start one Worker on every node. Set `WORKER_IP` to "
+"that node's own IP and keep `ETCD_ADDRESS` identical on all nodes:"
+msgstr ""
+"使用 etcd 的多节点部署：启动一个所有 Worker 均可访问的 etcd 服务或集群，然后在每个节点上启动一个 Worker。将 "
+"`WORKER_IP` 设置为该节点自身的 IP，并确保所有节点上的 `ETCD_ADDRESS` 保持一致："
+
+msgid "For both backends:"
+msgstr "对于两种后端："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Do not use `127.0.0.1` or `0.0.0.0` as a Worker address in a multi-node deployment. Other Workers must be able to connect to the advertised IP.\n"
+"- Allow network access to the Coordinator port (`31511`) or etcd client port (`2379`), and to every Worker port (`31501` in these examples).\n"
+"- On each node, set `worker_addr` in `yuanrong.json` to that node's local `WORKER_IP:31501`. The configuration file therefore differs by node."
+msgstr ""
+"- 在多节点部署中，不要使用 `127.0.0.1` 或 `0.0.0.0` 作为 Worker 地址。其他 Worker 必须能够连接到所公布的 IP。\n"
+"- 允许对 Coordinator 端口（`31511`）或 etcd 客户端端口（`2379`）以及每个 Worker 端口（本示例中为 `31501`）的网络访问。\n"
+"- 在每个节点上，将 `yuanrong.json` 中的 `worker_addr` 设置为该节点本地的 `WORKER_IP:31501`。因此配置文件因节点而异。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For production control-plane high availability, deploy multiple Coordinators"
+" with static Raft peers, a unique `coordinator_address` and "
+"`coordinator_raft_data_dir` for each Coordinator, and the same "
+"`coordinator_raft_initial_peers` list. See the [Yuanrong Datasystem dscli "
+"documentation](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-"
+"datasystem/blob/master/docs/source_zh_cn/deployment/dscli.md#coordinator-%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2)."
+msgstr ""
+"对于生产环境控制平面的高可用，请部署多个 Coordinator，使用静态 Raft 对等节点，为每个 Coordinator 设置唯一的 "
+"`coordinator_address` 和 `coordinator_raft_data_dir`，并使用相同的 "
+"`coordinator_raft_initial_peers` 列表。请参见 [Yuanrong Datasystem dscli "
+"文档](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-"
+"datasystem/blob/master/docs/source_zh_cn/deployment/dscli.md#coordinator-%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2)。"
+
+msgid "#### Step 3: Start Datasystem Worker"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 3：启动 Datasystem Worker"
+
+msgid ""
+"Expected output: Worker starts successfully with no errors. Worker logs, "
+"including files whose base name is normally `datasystem_worker`, are written"
+" under the `--log_dir` directory. Use an absolute path so the log location "
+"does not depend on the worker process's current directory."
+msgstr ""
+"预期输出：Worker 成功启动且无错误。Worker 日志（包括基本名称通常为 `datasystem_worker` 的文件）写入 "
+"`--log_dir` 目录下。请使用绝对路径，以便日志位置不依赖于 worker 进程的当前目录。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The `--worker_address` value is consumed later as `worker_addr` in "
+"`yuanrong.json`, so keep the host and port identical on the same node. "
+"Configure only one coordination backend for a Worker: when using "
+"Coordinator, do not also set `etcd_address` or `metastore_address`."
+msgstr ""
+"`--worker_address` 的值稍后会作为 `yuanrong.json` 中的 `worker_addr` "
+"使用，因此请确保同一节点上的主机和端口保持一致。为 Worker 仅配置一个协调后端：使用 Coordinator 时，不要同时设置 "
+"`etcd_address` 或 `metastore_address`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Stop the Worker when it is no longer needed. Stop the selected service "
+"discovery backend only after all Workers have stopped. For an independent "
+"etcd cluster, follow its normal cluster maintenance procedure:"
+msgstr ""
+"当不再需要 Worker 时，停止该 Worker。只有在所有 Worker 都停止后，才能停止所选的服务发现后端。对于独立的 etcd "
+"集群，请遵循其常规的集群维护流程："
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>Yuanrong dscli Worker Parameters</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>Yuanrong dscli Worker 参数</summary>"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `Parameter` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `参数` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `worker_address` | str | No default | Yes | `<host>:<port>` | Worker "
+"address, must match `yuanrong.json` `worker_addr`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `worker_address` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | `<host>:<port>` | Worker 地址，必须与 "
+"`yuanrong.json` 中的 `worker_addr` 一致。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `coordinator_address` | str | No default | Option 1 | `<ip>:31511` | "
+"Coordinator address. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `coordinator_address` | str | 无默认值 | 选项 1 | `<ip>:31511` | Coordinator 地址。"
+" |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `etcd_address` | str | No default | Option 2 | `<ip>:2379` | etcd address."
+" |"
+msgstr "| `etcd_address` | str | 无默认值 | 选项 2 | `<ip>:2379` | etcd 地址。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `log_dir` | str | No default | No | Absolute path | Worker log directory, "
+"use absolute path. Create the directory and grant the worker process write "
+"permission before startup. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `log_dir` | str | 无默认值 | 否 | 绝对路径 | Worker 日志目录，请使用绝对路径。启动前请创建该目录并授予 "
+"worker 进程写权限。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `shared_memory_size_mb` | int | No default | Yes | Positive integer (MB) |"
+" Shared memory size (MB). Example: 40960 (40 GB). |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `shared_memory_size_mb` | int | 无默认值 | 是 | 正整数（MB） | "
+"共享内存大小（MB）。示例：40960（40 GB）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `arena_per_tenant` | int | No default | No | Positive integer | Shared "
+"memory arena count per tenant. Conservative starting point: 1. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `arena_per_tenant` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 正整数 | 每个租户的共享内存 arena 数量。保守的起始值：1。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_huge_tlb` | bool | No default | No | true / false | Use HugeTLB "
+"pages for shared memory. Reserve enough 2 MiB huge pages before starting the"
+" worker. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_huge_tlb` | bool | 无默认值 | 否 | true / false | 为共享内存使用 HugeTLB 页。启动 "
+"worker 前请预留足够的 2 MiB 大页。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_fallocate` | bool | No default | No | true / false | Execute "
+"fallocate for shared memory file. Recommended false with HugeTLB. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_fallocate` | bool | 无默认值 | 否 | true / false | 对共享内存文件执行 "
+"fallocate。与 HugeTLB 一起使用时建议设为 false。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `rpc_thread_num` | int | No default | No | Positive integer | RPC/ZMQ "
+"service concurrency. |"
+msgstr "| `rpc_thread_num` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 正整数 | RPC/ZMQ 服务并发数。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `oc_thread_num` | int | No default | No | Positive integer | Object Cache "
+"business thread pool size. |"
+msgstr "| `oc_thread_num` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 正整数 | Object Cache 业务线程池大小。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_worker_worker_batch_get` | bool | No default | No | true / false |"
+" Enable batched Object Cache reads between Workers. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_worker_worker_batch_get` | bool | 无默认值 | 否 | true / false | 启用 "
+"Worker 之间的批量 Object Cache 读取。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `sc_regular_socket_num` | int | 0 | No | >= 0 | Stream Cache regular "
+"socket count. Keep at 0 when KV Pool does not use Stream Cache. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `sc_regular_socket_num` | int | 0 | 否 | >= 0 | Stream Cache 常规 socket 数量。当"
+" KV Pool 不使用 Stream Cache 时保持为 0。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `sc_stream_socket_num` | int | 0 | No | >= 0 | Stream Cache stream socket "
+"count. Keep at 0 when KV Pool does not use Stream Cache. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `sc_stream_socket_num` | int | 0 | 否 | >= 0 | Stream Cache 流式 socket 数量。当 "
+"KV Pool 不使用 Stream Cache 时保持为 0。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `remote_h2d_device_ids` | str | empty | No | Comma-separated device IDs, "
+"e.g., `\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"` | Non-empty enables worker-side Remote H2D. "
+"Using multiple available NPU device IDs is recommended. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `remote_h2d_device_ids` | str | 空 | 否 | 逗号分隔的设备 ID，例如 "
+"`\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"` | 非空时启用 worker 侧的 Remote H2D。建议使用多个可用的 NPU 设备 ID。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `remote_h2d_link_type` | str | ROCE | No | ROCE / HCCS (case-sensitive) | "
+"Link type. `ROCE` maps to client `P2P_TRANSFER`; `HCCS` maps to client "
+"`HIXL` (covers buffer-pool, HIXL RoCE direct, and FabricMem sub-modes). For "
+"`HCCS`, the client process must also export `DS_RH2D_LINK_TYPE=HCCS` before "
+"starting vLLM (the backend does not export it automatically); `ROCE` is the "
+"datasystem default and needs no env var. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `remote_h2d_link_type` | str | ROCE | 否 | ROCE / HCCS（区分大小写） | 链路类型。`ROCE`"
+" 映射到客户端 `P2P_TRANSFER`；`HCCS` 映射到客户端 `HIXL`（涵盖 buffer-pool、HIXL RoCE direct "
+"和 FabricMem 子模式）。对于 `HCCS`，客户端进程还必须在启动 vLLM 前导出 "
+"`DS_RH2D_LINK_TYPE=HCCS`（后端不会自动导出）；`ROCE` 是 datasystem 的默认值，无需设置环境变量。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `remote_h2d_hccs_buffer_pool` | str | 4:8 | No | `<count>:<size>` | HIXL "
+"buffer-pool parameter, only used when `link_type=HCCS`. Ignored under HIXL "
+"RoCE direct mode (`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`). |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `remote_h2d_hccs_buffer_pool` | str | 4:8 | 否 | `<count>:<size>` | HIXL "
+"buffer-pool 参数，仅在 `link_type=HCCS` 时使用。在 HIXL RoCE direct "
+"模式（`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`）下会被忽略。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
+msgid "#### Step 4: Configure Environment Variables and `yuanrong.json`"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 4：配置环境变量和 `yuanrong.json`"
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>Yuanrong Environment Variables</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>Yuanrong 环境变量</summary>"
+
+msgid "| `Variable` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `变量` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 说明 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `PYTHONHASHSEED` | int | 0 | Yes | Integer (consistent across all nodes) |"
+" Must be consistent across all nodes to guarantee uniform hash generation. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `PYTHONHASHSEED` | int | 0 | 是 | 整数（所有节点保持一致） | 必须在所有节点上保持一致，以保证哈希生成的一致性。 "
+"|"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DS_WORKER_ADDR` | str | N/A | Yes | `<host>:<port>` | Datasystem Worker "
+"address, must match local `dscli start --worker_address` value. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DS_WORKER_ADDR` | str | N/A | 是 | `<host>:<port>` | Datasystem Worker "
+"地址，必须与本地 `dscli start --worker_address` 的值一致。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR` | str | ~/.datasystem/logs | No | Directory "
+"path | Directory for Yuanrong client SDK logs (base name normally "
+"`ds_client`). Must be set before starting vLLM; use a directory separate "
+"from the worker logs. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR` | str | ~/.datasystem/logs | 否 | 目录路径 | "
+"Yuanrong 客户端 SDK 日志目录（基本名称通常为 `ds_client`）。必须在启动 vLLM 前设置；请使用与 worker "
+"日志分开的目录。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DS_ENABLE_EXCLUSIVE_CONNECTION` | int | 0 | No | 0 / 1 | Passed to "
+"Yuanrong `HeteroClient.enable_exclusive_connection`. Use `1` to enable the "
+"exclusive connection mode when required by your deployment. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DS_ENABLE_EXCLUSIVE_CONNECTION` | int | 0 | 否 | 0 / 1 | 传递给 Yuanrong "
+"`HeteroClient.enable_exclusive_connection`。当你的部署需要时，使用 `1` 启用独占连接模式。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D` | int | 0 | No | 0 / 1 | Passed to Yuanrong "
+"`HeteroClient.enable_remote_h2d`. Use `1` only after the Remote H2D "
+"requirements are met. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D` | int | 0 | 否 | 0 / 1 | 传递给 Yuanrong "
+"`HeteroClient.enable_remote_h2d`。只有在满足 Remote H2D 要求后才使用 `1`。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set `DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR` before starting vLLM because the Yuanrong "
+"client reads it during logging initialization. Client SDK logs, whose base "
+"name is normally `ds_client`, are written to this directory. Use a directory"
+" separate from the worker logs."
+msgstr ""
+"在启动 vLLM 前设置 `DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR`，因为 Yuanrong 客户端在日志初始化期间会读取它。客户端 SDK"
+" 日志（基本名称通常为 `ds_client`）会写入该目录。请使用与 worker 日志分开的目录。"
+
+msgid "Configure `yuanrong.json` (pointed to by `YR_CONFIG_PATH`):"
+msgstr "配置 `yuanrong.json`（由 `YR_CONFIG_PATH` 指向）："
+
+msgid ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>yuanrong.json Fields</summary>"
+msgstr ""
+"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
+"<summary>yuanrong.json 字段</summary>"
+
+msgid "| `Field` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| `字段` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 说明 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `worker_addr` | str | No default | Yes | `<host>:<port>` | Datasystem "
+"Worker address, must match `dscli start --worker_address`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `worker_addr` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | `<host>:<port>` | Datasystem Worker "
+"地址，必须与 `dscli start --worker_address` 一致。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `connect_timeout_ms` | int | 9000 | No | Integer >= 500 | Connection "
+"establishment timeout (ms). |"
+msgstr "| `connect_timeout_ms` | int | 9000 | 否 | 整数 >= 500 | 连接建立超时时间（毫秒）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `request_timeout_ms` | int | 0 | No | 0 or positive integer (ms) | Request"
+" timeout (ms). `0` preserves the Yuanrong SDK behavior of using "
+"`connect_timeout_ms` as the request timeout; set a positive value to control"
+" request timeout independently. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `request_timeout_ms` | int | 0 | 否 | 0 或正整数（毫秒） | 请求超时时间（毫秒）。`0` 保留 "
+"Yuanrong SDK 使用 `connect_timeout_ms` 作为请求超时的行为；设置正值可独立控制请求超时。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `get_sub_timeout_ms` | int | 0 | No | 0 or positive integer (ms) | Timeout"
+" for `mget_h2d_from_multi_buffers` to wait for objects to become ready (ms);"
+" `0` means no waiting. It may be greater than `request_timeout_ms`; the "
+"Yuanrong Get path expands that call's RPC timeout to accommodate the "
+"configured object-ready wait. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `get_sub_timeout_ms` | int | 0 | 否 | 0 或正整数（毫秒） | "
+"`mget_h2d_from_multi_buffers` 等待对象就绪的超时时间（毫秒）；`0` 表示不等待。它可以大于 "
+"`request_timeout_ms`；Yuanrong Get 路径会扩展该调用的 RPC 超时，以适应所配置的对象就绪等待时间。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_remote_h2d` | bool | false | No | true / false | Passed to "
+"Yuanrong `HeteroClient.enable_remote_h2d`. Use `true` only after the Remote "
+"H2D requirements are met. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_remote_h2d` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 传递给 Yuanrong "
+"`HeteroClient.enable_remote_h2d`。仅在满足 Remote H2D 要求后才可使用 `true`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `remote_h2d_transport_backend` | str | HIXL | No | HIXL / P2P_TRANSFER | "
+"vLLM-side transport name, corresponds to Worker `--remote_h2d_link_type` "
+"(HCCS ↔ HIXL, ROCE ↔ P2P_TRANSFER). Under `HIXL` the backend pre-registers "
+"device memory unless `enable_fabric_mem` is `true`; under `P2P_TRANSFER` it "
+"skips pre-registration. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `remote_h2d_transport_backend` | str | HIXL | 否 | HIXL / P2P_TRANSFER | "
+"vLLM 侧的传输名称，对应 Worker 的 `--remote_h2d_link_type`（HCCS ↔ HIXL，ROCE ↔ "
+"P2P_TRANSFER）。在 `HIXL` 下，除非 `enable_fabric_mem` 为 `true`，否则后端会预注册设备内存；在 "
+"`P2P_TRANSFER` 下则跳过预注册。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_fabric_mem` | bool | false | No | true / false | Selects HIXL "
+"FabricMem mode, where HIXL `OPTION_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` handles Fabric "
+"shareable handle exchange automatically and the backend skips client-side "
+"`pre_register_device_memory`. Only meaningful when "
+"`remote_h2d_transport_backend=\"HIXL\"`. FabricMem requires datasystem-side "
+"support (HIXL FabricMem build and the corresponding datasystem environment "
+"variable); check the datasystem documentation before enabling this flag. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_fabric_mem` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 选择 HIXL FabricMem "
+"模式，在该模式下 HIXL `OPTION_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` 会自动处理 Fabric 可共享句柄交换，后端会跳过客户端侧的"
+" `pre_register_device_memory`。仅在 `remote_h2d_transport_backend=\"HIXL\"` "
+"时才有意义。FabricMem 需要 datasystem 侧支持（HIXL FabricMem 构建以及相应的 datasystem "
+"环境变量）；启用此标志前请查阅 datasystem 文档。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `enable_dev_mem_pregister` | bool | false | No | true / false | Master "
+"toggle for client-side device memory pre-registration "
+"(`pre_register_device_memory`). To actually pre-register, this flag must be "
+"`true` and the automatic conditions must hold: `enable_remote_h2d=true`, "
+"`remote_h2d_transport_backend=\"HIXL\"`, and `enable_fabric_mem=false`. "
+"Under `P2P_TRANSFER` or FabricMem mode pre-registration is always skipped "
+"regardless of this toggle. Set this to `true` for HIXL HCCS Remote H2D "
+"deployments that require client-side device memory registration. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `enable_dev_mem_pregister` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | "
+"客户端侧设备内存预注册（`pre_register_device_memory`）的总开关。要实际执行预注册，此标志必须为 `true` "
+"且满足自动条件：`enable_remote_h2d=true`、`remote_h2d_transport_backend=\"HIXL\"` 且 "
+"`enable_fabric_mem=false`。在 `P2P_TRANSFER` 或 FabricMem "
+"模式下，无论此开关如何设置，预注册都会被跳过。对于需要客户端侧设备内存注册的 HIXL HCCS Remote H2D 部署，请将其设置为 "
+"`true`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `use_layerwise` | bool | false | No | true / false | Must match "
+"`kv_connector_extra_config.use_layerwise`. When `false`, the scheduler-side "
+"Yuanrong store skips initialization because non-layerwise lookup is "
+"delegated to the TP0 worker. When `true`, the scheduler initializes a "
+"metadata-only Yuanrong client with Remote H2D disabled, so it does not "
+"create a HIXL engine. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `use_layerwise` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 必须与 "
+"`kv_connector_extra_config.use_layerwise` 一致。当为 `false` 时，调度器侧的 Yuanrong "
+"存储会跳过初始化，因为非分层查找被委托给 TP0 worker。当为 `true` 时，调度器会初始化一个仅含元数据、且禁用 Remote H2D 的 "
+"Yuanrong 客户端，因此不会创建 HIXL 引擎。 |"
+
+msgid "</details>"
+msgstr "</details>"
+
+msgid ""
+"`worker_addr` must match the local `dscli start --worker_address` value."
+msgstr "`worker_addr` 必须与本地 `dscli start --worker_address` 的值一致。"
+
+msgid "##### Remote H2D Requirements and Verification"
+msgstr "##### Remote H2D 要求与验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D` to `1` (or `enable_remote_h2d` to `true` in "
+"`yuanrong.json`) only when Remote Host-to-Device transfer is enabled and "
+"verified in the Yuanrong Datasystem deployment:"
+msgstr ""
+"仅当在 Yuanrong Datasystem 部署中启用并验证了 Remote Host-to-Device 传输后，才将 "
+"`DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D` 设置为 `1`（或在 `yuanrong.json` 中将 `enable_remote_h2d` 设置为"
+" `true`）："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Reserve enough 2 MiB HugeTLB pages before starting the worker. For 40 GiB shared memory, reserve at least 20480 2 MiB huge pages.\n"
+"- Start each Datasystem worker with Remote H2D enabled. The worker start command must include `--remote_h2d_device_ids`, `--enable_huge_tlb true`, `--arena_per_tenant 1`, and `--enable_fallocate false`. Using multiple available NPU device IDs is recommended, for example `\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"` on an 8-NPU node."
+msgstr ""
+"- 在启动 worker 之前预留足够的 2 MiB HugeTLB 页。对于 40 GiB 共享内存，至少预留 20480 个 2 MiB 大页。\n"
+"- 在启用 Remote H2D 的情况下启动每个 Datasystem worker。worker 启动命令必须包含 `--remote_h2d_device_ids`、`--enable_huge_tlb true`、`--arena_per_tenant 1` 和 `--enable_fallocate false`。建议使用多个可用的 NPU 设备 ID，例如在 8-NPU 节点上使用 `\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For HIXL HCCS links (Atlas A3 with HCCS reachability), set "
+"`--remote_h2d_link_type \"HCCS\"` and the HIXL buffer-pool parameter. The IP"
+" in `--worker_address` is also used as the HIXL endpoint IP, so use a "
+"reachable address rather than `127.0.0.1` or `0.0.0.0`. HIXL RoCE direct "
+"mode is a sub-mode of HCCS selected by `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` on both "
+"sides and additionally requires a reachable RoCE link:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于 HIXL HCCS 链路（具备 HCCS 可达性的 Atlas A3），请设置 `--remote_h2d_link_type \"HCCS\"`"
+" 以及 HIXL 缓冲池参数。`--worker_address` 中的 IP 也会用作 HIXL 端点 IP，因此请使用可达的地址，而不是 "
+"`127.0.0.1` 或 `0.0.0.0`。HIXL RoCE 直连模式是 HCCS 的子模式，通过在两端设置 "
+"`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` 来选择，并且额外要求可达的 RoCE 链路："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Make sure the NPU driver, firmware, and CANN toolkit required by Yuanrong Remote H2D are installed and visible to the worker process. In containers, mount the Ascend driver path, `npu-smi`, `hccn_tool`, `/etc/hccn.conf`, `/etc/ascend_install.info`, and the required `/dev/davinci*` devices.\n"
+"- When the worker uses `--remote_h2d_link_type \"HCCS\"`, the client process must also export `DS_RH2D_LINK_TYPE=HCCS` before starting vLLM (the backend does not export it automatically); `ROCE` is the datasystem default and needs no env var.\n"
+"- Verify the NPU and RoCE environment before enabling the client flag:"
+msgstr ""
+"- 确保 Yuanrong Remote H2D 所需的 NPU 驱动、固件和 CANN 工具包已安装，并且对 worker 进程可见。在容器中，请挂载昇腾驱动路径、`npu-smi`、`hccn_tool`、`/etc/hccn.conf`、`/etc/ascend_install.info` 以及所需的 `/dev/davinci*` 设备。\n"
+"- 当 worker 使用 `--remote_h2d_link_type \"HCCS\"` 时，客户端进程还必须在启动 vLLM 之前导出 `DS_RH2D_LINK_TYPE=HCCS`（后端不会自动导出）；`ROCE` 是 datasystem 的默认值，无需设置环境变量。\n"
+"- 在启用客户端标志之前，请验证 NPU 和 RoCE 环境："
+
+msgid ""
+"If these checks fail, keep `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D=0` and use the default "
+"Datasystem transfer path."
+msgstr "如果这些检查失败，请保持 `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D=0` 并使用默认的 Datasystem 传输路径。"
+
+msgid "#### Step 5: Run AscendStoreConnector (Yuanrong Backend)"
+msgstr "#### 步骤 5：运行 AscendStoreConnector（Yuanrong 后端）"
+
+msgid ""
+"`lookup_rpc_port` is the RPC port used between the pooling scheduler process"
+" and the worker process. Each instance must use a unique port value."
+msgstr "`lookup_rpc_port` 是池化调度器进程与 worker 进程之间使用的 RPC 端口。每个实例必须使用唯一的端口值。"
