+msgid ""
+"**Note:** The Yuanrong backend normalizes KV keys before calling Datasystem."
+" Supported ASCII keys up to 1024 bytes are preserved. Longer keys or keys "
+"containing unsupported characters are rewritten to a maximum of 1024 "
+"characters with a hash suffix, so do not rely on the raw key string when "
+"debugging backend storage. No extra buffer pre-registration step is "
+"required."
+msgstr ""
+"**注意：** Yuanrong 后端在调用 Datasystem 之前会对 KV 键进行规范化。支持的、长度不超过 1024 字节的 ASCII "
+"键会被保留。较长的键或包含不支持字符的键会被重写为最多 1024 "
+"个字符并附加哈希后缀，因此在调试后端存储时不要依赖原始键字符串。无需额外的缓冲区预注册步骤。"
+
