+msgstr "### 调优"
+
+msgid "#### Yuanrong Worker Parameter Tuning"
+msgstr "#### Yuanrong Worker 参数调优"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Thread counts such as `rpc_thread_num` and `oc_thread_num` are tuning starting points. Adjust them according to available CPU cores and measured request throughput.\n"
+"- With `shared_memory_size_mb=40960`, reserve at least 20480 2 MiB huge pages:"
+msgstr ""
+"- `rpc_thread_num` 和 `oc_thread_num` 等线程数是调优的起点。请根据可用的 CPU 核心数和实测的请求吞吐量进行调整。\n"
