+msgid "### QoS Configuration"
+msgstr "### QoS 配置"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both the Mooncake and Memcache backends support configuring the transfer "
+"QoS. The valid range is **0-4 (integers only)**, and the default value is 0 "
+"when not configured. A larger value means a higher transfer priority. "
+"Invalid values (non-integer, out of range) cause startup to fail fast with a"
+" validation error."
+msgstr ""
+"Mooncake 和 Memcache 后端均支持配置传输 QoS。有效范围为 **0-4（仅限整数）**，未配置时默认值为 "
+"0。值越大表示传输优先级越高。无效值（非整数、超出范围）会导致启动时快速失败并报出校验错误。"
+
+msgid ""
+"QoS can be configured through `kv_connector_extra_config`, which is injected"
+" into the backend-specific configuration automatically:"
+msgstr "QoS 可通过 `kv_connector_extra_config` 进行配置，该配置会自动注入到后端特定的配置中："
+
+msgid "| Parameter | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
+msgstr "| 参数 | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `qos_priority` | int | 0 | No | [0, 4] (integer, larger = higher priority)"
+" | Supported by both Mooncake and Memcache backends. Invalid values (non-"
+"integer, out of range) cause fast startup failure. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `qos_priority` | int | 0 | 否 | [0, 4]（整数，越大优先级越高） | Mooncake 和 Memcache "
+"后端均支持。无效值（非整数、超出范围）会导致启动快速失败。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Values in `kv_connector_extra_config` take precedence over environment "
+"variables; a WARN log is emitted on override. For the Mooncake backend, "
+"`qos_priority` is merged into existing `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` "
+"(other fields preserved). When `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` was not set, "
+"configuring `qos_priority` also creates it."
+msgstr ""
+"`kv_connector_extra_config` 中的值优先于环境变量；发生覆盖时会输出 WARN 日志。对于 Mooncake "
+"后端，`qos_priority` 会合并到现有的 `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 中（其他字段保持不变）。当未设置 "
+"`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 时，配置 `qos_priority` 也会创建它。"
+
