+
+msgid ""
+"LoRA serves a frozen base model together with low-rank adapters. The client "
+"selects an adapter by setting `model` to the `name` registered in `--lora-"
+"modules`. The base weights stay loaded."
 msgstr ""
-"与vLLM一样，vllm-"
-"ascend也支持LoRA。具体用法和更多细节可参考[vLLM官方文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/)。"
+"LoRA 在服务时使用冻结的基础模型以及低秩适配器。客户端通过将 `model` 设置为在 `--lora-modules` 中注册的 `name` "
+"来选择适配器。基础权重保持加载状态。"
 
