 msgid ""
-"Other MoE quantization methods, Fused MC2, and dynamic EPLB are not "
-"supported with LoRA."
-msgstr "其他 MoE 量化方法、Fused MC2 和动态 EPLB 不支持与 LoRA 一起使用。"
+"For a fused PEFT MoE adapter, set `is_3d_lora_weight` to `true`. The expert "
+"LoRA weights are then one stacked tensor, such as `experts.gate_up_proj` and"
+" `experts.down_proj`. Per-expert keys use `false`. Non-MoE models ignore "
+"this field. Layout rules are in the upstream [LoRA "
+"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/)."
+msgstr ""
+"对于融合的 PEFT MoE 适配器，将 `is_3d_lora_weight` 设置为 `true`。此时专家 LoRA 权重是一个堆叠张量，例如 "
+"`experts.gate_up_proj` 和 `experts.down_proj`。按专家划分的键使用 `false`。非 MoE "
+"模型忽略此字段。布局规则参见上游 [LoRA 指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/)。"
+
+msgid "### `--max-loras` and `--max-lora-rank`"
+msgstr "### `--max-loras` 和 `--max-lora-rank`"
+
+msgid ""
+"`--max-lora-rank` must be one of 8, 16, 32, or 64, and it must be at least "
+"the rank `r` in `adapter_config.json`. `--max-loras 1` keeps a single device"
+" slot. That is the setting used by the fast path in the next section."
+msgstr ""
+"`--max-lora-rank` 必须是 8、16、32 或 64 之一，并且必须至少为 `adapter_config.json` 中的秩 "
+"`r`。`--max-loras 1` 保留单个设备槽位。这是下一节中快速路径所使用的设置。"
+
+msgid "### `--fully-sharded-loras`"
+msgstr "### `--fully-sharded-loras`"
+
+msgid ""
+"Without this flag, tensor parallelism shards only part of the LoRA "
+"computation. `--fully-sharded-loras` shards the rest as well. Use it when "
+"the sequence is long, the rank is high, or the tensor-parallel size is "
+"large. It does not change the request `model` name. The checked launches in "
+"this page leave it off."
+msgstr ""
+"如果不使用此标志，张量并行仅对 LoRA 计算的一部分进行分片。`--fully-sharded-loras` "
+"也会对其余部分进行分片。当序列较长、秩较高或张量并行规模较大时使用它。它不会改变请求的 `model` 名称。本页中已验证的启动命令均未启用它。"
+
+msgid "## Performance"
+msgstr "## 性能"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Single-slot fast path.** On Atlas A2 and Atlas A3, `--max-loras 1`, "
+"`--fully-sharded-loras` left off, BF16 weights, a rank in {8, 16, 32, 64}, "
+"and at most 128 tokens select two kernels. Shrink splits the long input "
+"dimension (split-K) so more compute units work on a small token count. "
+"Expand is fused: it reduces those partials, applies the adapter mask and "
+"scale, multiplies by B, and adds the delta into the base output in one "
+"launch. More than one active adapter, `--fully-sharded-loras`, or a rank "
+"outside that set stays on the general SGMV/BGMV path."
+msgstr ""
+"**单槽位快速路径。** 在 Atlas A2 和 Atlas A3 上，`--max-loras 1`、未启用 `--fully-sharded-"
+"loras`、BF16 权重、秩在 {8, 16, 32, 64} 中，且最多 128 个 token 时，会选择两个 kernel。Shrink "
+"对长输入维度进行切分（split-K），使更多计算单元在少量 token 上工作。Expand "
+"是融合的：它在一个启动中归约这些部分结果、应用适配器掩码和缩放、乘以 B，并将增量加到基础输出中。多于一个激活的适配器、启用 `--fully-"
+"sharded-loras`，或秩不在该集合中时，仍走通用的 SGMV/BGMV 路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Fully sharded LoRA.** Add `--fully-sharded-loras` when partial sharding is"
+" the limiter. This path does not use the fused single-slot kernels above."
+msgstr ""
+"**完全分片 LoRA。** 当部分分片成为瓶颈时，添加 `--fully-sharded-loras`。此路径不使用上述融合的单槽位 kernel。"
+
+msgid "## Usage Example"
+msgstr "## 使用示例"
+
+msgid "### Qwen3.5-27B"
+msgstr "### Qwen3.5-27B"
+
+msgid ""
+"To use the fully sharded path, add `--fully-sharded-loras` on the same "
+"command."
+msgstr "要使用完全分片路径，请在同一命令中添加 `--fully-sharded-loras`。"
+
+msgid "### Request"
+msgstr "### 请求"
+
+msgid ""
+"The two calls differ only in `model`. A base request uses the served model "
+"name and runs the frozen base weights only. A LoRA request uses the `name` "
+"from `--lora-modules` and adds that adapter on top of the same base. "
+"`base_model_name` inside `--lora-modules` is not a request name."
+msgstr ""
+"这两个调用仅在 `model` 上不同。基础请求使用服务模型名称，仅运行冻结的基础权重。LoRA 请求使用 `--lora-modules` 中的 "
+"`name`，并在同一基础之上添加该适配器。`--lora-modules` 中的 `base_model_name` 不是请求名称。"
+
+msgid "Base:"
+msgstr "基础："
+
+msgid "LoRA:"
+msgstr "LoRA："
+
+msgid ""
+"`Qwen3.5-27B` is the served base name from this example. If the launch sets "
+"`--served-model-name`, use that string instead. A successful call returns "
+"HTTP 200 and a non-empty `choices[0].message.content`."
+msgstr ""
+"`Qwen3.5-27B` 是本示例中服务的基座名称。如果启动时设置了 `--served-model-name`，请改用该字符串。成功的调用返回 "
+"HTTP 200 和非空的 `choices[0].message.content`。"
+
+msgid "## Dynamic LoRA"
+msgstr "## 动态 LoRA"
+
+msgid ""
+"The server can load and unload adapters after startup. Start it with "
+"`--enable-lora`, and set:"
+msgstr "服务器可以在启动后加载和卸载适配器。使用 `--enable-lora` 启动它，并设置："
+
+msgid ""
+"Load an adapter. `lora_name` is the `model` value used by later requests. "
+"`lora_path` is the adapter directory."
+msgstr "加载一个适配器。`lora_name` 是后续请求使用的 `model` 值。`lora_path` 是适配器目录。"
+
+msgid "Unload that adapter:"
+msgstr "卸载该适配器："
+
+msgid ""
+"A successful load returns `Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora' added "
+"successfully.` A successful unload returns `Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora'"
+" removed successfully.` After unload, requests with `\"model\": \"mix-"
+"lora\"` no longer select that adapter. The base model remains available."
+msgstr ""
+"成功加载返回 `Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora' added successfully.` 成功卸载返回 "
+"`Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora' removed successfully.` 卸载后，带有 `\"model\": "
+"\"mix-lora\"` 的请求不再选择该适配器。基础模型仍然可用。"
