+
+msgid "## Model Support for PP"
+msgstr "## PP 的模型支持"
+
+msgid ""
+"A model can run with `--pipeline-parallel-size > 1` only when its\n"
+"implementation exposes the `SupportsPP` interface (the upstream marker in\n"
+"`vllm.model_executor.models.interfaces`). The interface declares that the\n"
+"model implementation can:"
+msgstr ""
+"只有当模型的实现暴露了 `SupportsPP` 接口（`vllm.model_executor.models.interfaces` "
+"中的上游标记）时，该模型才能在 `--pipeline-parallel-size > 1` 的情况下运行。该接口声明模型实现可以："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Split its Transformer decoder layers into per-stage `[start_layer, end_layer)` ranges.\n"
+"- Skip layers that fall outside its own range.\n"
+"- Send and receive the intermediate activations exchanged at stage boundaries."
+msgstr ""
+"- 将其 Transformer 解码器层拆分为每个阶段的 `[start_layer, end_layer)` 范围。\n"
+"- 跳过其自身范围之外的层。\n"
+"- 发送和接收在阶段边界交换的中间激活值。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Models without this marker reject PP at startup, so checking support is\n"
+"mechanical: inspect the model class (or one of its parents) for\n"
+"`SupportsPP`, or check the **Pipeline Parallel** column in\n"
+"[Supported Models](../support_matrix/supported_models.md) for the validated\n"
+"per-model status on Ascend."
+msgstr ""
+"没有此标记的模型会在启动时拒绝 PP，因此检查支持情况是机械性的：检查模型类（或其某个父类）是否具有 "
+"`SupportsPP`，或查看[支持的模型](../support_matrix/supported_models.md)中的 **Pipeline "
+"Parallel** 列，以了解在昇腾上经过验证的各模型状态。"
+
+msgid "Model families with `SupportsPP` implementations on Ascend:"
+msgstr "在昇腾上具有 `SupportsPP` 实现的模型系列："
+
+msgid "| Model family | Variants with `SupportsPP` implementations |"
+msgstr "| 模型系列 | 具有 `SupportsPP` 实现的变体 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| DeepSeek-V4 | Text, multimodal, and MTP-drafter variants (Ascend "
+"implementation) |"
+msgstr "| DeepSeek-V4 | 文本、多模态和 MTP-drafter 变体（昇腾实现） |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| DeepSeek-V4.1 | Text and multimodal variants (Ascend implementation) |"
+msgstr "| DeepSeek-V4.1 | 文本和多模态变体（昇腾实现） |"
+
+msgid "| GLM-5.2 | Text variant (Ascend implementation) |"
+msgstr "| GLM-5.2 | 文本变体（昇腾实现） |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| MiniMax-M3 | Sparse text and multimodal variants (Ascend implementation) |"
+msgstr "| MiniMax-M3 | 稀疏文本和多模态变体（昇腾实现） |"
+
+msgid "| Qwen3.6 | Dense text and MoE variants (upstream implementation) |"
+msgstr "| Qwen3.6 | 稠密文本和 MoE 变体（上游实现） |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Kimi K3 | Text and multimodal variants (upstream implementation with an "
+"Ascend adapter) |"
+msgstr "| Kimi K3 | 文本和多模态变体（带昇腾适配器的上游实现） |"
+
+msgid ""
+"All other models use their upstream implementation, and when that\n"
+"implementation inherits `SupportsPP`, PP behaves the same way on Ascend.\n"
+"Note that speculative-decoding drafters are never partitioned across PP\n"
+"stages even when they carry the `SupportsPP` marker; they run on the last\n"
+"stage as described in [PP with Speculative Decoding](#pp-with-speculative-decoding)."
+msgstr ""
+"所有其他模型使用其上游实现，当该实现继承 `SupportsPP` 时，PP 在昇腾上的行为相同。请注意，即使投机解码的 drafter 带有 "
+"`SupportsPP` 标记，它们也绝不会跨 PP 阶段进行分区；它们如 [PP 与投机解码](#pp-with-speculative-"
+"decoding) 中所述在最后一个阶段运行。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` partitions only the target model. Draft-model layers\n"
+"are not included in its layer sum, and their weight naming and layer layout\n"
+"depend on the specific speculative-decoding implementation. On both model\n"
+"runners the drafter is loaded on the last PP stage rather than partitioned\n"
+"across PP stages. Therefore, the last stage can contain:"
+msgstr ""
+"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` 仅对目标模型进行分区。Draft "
+"模型的层不包含在其层数总和中，其权重命名和层布局取决于具体的投机解码实现。在两个模型运行器上，drafter 都加载在最后一个 PP 阶段，而不是跨 "
+"PP 阶段进行分区。因此，最后一个阶段可以包含："
+
+msgid ""
+"The following matrix lists the features that can be stacked with PP on\n"
+"Model Runner V2 (`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`). Unless noted otherwise,\n"
+"\"supported\" means the combination is enabled in code and exercised by CI."
+msgstr ""
+"以下矩阵列出了在 Model Runner V2（`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`）上可以与 PP "
+"叠加的功能。除非另有说明，“支持”意味着该组合已在代码中启用并由 CI 进行测试。"
+
+msgid "| Feature stacked with PP | Support |"
+msgstr "| 与 PP 叠加的功能 | 支持情况 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Graph mode (ACL graph) | Supported with `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`; validated with"
+" MTP stacks. |"
+msgstr "| 图模式（ACL graph） | 在 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 下支持；已通过 MTP 叠加验证。 |"
+
+msgid "| MTP | Supported. |"
+msgstr "| MTP | 支持。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| EAGLE3 | Supported only for MiniMax-M3 sparse models; the upstream Model "
+"Runner V2 restriction is lifted for these architectures. |"
+msgstr "| EAGLE3 | 仅支持 MiniMax-M3 稀疏模型；针对这些架构解除了上游 Model Runner V2 的限制。 |"
+
+msgid "| DFlash | Not supported. |"
+msgstr "| DFlash | 不支持。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| DSpark | Supported only for DeepSeek-V4 and GLM-5.2 MoE-DSA models. The "
+"drafter taps intermediate target layers, and the tapped hidden states are "
+"relayed across PP stages. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| DSpark | 仅支持 DeepSeek-V4 和 GLM-5.2 MoE-DSA 模型。drafter 会抽取中间目标层，抽取的隐藏状态会跨 "
+"PP 阶段中继。 |"
+
+msgid "| PCP (Prefill Context Parallel) | Not supported. |"
+msgstr "| PCP（Prefill Context Parallel） | 不支持。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| DCP (Decode Context Parallel) | Supported; use `MooncakeConnectorV2` for "
+"KV transfer. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| DCP（Decode Context Parallel） | 支持；使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 进行 KV 传输。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| LayerSplit (KVPP) | Supported. An intermittent output-mismatch issue in "
+"the e2e test is under investigation. |"
+msgstr "| LayerSplit（KVPP） | 支持。e2e 测试中偶发的输出不匹配问题正在调查中。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| KV offloading (Sparse KV Cache Offload) | Supported with the layerwise "
+"connector. |"
+msgstr "| KV 卸载（Sparse KV Cache Offload） | 使用 layerwise 连接器时支持。 |"
+
+msgid "| Prefix caching | Supported. |"
+msgstr "| 前缀缓存 | 支持。 |"
+
+msgid "| Pooling | Supported. |"
+msgstr "| Pooling | 支持。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| P/D disaggregation | Supported with PP on the Prefill node only; the "
+"Decode node must use `PP1`. |"
+msgstr "| P/D 分离 | 仅在 Prefill 节点上支持与 PP 组合；Decode 节点必须使用 `PP1`。 |"
+
+msgid "| Async scheduling | Supported. |"
+msgstr "| 异步调度 | 支持。 |"
+
+msgid "| Sequence parallelism | Supported. |"
+msgstr "| 序列并行 | 支持。 |"
+
+msgid "Notes for speculative decoding with PP on Model Runner V2:"
+msgstr "在 Model Runner V2 上使用 PP 进行投机解码的注意事项："
+
+msgid ""
+"- DSpark drafts from taps on intermediate target layers\n"
+"  (`dspark_target_layer_ids`). Taps that fall on an earlier PP stage are\n"
+"  relayed to the drafter on the last stage automatically. When customizing\n"
+"  `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION`, keep the tap list inside the target model so the\n"
+"  drafter's input width stays valid."
+msgstr ""
+"- DSpark 从中间目标层的抽取点进行 draft（`dspark_target_layer_ids`）。落在较早 PP "
+"阶段的抽取点会自动中继到最后一个阶段的 drafter。自定义 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` "
+"时，请将抽取点列表保持在目标模型内，以确保 drafter 的输入宽度保持有效。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- PP cannot be combined with Prefill Context Parallelism (PCP). See\n"
+"  [Context Parallel](context_parallel.md).\n"
+"- Xlite graph mode is not compatible with PP.\n"
+"- Sparse KV Cache Offload supports PP with the layerwise connector.\n"
+"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` currently requires the Decode-side PP size to be `1`.\n"
+"- For cross-node MoE deployments over RoCE, PP and DP cannot currently be\n"
+"  enabled together because the `MoeDistributeDispatch` communication path does\n"
+"  not support this combined topology.\n"
+"- Feature combinations remain model-specific. Check the relevant feature guide\n"
+"  before production deployment."
+msgstr ""
+"- PP 不能与 Prefill Context Parallelism（PCP）组合使用。请参阅[上下文并行](context_parallel.md)。\n"
+"- Xlite 图模式与 PP 不兼容。\n"
+"- Sparse KV Cache Offload 使用 layerwise 连接器时支持 PP。\n"
+"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` 目前要求 Decode 侧的 PP 大小为 `1`。\n"
+"- 对于通过 RoCE 的跨节点 MoE 部署，PP 和 DP 目前无法同时启用，因为 `MoeDistributeDispatch` 通信路径不支持这种组合拓扑。\n"
+"- 功能组合仍然因模型而异。在生产部署前请查看相关功能指南。"
diff --git a/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/user_guide/feature_guide/rl.po b/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/user_guide/feature_guide/rl.po
