@@ -765,3 +765,116 @@ msgid ""
 msgstr ""
 "更多详细信息，请参阅\n"
 "[vLLM 社区文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/speculative_decoding/adaptive_verification/)。"
+
+msgid "## Speculating using DFlash2"
+msgstr "## 使用 DFlash2 进行推测解码"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding where\n"
+"proposals are generated by a **DFlash2** draft model. DFlash2 keeps DFlash's\n"
+"parallel block-drafting input layout, but instead of taking the per-position\n"
+"argmax token, the draft proposes a top-k candidate set for every draft\n"
+"position and a candidate-selector head walks the highest-scoring path through\n"
+"the candidate lattice."
+msgstr ""
+"以下代码配置 vLLM Ascend 使用推测解码，其中候选 token 由 **DFlash2** 草稿模型生成。DFlash2 保留了 DFlash"
+" 的并行块草稿输入布局，但不再取每个位置的 argmax token，而是为每个草稿位置提出一个 top-k "
+"候选集，并由候选选择器头在候选格中走出得分最高的路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"There is no separate `dflash2` method value: keep `\"method\": \"dflash\"` — when\n"
+"the draft checkpoint's architecture is `DFlash2DraftModel` (e.g.\n"
+"`z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2`), the DFlash2 drafter is selected automatically."
+msgstr ""
+"没有单独的 `dflash2` 方法值：请保持 `\"method\": \"dflash\"` —— 当草稿检查点的架构为 "
+"`DFlash2DraftModel`（例如 `z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2`）时，会自动选择 DFlash2 草稿模型。"
+
+msgid "### How it works"
+msgstr "### 工作原理"
+
+msgid ""
+"Each decode step drafts one block of `num_speculative_tokens` tokens in\n"
+"parallel, exactly like DFlash: one bonus query (the last verified token,\n"
+"the *anchor*) followed by K masked queries."
+msgstr ""
+"每个解码步骤并行草拟一个包含 `num_speculative_tokens` 个 token 的块，与 DFlash 完全一致：一个 bonus "
+"查询（最后一个已验证的 token，即*锚点*）后跟 K 个掩码查询。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. The draft model runs the block in one forward pass. Its decoder layers\n"
+"   wrap the attention and MLP sublayers with learned block-causal grouped\n"
+"   convolutions that mix information across the K+1 query positions.\n"
+"2. The draft's hidden states go through the **target model's LM head**\n"
+"   (shared, unquantized): the full-vocabulary logits are top-k'd per draft\n"
+"   position, giving `selector_top_k` candidate tokens per step.\n"
+"3. A **candidate selector** head scores every edge of the candidate lattice:\n"
+"   a per-candidate unary logit plus a bilinear term between predecessor and\n"
+"   successor token codebooks and the projected hidden state.\n"
+"4. A path walk picks the highest-scoring chain of candidates starting from\n"
+"   the anchor token — greedily on the default model runner, or with\n"
+"   Gumbel-max sampling at the request temperature on model runner V2. On V2\n"
+"   the selected path's scores are also scattered back into full-vocabulary\n"
+"   draft logits for the rejection sampler."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 草稿模型在一次前向传播中运行该块。其解码器层用学习到的块因果分组卷积\n"
+"   包裹注意力和 MLP 子层，从而在 K+1 个查询位置之间混合信息。\n"
+"2. 草稿的隐藏状态经过**目标模型的 LM head**\n"
+"   （共享、未量化）：对全词表 logits 按每个草稿位置取 top-k，\n"
+"   得到每步 `selector_top_k` 个候选 token。\n"
+"3. **候选选择器**头为候选格的每条边打分：\n"
+"   每个候选的一元 logit，加上前驱与后继 token 码本之间\n"
+"   以及投影隐藏状态之间的双线性项。\n"
+"4. 路径游走从锚点 token 开始，选出得分最高的候选链 ——\n"
+"   在默认模型运行器上为贪心，或在模型运行器 V2 上按请求温度进行\n"
+"   Gumbel-max 采样。在 V2 上，所选路径的分数还会被散射回全词表\n"
+"   草稿 logits，供拒绝采样器使用。"
+
+msgid "A few important things to consider when using DFlash2 draft models:"
+msgstr "使用 DFlash2 草稿模型时需要注意以下几点："
+
+msgid ""
+"1. **Draft sampling**: on the default model runner, DFlash2 always drafts\n"
+"   greedily — `\"draft_sample_method\": \"probabilistic\"` is rejected. Model\n"
+"   runner V2 supports both greedy (the default) and probabilistic sampling:"
+msgstr ""
+"1. **草稿采样**：在默认模型运行器上，DFlash2 始终以贪心方式草拟 ——\n"
+"   `\"draft_sample_method\": \"probabilistic\"` 会被拒绝。模型\n"
+"   运行器 V2 同时支持贪心（默认）和概率采样："
+
+msgid ""
+"2. **Model runner V2 requires an eager draft**: DFlash2 on model runner V2\n"
+"   does not yet support graph mode for the draft. Set `\"enforce_eager\": true`\n"
+"   in `speculative_config`; the target model keeps its own graph mode (e.g.\n"
+"   `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`)."
+msgstr ""
+"2. **模型运行器 V2 要求草稿使用 eager 模式**：模型运行器 V2 上的 DFlash2\n"
+"   尚不支持草稿的图模式。请在 `speculative_config` 中设置\n"
+"   `\"enforce_eager\": true`；目标模型保留其自身的图模式（例如\n"
+"   `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`）。"
+
+msgid ""
+"3. **Graph capture sizes**: each decode step runs `(1 + K)` tokens per\n"
+"   request, so every capture size must be `n * (num_speculative_tokens + 1)`\n"
+"   for each batch size `n` you want to support — `[9]` above, for batch size\n"
+"   1 with `num_speculative_tokens = 8`."
+msgstr ""
+"3. **图捕获大小**：每个解码步骤对每个请求运行 `(1 + K)` 个 token，\n"
+"   因此对于每个要支持的批大小 `n`，每个捕获大小必须为\n"
+"   `n * (num_speculative_tokens + 1)` —— 上面的 `[9]` 对应批大小\n"
+"   1 且 `num_speculative_tokens = 8`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"4. **The draft must use the target's unquantized LM head**: the candidate\n"
+"   top-k is taken over the full-vocabulary logits, so a reduced draft\n"
+"   vocabulary is not supported."
+msgstr ""
+"4. **草稿必须使用目标模型未量化的 LM head**：候选\n"
+"   top-k 是在全词表 logits 上取得的，因此不支持缩减的草稿\n"
+"   词表。"
+
+msgid ""
+"5. The selector parameters (`selector_top_k`, `selector_rank`, ...) come from\n"
+"   the draft checkpoint's `dflash_config` and need no user configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"5. 选择器参数（`selector_top_k`、`selector_rank` 等）来自\n"
+"   草稿检查点的 `dflash_config`，无需用户配置。"
