+msgid "## v0.30.0rc1 - 2026.10.11"
+msgstr "## v0.30.0rc1 - 2026.10.11"
+
+msgid ""
+"This is vLLM Ascend v0.30.0rc1, a model-focused release built on the v0.29 "
+"release line and aligned with upstream vLLM v0.30.0 via the main2main "
+"pipeline. This release focuses on four flagship models: **DeepSeek V4.1**, "
+"**GLM-5.3**, **GLM-5.3-Flash**, and **Qwen3.8-27B**, and hardens the shared "
+"execution stacks they rely on (Model Runner V2, PCP/DCP parallelism, KV "
+"Cache Pool, and speculative decoding). Model or hardware combinations "
+"outside the scope declared below are not part of the release claims. Please "
+"follow the [official "
+"documentation](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.30.0rc1/) to get "
+"started."
+msgstr ""
+"这是 vLLM Ascend v0.30.0rc1，一个以模型为核心的版本，基于 v0.29 发布线构建，并通过 main2main 流程与上游 "
+"vLLM v0.30.0 对齐。本版本聚焦四个旗舰模型：**DeepSeek V4.1**、**GLM-5.3**、**GLM-5.3-Flash** "
+"和 **Qwen3.8-27B**，并强化了它们所依赖的共享执行栈（Model Runner V2、PCP/DCP 并行、KV Cache Pool "
+"以及投机解码）。以下声明范围之外的模型或硬件组合不属于本版本的发布承诺。请参阅[官方文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.30.0rc1/)开始使用。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- **DeepSeek V4.1**: Added DeepSeek V4.1 support on Model Runner V2 with TurboQuant 4-bit latent KV cache (including packed KV cache in the V1 runner), enabled torch.compile, and sped up startup via in-place rotary embedding, reused filtered RoPE lookups, and removed redundant DSV4.1 indexer/SP copies; fixed ModelSlim-quantized DSV4 weight layout and added AscendStore preparation for V4.1, and packaged attention operators (QLI/QSLI/MQSMLA) with DSL. [#17927](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17927) [#16899](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16899) [#17726](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17726) [#17676](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17676) [#18026](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18026) [#18081](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18081) [#16548](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16548) [#16978](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16978) [#17067](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17067) [#17165](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17165) [#17483](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17483) [#16973](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16973)\n"
+"- **GLM-5.3**: Enabled sparse SFA C8 (INT8 packed KV cache) for GLM-5.3-Flash and indexer MXFP4 for GLM-5.2, fixed GLM MRV2 issues and GLM-5.2 DSpark sequence lengths/per-request FIA bounds, fixed GLM-5.3-Flash small slot page inflation, and backported always-on reasoning for GLM-5.3. [#17115](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17115) [#17949](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17949) [#18060](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18060) [#17613](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17613) [#17571](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17571) [#17545](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17545) [#17876](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17876)\n"
+"- **GLM-5.3-Flash**: Added KV Pool support for non-layerwise pooling and Mamba in Mooncake layerwise, added layerwise memcache DRAM/SSD pooling, optimized Triton KPool and gated norm, supported GQA decode context parallelism and SFA-only DSA CP, and provided P/D and KV cache pool deployment guides. [#16945](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16945) [#17287](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17287) [#17698](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17698) [#17542](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17542) [#16478](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16478) [#17990](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17990) [#17987](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17987) [#17773](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17773) [#17946](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17946)\n"
+"- **Qwen3.8-27B**: Supported non-contiguous KV cache in hybrid linear-attention models, respected per-layer KV cache dtype and kept KV cache contiguous for paged attention, restored C8 V scales on hybrid cache page reassignment, restored Mamba block tables before deferred PP postprocessing, added the FLA NPU backend for GDN prefill, and fixed 310P performance and kernel compatibility for quantized deployment. [#14340](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/14340) [#17924](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17924) [#18003](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18003) [#17956](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17956) [#17954](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17954) [#17565](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17565) [#17534](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17534) [#16420](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16420) [#17964](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17964) [#17278](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17278)\n"
+"- **Platform & Execution**: Aligned the plugin with upstream vLLM v0.30.0 via the main2main pipeline, extended Model Runner V2 with fine-grained TP (MLP, embedding, o_proj in graph mode) and async CPP scheduling (default-on was evaluated and rolled back pending further hardening), landed the EPLB STAIR placement policy, enhanced PCP (sharded embedding/LM head and O projection weights, PCP+DCP stacking, graph-executed decode sharding). [#16527](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16527) [#17361](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17361) [#16967](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16967) [#17380](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17380) [#17661](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17661) [#17514](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17514) [#17512](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17512) [#17511](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17511) [#17509](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17509) [#17510](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17510) [#17508](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17508) [#17159](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17159) [#17502](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17502) [#17598](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17598) [#17456](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17456) [#17958](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17958) [#17940](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17940) [#18065](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18065) [#17112](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17112) [#17150](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17150) [#17157](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17157)"
+msgstr ""
+"- **DeepSeek V4.1**：在 Model Runner V2 上新增 DeepSeek V4.1 支持，采用 TurboQuant 4-bit 潜在 KV cache（包括 V1 runner 中的 packed KV cache），启用 torch.compile，并通过原地 rotary embedding、复用过滤后的 RoPE 查找以及移除冗余的 DSV4.1 indexer/SP 拷贝来加速启动；修复了 ModelSlim 量化的 DSV4 权重布局，并为 V4.1 新增 AscendStore 准备，同时使用 DSL 打包了注意力算子（QLI/QSLI/MQSMLA）。[#17927](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17927) [#16899](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16899) [#17726](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17726) [#17676](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17676) [#18026](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18026) [#18081](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18081) [#16548](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16548) [#16978](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16978) [#17067](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17067) [#17165](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17165) [#17483](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17483) [#16973](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16973)\n"
+"- **GLM-5.3**：为 GLM-5.3-Flash 启用稀疏 SFA C8（INT8 packed KV cache），为 GLM-5.2 启用 indexer MXFP4，修复了 GLM MRV2 问题以及 GLM-5.2 DSpark 序列长度/每请求 FIA 边界，修复了 GLM-5.3-Flash 小 slot page 膨胀问题，并为 GLM-5.3 回合了始终开启的推理能力。[#17115](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17115) [#17949](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17949) [#18060](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18060) [#17613](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17613) [#17571](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17571) [#17545](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17545) [#17876](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17876)\n"
+"- **GLM-5.3-Flash**：新增对非逐层池化以及 Mooncake 逐层 Mamba 的 KV Pool 支持，新增逐层 memcache DRAM/SSD 池化，优化了 Triton KPool 和 gated norm，支持 GQA decode 上下文并行和仅 SFA 的 DSA CP，并提供了 P/D 和 KV cache pool 部署指南。[#16945](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16945) [#17287](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17287) [#17698](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17698) [#17542](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17542) [#16478](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16478) [#17990](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17990) [#17987](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17987) [#17773](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17773) [#17946](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17946)\n"
+"- **Qwen3.8-27B**：支持混合线性注意力模型中的非连续 KV cache，遵循逐层 KV cache dtype 并保持 KV cache 连续以用于 paged attention，在混合 cache page 重新分配时恢复 C8 V scales，在延迟 PP 后处理前恢复 Mamba block tables，为 GDN prefill 新增 FLA NPU 后端，并修复了 310P 在量化部署下的性能和 kernel 兼容性问题。[#14340](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/14340) [#17924](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17924) [#18003](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18003) [#17956](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17956) [#17954](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17954) [#17565](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17565) [#17534](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17534) [#16420](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16420) [#17964](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17964) [#17278](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17278)\n"
+"- **平台与执行**：通过 main2main 流水线使插件与上游 vLLM v0.30.0 对齐，扩展 Model Runner V2 支持细粒度 TP（图模式下的 MLP、embedding、o_proj）和异步 CPP 调度（默认开启经过评估后已回退，待进一步加固），落地 EPLB STAIR 放置策略，增强 PCP（分片 embedding/LM head 和 O projection 权重、PCP+DCP 叠加、图执行的 decode 分片）。[#16527](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16527) [#17361](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17361) [#16967](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16967) [#17380](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17380) [#17661](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17661) [#17514](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17514) [#17512](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17512) [#17511](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17511) [#17509](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17509) [#17510](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17510) [#17508](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17508) [#17159](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17159) [#17502](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17502) [#17598](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17598) [#17456](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17456) [#17958](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17958) [#17940](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17940) [#18065](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18065) [#17112](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17112) [#17150](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17150) [#17157](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17157)"
