+"- 优化 DeepSeek V4 TurboQuant 框架路径。[#18127](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18127)\n"
+"- 将 KV save fence 缩小到已释放 block 的请求。[#18094](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/18094)\n"
+"- 借助 AscendStore 减少 PP save 同步和 `SchedulerOutput` deepcopy 开销。[#15636](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/15636)\n"
